\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 850 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token continues to rise, outperforming the broader crypto market and a strengthening market set up points to further upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continued its uptrend on Dec. 3, rising 17% over the last 24 hours to trade at $1.27. The over 280% price growth since Nov. 5 has seen the layer-1 token rise to a 32-month high of $1.32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c0c-f0c8-7c2b-b2a4-cc532ea4c455"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/HtZNqKJp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s explore why the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price is up today.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  reenters top-10 cryptocurrencies\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has rallied more than 32% over the last seven days and 273% over the last month, reaching $1.32 for the first time since January 2022. With an accompanying growth in its market capitalization, the token has cemented its position among the top 10 largest cryptocurrencies by market value.\par \par \uc2 The token\u8217\'20\'19s market cap now exceeds $44 billion, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  now ranks behind BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  and Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 It is now valued more than USDC ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC }}}\uc2  ), a 1:1 dollar-pegged stablecoin, which has slipped to ninth place with a market value of $39.9 billion, and Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ), now ranked 10th with a market value of $20 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c0d-a18d-78cb-982a-66c68ec84c0c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of 10 largest cryptocurrencies by market cap. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap }}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s futures open interest (OI) surged to a 40-month high of $1.18 billion on Dec. 3, according to CoinGlass data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-open-interest-in-the-crypto-futures-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Open interest }}}\uc2  is the total number of outstanding contracts in a derivatives market. An increase in OI, accompanied by price growth, signifies confidence in the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c0d-ffc2-7241-97ab-e0d7ace37b2a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  open interest. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s spot exchange volume and net flow data align with today\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance, showing increased trading and exchange inflows in the past 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c0e-53ca-7123-a3e5-cf94d808149d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Spot Exchange Volume and Net Flow. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Whale accumulation backs \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-whales-ada-price-analysis-down-20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano whales }}}\uc2  took advantage of the drop to $0.875 on Nov. 26. Data from IntoTheBlock shows that whale addresses holding between 10 million and 100 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  have increased sharply throughout November. Over the last week, these large investors have accumulated approximately $276 million worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c0e-d1d2-7f48-83f6-7789d2c78e13"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Total addresses between 10M and 100M \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 This buying appears to be the momentum behind \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s move above the $1.30 psychological level, as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s large holders believe in higher prices ahead.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Mean Coin Age metric provides valuable insight into the token\u8217\'20\'19s holder behavior. While \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s extraordinary performance in November triggered significant profit-taking activity, the last seven days have seen a notable shift in this pattern, as shown in the figure below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c0f-aa7a-73a3-8118-a07952058e72"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Mean Coin Age. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 The metric\u8217\'20\'19s upward trajectory suggests that long-term holders prefer maintaining their current positions. This suggests investor behavior could shift from profit-taking to accumulation once again.\par \par \uc2 Noted: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-founder-predicts-bitcoin-defi-will-dominate-crypto-within-3-years"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano founder predicts Bitcoin DeFi will dominate crypto within 3 years }}}\par \par \uc2 Strong support for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the downside\par \par \uc2 With \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price trading at $1.27, traders appear to have established a strong demand zone around the $1.20 price.\par \par \uc2 Data from IntoTheBlock {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.intotheblock.com/market-intelligence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows }}}\uc2  that between $1.17 and $1.21, over 79,580 \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  addresses had moved 197.86 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens for an average price of $1.19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c10-1ab0-7c29-9f16-10c2599063c1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano IOMAP chart. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 The same IOMAP chart above shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  sits on relatively strong support on the downside compared to the resistance above.\par \par \uc2 This view is echoed by pseudonymous technical analyst Sssebi, who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Av_Sebastian/status/1863872802752708678"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 says }}}\uc2  that there is not much resistance for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  after it broke a key resistance level at $1.25, retesting it and switching it into support in the four-hour timeframe.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C$\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is getting ready for another leg up.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Zooming out, the technical setup reveals that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has broken out of a multiyear downtrend. The weekly chart below shows that the 200-period simple moving average (SMA) at $0.76 is another area of strong support for the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price.\par \par \uc2 The moving average convergence divergence ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-5-ways-investors-can-use-the-macd-indicator-to-make-better-trades"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MACD }}}\uc2  ) indicator continues its upward trajectory in the positive region.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal that occurred during the week ending Nov. 8 when the MACD line (blue) crossed above the signal line (orange) is still in play, suggesting that the market conditions still favor the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938c10-bd32-7898-8c5f-b2f0ad143687"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/VlTxYGPw/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD sustains the uptrend, the $2.40 level represents the next big target for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241203ekc30002t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
