\par\par \b \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Gains Over 420%, While Hedera (HBAR) Surges over 700%. Altcoins Lead the Gains\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 892 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 December 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Market Cap Exceeds $150 Billion}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) Gains Over 700% in the 30-Day Charts}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Gains 18%}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana-Based Memecoin Husky Inu (HINU) Presale Nears $600K}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoin gains are topping the charts with massive gains across the board. Ripple (XRP) and Hedera (HBAR) are leading the surge, with 420% and 710% gains, respectively, over the past month.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins continue to dominate the news with their massive gains. Notable projects include Ripple (XRP), which has risen by over 90% in the past week, and Hedera (HBAR), which has surged by 166%.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s delve into the latest altcoin gainers, expected to surge further as we near the altcoin season.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Market Cap Exceeds $150 Billion\par \par \uc2 Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s XRP has gained massively over the past month and is now the third-largest crypto with a market capitalization exceeding $150 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  has witnessed a spectacular gain in value after news of Gary Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s planned exit surfaced. Ripple Labs has been embroiled in a highly publicized legal battle with the securities agency for which Ripple paid a hefty price. In 2020, the regulator sued Ripple for its supposed breach of securities laws, resulting in many exchanges, such as Coinbase, Kraken, Bitstamp, and Gemini, choosing to delist XRP. Ripple finally found some relief after a partial victory in 2023 ended the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s 3-year-long crusade against the company. The Southern District of New York Court delivered a partial victory to Ripple in its matter with the SEC after Judge Analisa Torres {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/07/xrp-value-soars-as-relisting-wave-follows-ripple-s-sec-victory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruled}}}\uc2  that Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s XRP token is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot necessarily a security on its face.\u8221\'20\'1D XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price gained over 29% in the past week with a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook.\par \par \uc2 Ripple received some further \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news after Chris Giancarlo, former chair of the CFTC, predicted the SEC would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/former-cftc-chair-predicts-sec-will-drop-ripple-case"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop}}}\uc2  its case against the company. The price of XRP surged further after WisdomTree filed an S-1 application for a spot XRP ETF.\par \par \uc2 Hedera (HBAR) Gains Over 700% in the 30-Day Charts\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/hedera/#About"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hedera (HBAR)}}}\uc2  is the most widely used, sustainable, enterprise-grade public network for the decentralized economy that allows businesses and individuals to create powerful and robust decentralized applications (dApps). Hedera\u8217\'20\'19s native cryptocurrency, HBAR, powers the network and its services, such as smart contracts and transactions, and it is used to help secure the network. HBAR became a headline act in recent weeks, which resulted in a 700% gain in the past month. The price skyrocketed after traders identified a \u8220\'20\'1Cgolden cross\u8221\'20\'1D signal. A golden cross is regarded as a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicator in the crypto market and forms when a short-term moving average crosses above a long-term moving average.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Gains 18%\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is another major gainer since Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s election victory. On-chain metrics show Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s weekly active addresses elevated since the crypto market rally triggered by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s win on November 6 began. The surge in network usage and whale buying activity has resulted in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  further surged after the Cardano blockchain developers, the Cardano Foundation, released an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/proposal-for-cardano-constitution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 updated proposal for the Cardano Constitution}}}\uc2  to improve network governance. The revised proposal includes changes to constitutional workshops, social media discussion, and expert and community feedback. The changes aim to \u8220\'20\'1Cimprove the accessibility and clarity of the Cardano governance framework,\u8221\'20\'1D shifting its focus to a less technical audience. Interest in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) surged after its founder, Charles Hoskinson, revealed plans to help shape US crypto policy under Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s incoming administration.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s gained over 36% in the past week and over 17% in the past day. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  is currently trading at $1.28.\par \par \uc2 Solana-Based Memecoin Husky Inu (HINU) Presale Nears $600K\par \par \uc2 As BTC continues to trade around $95,000 and top altcoins reach new heights, investors must look for well-priced alternative investment opportunities to profit from the bull run, and Husky Inu is precisely that.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)}}}\uc2  is the latest Solana-based memecoin to grace the market. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/top-memecoins-to-invest-in-hinu-shib-floki-and-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  was created to bring its holders more value and utility by leveraging this robust blockchain. The project and its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/exciting-memecoins-to-watch-in-2024-shib-floki-doge-and-hinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU}}}\uc2 , want to make their mark on the saturated memecoin market by building a supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solana-memecoins-to-watch-hinu-maga-bonk-and-dawgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  recently launched the presale for HINU, and the fundraising has attracted a fair amount of attention. Since going live, the presale has generated over $593,000 and will soon reach its fundraising target.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s presale success is powered by its unique qualities and future plans, aiming to its own Earn App and Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the projects and completing minor tasks such as liking, reposting, and sharing content. Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading and, in doing so, will improve the utility and value of HINU for its holders.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241204ekc30000y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/2: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,767 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 December 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After a 40% gain in November, Bitcoin is consolidating below $100,000. Will altcoins do the same?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5Mzg4NmEtZWU0NC03ZGU2LWEyYjctZTQwZjkyZmVlMDNm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/2: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, SOL, BNB, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) dipped below $95,000, but lower levels attracted buyers. Undeterred by Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rally toward $100,000, the two {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-purchased-1-5-billion-in-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largest corporate holders }}}\uc2  of Bitcoin, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  and \uc2 MARA Holdings\uc2 , have continued to build their stockpile with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mara-holdings-acquires-600-million-of-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fresh purchases in the past few weeks }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Traders remain optimistic about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s prospects in December following the 37% gains in November. 10x Research founder and CEO Markus Thielen told Cointelegraph that Bitcoin has averaged \u8220\'20\'1Ca remarkable +28%\u8221\'20\'1D in December during halving years, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-begun-price-discovery-stage-crypto-trader"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posting positive returns in all of them }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938861-8b28-7c7b-97b5-923ad1138ebb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 Long-term investors are likely to view any dip in the near term as a buying opportunity. Analysts say that Bitcoin is expected to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-us-dollar-gains-ever-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pick up momentum after it breaks above $100,000 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe real FOMO begins above $100K. Once the epic sell wall falls, we enter a supply vacuum with a new retail-driven infinite bid. Do the math,\u8221\'20\'1D said Capriole Investments founder Charles Edwards in a post on X.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin resume its uptrend or enter a consolidation, shifting focus to altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) made a new all-time high on Dec. 2, indicating strong demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938862-1f2a-70a3-a6a4-4c97918317a4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the positive zone indicate that buyers are in command. If the price maintains above 6,000, the index could soar to 6,221 and later to 6,500.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to yank the price below the 50-day simple moving average (5,845). If they do that, the index could start a deeper correction toward 5,670.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) turned down sharply from the overhead resistance of 108 but is finding support at the 20-day exponential moving average (105.93).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938862-c5a8-7116-81cf-06c45aca5a0a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price toward 108, but the bears are expected to defend the level with all their might. The flattening 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. That could signal a range-bound action between the 20-day EMA and 108 in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to sink and maintain the price below the 20-day EMA to seize control. The index may then descend to the 50-day SMA (104.15).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing solid resistance at the psychologically crucial level of $100,000. The failure to cross above the overhead resistance may tempt short-term buyers to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938863-5c50-7a85-ba16-daa0618eb978"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($92,534). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to drive the BTC/USDT pair above $100,000. If they can pull it off, the pair could soar to $113,331 and then to $125,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break below the 20-day EMA increases the likelihood of a range formation in the near term. The pair could drop to $90,000 and later to $85,000. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $85,000 to $90,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the downtrend line, but the bulls are struggling to push the price to $3,900.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938863-ee58-7e37-9552-625799c54b6e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to make a comeback by pulling the price below the 20-day EMA ($3,379), but the bulls are expected to buy the dips aggressively. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the possibility of a rally to $4,094 increases.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that the breakout above the downtrend line may have been a bull trap. That could increase the selling pressure, pulling the ETH/USDT pair to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) resumed its up move after breaking out of $1.63 on Nov. 29. The $1.97 level was expected to act as a solid resistance, but the buyers easily surpassed the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938864-848c-79bf-aa0f-e81bba793fdd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could reach $3 and later attempt a retest of the all-time high at $3.84. The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought territory, which increases the risk of a sharp pullback. Traders should be ready for increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and exercise caution.\par \par \uc2 The $2 level is likely to act as a strong support during pullbacks. Sellers will have to pull and maintain the price below $2 to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled Solana ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($230), indicating that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938865-1928-7f7c-a1ee-a3dd5f0d22cb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is minor support at $222, but if the level gives way, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the breakout level of $210. This is an important level for the buyers to protect if they want to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intact. If the price turns up from $210, it will signal that the level is acting as a new floor.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a close above $236 could start an up move to $265. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at $265, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could rally to $304.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $677 on Nov. 30, indicating that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance of $687.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938865-98fc-7bff-95d8-dc6cb5f2e521"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($635) is the first support on the downside. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to propel the BNB/USDT pair above $687. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $722.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the 20-day EMA breaks, the pair could slump to the 50-day SMA ($609). This is an essential level for the bulls to protect because a break below it could sink the pair to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price stuck? }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) formed an outside-day candlestick pattern on Dec. 2, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938866-46f9-7e60-b845-4f55b26e56a0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up move is likely to face selling at the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line. If the price turns down from the resistance line, it will signal that the DOGE/USDT pair may spend some more time inside the channel.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the channel will suggest profit booking by short-term traders. That may pull the price down to $0.33 and later to $0.30. Alternatively, a break and close above the channel could clear the path for a rally to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the $1.15 overhead resistance, signaling the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938866-d828-7f91-8a6e-03d6f91c8736"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to $1.25, which is likely to behave as a stiff hurdle. If the price turns down from $1.25 but rises from $1.15, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That improves the prospects of a break above $1.25. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then surge to $1.64.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price fails to maintain above $1.15, it will indicate that the bears are selling on rallies. The price may dip to $1 and thereafter to the 20-day EMA ($0.91).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ) has sprinted toward $51, where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938867-55bb-793c-a9ce-9a0dc17f46d3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, MicroStrategy, S&P 500 }}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $51, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could dip to the 20-day EMA ($40.19). The upsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone indicate advantage to buyers. A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA improves the prospects of a rally above $51. That could push the pair to $60.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA to make a comeback. The pair may then slump to $38, which is expected to behave as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5Mzg4NmEtZWU0NC03ZGU2LWEyYjctZTQwZjkyZmVlMDNm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241202ekc2000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
