\u8212\'20\'14reaching highs not seen in seven years and flipping the market capitalization of Solana in the process.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5MzgzZWYtOWJhYS03MDliLTg5NzktOGM2MGZkN2U2YjM3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple's XRP token flips Solana's market capitalization }}}\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) token flipped Solana's ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) market capitalization for the first time during the current market cycle on December 1, 2024 \u8212\'20\'14 making XRP the fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market cap.\par \par \uc2 According to data from CoinMarketCap, XRP currently has a market cap of over $122 billion at the time of this writing, compared to \uc2 Solana\uc2 's $111.9 billion.\par \par \uc2 The native token of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  has been on a tear in recent weeks \u8212\'20\'14 kicking off a rally beginning on November 10 and peaking at a price of $2.19 on December 1 \u8212\'20\'14 marking a seven-year high for the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 XRP's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-43-month-highs-rally-over-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 meteoric price performance }}}\uc2  can be attributed to a growing number of key partnerships, new product developments from \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2 , the possibility of an XRP ETF, and unsubstantiated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/vandell33/status/1848202720668172391"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rumors }}}\uc2  that Elon Musk would make a sizable investment into XRP and \uc2 Ripple\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-12/01938427-3eeb-7465-ac89-165982cfe5e0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple's XRP token flips Solana's market capitalization }}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency rankings by market capitalization. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap }}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-chases-2-after-bull-flag-breakout-leads-to-new-2024-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price chases $2 after bull flag breakout leads to new 2024 highs }}}\par \par \uc2 November has been a busy month for \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  and XRP\par \par \uc2 Asset manager \uc2 21Shares{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-etf-21shares-sec-listing-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed for an XRP ETF }}}\uc2  on November 1, 2024 \u8212\'20\'14 raising investor expectations that the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) \u8212\'20\'14 which will be under new leadership in January 2025 \u8212\'20\'14 will approve the ETF applications.\par \par \uc2 New York Stock Exchange Arca petitioned the SEC to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-crypto-etf-nyse-arca-listing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 list the Bitwise crypto index }}}\uc2  exchange-traded product on November 15. The Bitwise crypto index will feature 10 digital assets including Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ), Ethereum ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ), Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ), XRP, and others.\par \par \uc2 On November 25, asset manager \uc2 WisdomTree{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisdomtree-files-xrp-etf-delaware"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed for an XRP ETF in Delaware }}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 joining the ranks of \uc2 21Shares\uc2 , Canary Capital, and Bitwise.\par \par \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  also announced the first tokenized money market fund on the XRP Ledger on November 25. The tokenized fund was made possible by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-launched-first-tokenized-money-market-fund-on-xrp-ledger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 partnership between Ripple Labs and Archax }}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 a regulated cryptocurrency exchange in the United Kingdom.\par \par \uc2 As part of the collaboration between the two firms, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  will tokenize Abrdn\u8217\'20\'19s $4.77 billion US dollar liquidity fund.\par \par \uc2 More recently, on November 29, reports surfaced that \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's RLUSD stablecoin \u8212\'20\'14 an overcollateralized US dollar-pegged token \u8212\'20\'14 would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-york-regulator-ripple-rlusd-stablecoin-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 receive approval from New York financial regulators }}}\uc2  in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/pro-xrp-lawyer-john-deaton-10x-more-into-btc-4x-more-into-eth-hall-of-flame/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pro-XRP lawyer John Deaton \u8216\'20\'1810x more into BTC, 4x more into ETH\u8217\'20\'19: Hall of Flame }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTIvMDE5MzgzZWYtOWJhYS03MDliLTg5NzktOGM2MGZkN2U2YjM3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241201ekc1000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
