ame is built by gamers for gamers thus ensuring a thrilling experience. It is based on and uses Unreal Engine to ensure an immersive experience for amateur and professional players. The team has recently shared a behind-the-scenes video showing the work underway ahead of the launch.\par \par \uc2 The game further promotes YETIO utility by enabling the use of the tokens for in-game purchases, engagement, staking, and as a reward system for players.\par \par \uc2 What sets Yeti Ouro apart from other meme coins is its functionality. Investors aren\u8217\'20\'19t just betting on a meme but investing in an active, decentralised community with a clear objective.\par \par \uc2 Yeti Ouro has introduced a BLACK FRIDAY 20% BONUS, available from November 29th to December 2nd. This offer presents investors with a once-in-a-lifetime chance to get more out of their presale investment.\par \par \uc2 Join the Yeti Ouro Community\par \par \uc2 Website:{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://yetiouro.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://yetiouro.io/}}}\par \par \uc2 X (Formally Twitter): {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/yetiouro"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/yetiouro}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/yetiouroofficial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/yetiouroofficial}}}\par \par \uc2 Discord: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/YtUsEZ2ZrV"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://discord.gg/YtUsEZ2ZrV}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241130ekbt0000w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
