\par\par \b \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Market Cap Surpasses \uc2 Porsche\uc2  Amid ETP Launch. Top Altcoins Dominate the News Cycle\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 959 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Gains 25% }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cross-Border Payment Network Ripple (XRP) Continue As a Top Gainer }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) Expected Surge Upon Exchange Listing }}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins are surging and dominating headlines, with Dogecoin (DOGE) surpassing luxury automaker \uc2 Porsche\uc2  by market cap amid news of a DOGE ETP launch. Top altcoins such as Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM), and Ether (ETH) continue to gain impressively, signalling the imminent arrival of the altcoin season.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins have dominated headlines in recent days with continued gains. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum }}}\uc2  (ETH) surged over 7% in the past week and comfortably trades above $3,500. Large-cap altcoins, including \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM), also enjoy a week of double-digit gains.\par \par \uc2 Join us as we explore the top gainers and potential winners as the altcoin season inches closer.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)\par \par \uc2 Memecoin OG Dogecoin (DOGE) has dominated headlines since \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s recent victory over \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  in the US presidential election. Over the past 30 days, DOGE surged a whopping 194% and is now the 7th largest crypto with a market cap nearing $60 billion. After starting its journey in the industry as a joke, DOGE quickly became a household name, transitioning into one of the most profitable investment opportunities. Dogecoin (DOGE) surged in popularity and value after \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s election victory and the president-elect\u8217\'20\'19s announcement of the \uc2 Department of Government Efficiency\uc2 , nicknamed DOGE. According to Trump, DOGE will pave the way for his administration to \u8220\'20\'1Cdismantle Government Bureaucracy, slash excess regulations, cut wasteful expenditure, and restructure Federal Agencies \u8211\'20\'13 Essential to the \u8220\'20\'1CSave America\u8221\'20\'1D Movement.\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  and \uc2 Vivek Ramaswamy\uc2  will co-lead the newly created department.\par \par \uc2 DOGE is expected to surge after \uc2 DeFi Technologies\uc2  introduced {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/defi-technologies-subsidiary-valour-launches-first-dogecoin-doge-etp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Valour Dogecoin (DOGE) ETP }}}\uc2  on Sweden\u8217\'20\'19s Spotlight Stock Market. The ETP will allow retail and institutional investors to gain exposure to DOGE without directly owning the asset. Amid Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s increasing popularity and momentum, the token managed to flip luxury car maker \uc2 Porsche\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s market cap. With a market cap exceeding {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/dogecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $58 billion }}}\uc2 , Dogecoin surpassed \uc2 Porsche\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s $56.1 billion market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Gains 25%\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is another major gainer since \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s election victory. On-chain metrics show Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s weekly active addresses elevated since the crypto market rally triggered by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s win on November 6 began. The surge in network usage and whale buying activity has resulted in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  further surged after the Cardano blockchain developers, the Cardano Foundation, released an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/proposal-for-cardano-constitution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 updated proposal for the Cardano Constitution }}}\uc2  to improve network governance. The revised proposal includes changes to constitutional workshops, social media discussion, and expert and community feedback. The changes aim to \u8220\'20\'1Cimprove the accessibility and clarity of the Cardano governance framework,\u8221\'20\'1D shifting its focus to a less technical audience. Interest in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) surged after its founder, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , revealed plans to help shape US crypto policy under \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s incoming administration.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s gained over 25% in the past week, currently trading at $1.00.\par \par \uc2 Cross-Border Payment Network Ripple (XRP) Continue As a Top Gainer\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) }}}\uc2  has witnessed a spectacular gain in value after news of \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s planned exit surfaced. \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  has been embroiled in a highly publicized legal battle with the securities agency for which \uc2 Ripple\uc2  paid a hefty price. In 2020, the regulator sued \uc2 Ripple\uc2  for its supposed breach of securities laws, resulting in many exchanges, such as \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Kraken, \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , and \uc2 Gemini\uc2 , choosing to delist XRP. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  finally found some relief after a partial victory in 2023 ended the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s 3-year-long crusade against the company. The Southern District of New York Court delivered a partial victory to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  in its matter with the SEC after Judge Analisa Torres {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/07/xrp-value-soars-as-relisting-wave-follows-ripple-s-sec-victory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruled }}}\uc2  that \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP token is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot necessarily a security on its face.\u8221\'20\'1D XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price gained over 29% in the past week with a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  received some further \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news after \uc2 Chris Giancarlo\uc2 , former chair of the CFTC, predicted the SEC would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/former-cftc-chair-predicts-sec-will-drop-ripple-case"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop }}}\uc2  its case against the company.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) Expected Surge Upon Exchange Listing\par \par \uc2 As BTC trades at a whopping $95,252 and top altcoins reach new heights, investors must look for well-priced alternative investment opportunities to profit from the bull run, and Husky Inu is precisely that.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) }}}\uc2  is the latest Solana-based memecoin to grace the market. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/top-memecoins-to-invest-in-hinu-shib-floki-and-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  was created to bring its holders more value and utility by leveraging this powerful blockchain. The project and its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/exciting-memecoins-to-watch-in-2024-shib-floki-doge-and-hinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU }}}\uc2 , want to make their mark on the saturated memecoin market by building a supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solana-memecoins-to-watch-hinu-maga-bonk-and-dawgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  recently launched the presale for HINU, and the fundraising has attracted a fair amount of attention. Since going live, the presale has generated over $575,000 and will soon reach its fundraising target.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  is working on some exciting things, including an Earn App and a Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the project, and the Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading to improve utility and value for HINU holders. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/5-cheap-memecoins-poised-to-make-millionaires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter }}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram }}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241129ekbs0000y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 Why is Ethereum (ETH) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 644 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum price is rising primarily due to Bitwise's recent ETF application with the SEC and it may approach $4,000 in December.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNjJhOWU5MTEtNDNhMi00Y2M0LTkyYTEtZjQ4MTlkOGYwZGI1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ethereum (ETH) price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s native token, Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ), has risen by 5.75% in the last 24 hours to reach around $3,640 on Nov. 28. The second-largest cryptocurrency has outperformed the crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s gains, which has jumped 2.82% in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193734c-0826-745f-8287-94960d098af8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Ethereum Price }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD four-hour price chart. Source: TradingView/Cointelegraph\par \par \uc2 Bitwise files for 10 Crypto Index Fund ETF, including Ether\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s recent rally can be attributed to heightened investor optimism surrounding \uc2 Bitwise Asset Management\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s recent exchange-traded fund (ETF) application.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-files-for-10-crypto-index-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed }}}\uc2  with the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) to launch an ETF based on its existing 10 Crypto Index Fund. This fund, initiated in November 2017, predominantly comprises Bitcoin (75.14%) and Ether (16.42%), with the remaining assets allocated across cryptocurrencies like Solana ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ), XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ), and Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Most cryptocurrencies included in the proposed ETF have surged in the past 24 hours, reflecting growing market speculation and optimism surrounding the investment product\u8217\'20\'19s potential approval.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01937358-0680-788f-a1a0-74c73015b293"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Ethereum Price }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD versus BTC/USD, XRP/USD, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD, and \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD one-month performance. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Ethereum open interest hits record high\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  accompanies a strong jump in its futures market\u8217\'20\'19s open interest (OI). As of Nov. 28, the OI had reached over $24 billion, the highest in history, after jumping by more than $4 billion in the last 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s weekly funding rates have been positive since October, around 0.53% as of Nov. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01937365-186b-7213-bfb0-918fd0cb4c73"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Ethereum Price }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH Futures OI, Funding Rates. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 The combination of record-high OI and sustained positive funding rates creates a feedback loop: \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment drives increased market participation, which, in turn, fuels price gains.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, these developments may reflect broader confidence in Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem and its prospects, further supporting the rally.\par \par \uc2 Ether eyes 10% \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  by December\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s price rally today is further driven by strong technical support and a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  chart pattern breakout.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency has rebounded from its 50-period exponential moving average (EMA) on the four-hour chart, a critical level that has consistently supported during its recent uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01937374-bb5b-7222-a09f-cc1c055110c1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Ethereum Price }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD four-hour price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Ether has entered the breakout stage of its prevailing cup-and-handle pattern, a classic \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation structure. The pattern formed over several weeks, with the breakout occurring as the price surged above the $3,440 neckline level.\par \par \uc2 The cup-and-handle breakout typically projects a measured move equal to the depth of the cup, putting Ether\u8217\'20\'19s upside target near $3,940.\par \par \uc2 In other words, Ether price could rise by over 10% in December.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s native token, Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ), has risen by 5.75% in the last 24 hours to reach around $3,640 on Nov. 28. In doing so, the second-largest cryptocurrency has outperformed the crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s gains, which has jumped 2.82% in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193721b-90a2-785c-b72c-75bc49db8ac0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Ethereum Price }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD four-hour price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-bitcoin-ether-etfs-reverse-share-split"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Grayscale completes reverse share splits of Bitcoin and Ether ETFs }}}\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNjJhOWU5MTEtNDNhMi00Y2M0LTkyYTEtZjQ4MTlkOGYwZGI1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241128ekbs0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitwise Asset Management\par \b \uc2 Bitwise files for 10 Crypto Index Fund ETF with the SEC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Stephen Katte \par \uc2 524 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager Bitwise submitted an SEC application for an ETF based on its existing 10 Crypto Index Fund, following a filing by \uc2 NYSE Arca\uc2  to list it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzZmZGItODc5YS03NzJmLTg4NjAtYmQ5MDVkZmU1MzNl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitwise files for 10 Crypto Index Fund ETF with the SEC }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager Bitwise submitted an application for an exchange-traded fund (ETF) based on its existing 10 Crypto Index Fund.\par \par \uc2 The New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) \uc2 Arca\uc2  had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-crypto-etf-nyse-arca-listing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed to list the Bitwise 10 Crypto Index Fund }}}\uc2  as an exchange-traded product (ETP) on Nov. 15.\par \par \uc2 According to the Nov. 27 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/files/rules/sro/nysearca/2024/34-101775.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filing }}}\uc2  to the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 , the proposed Bitwise {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/different-types-of-etfs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10 Crypto Index Fund ETF }}}\uc2  will give investors indirect exposure to the underlying cryptocurrencies, while the custodian will \u8220\'20\'1Cmaintain custody of the Portfolio Assets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitwise\u8217\'20\'19s 10 Crypto Index Fund has a raft of different allocations, weighted heavily toward Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ), but also including Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ), Solana ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ), Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ), Chainlink ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK }}}\uc2  ), Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Bitcoin Cash ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH }}}\uc2  ), Uniswap ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI }}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Trust\u8217\'20\'19s only assets will be Portfolio Assets and cash. The Trust does not seek to hold any digital assets other than Portfolio Assets and has expressly disclaimed ownership of any such assets,\u8221\'20\'1D the filing says.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019370cd-b190-7425-9452-548bad09e180"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC, United States, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitwise\u8217\'20\'19s 10 Crypto Index Fund is predominantly made up of Bitcoin and Ether. Source: SEC\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Bitwise 10 Crypto Index Fund\uc2  was launched in November 2017, with the bulk of the fund comprised of 75.14% Bitcoin and 16.42% Ether. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bitwiseinvestments.com/crypto-funds/bitw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tracker }}}\uc2  for the fund lists $1.4 billion in assets under management (AUM).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-rebrands-xrp-etp-ripple-invests"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple to invest in rebranded Bitwise XRP ETP }}}\par \par \uc2 Coinbase Custody is listed as the partner for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/what-is-a-cryptocurrency-a-beginners-guide-to-digital-money"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto component }}}\uc2  of the ETF. The \uc2 Bank of New York Mellon\uc2  is listed as the custodian for the fund\u8217\'20\'19s cash holdings, the Trust\u8217\'20\'19s administrator and the transfer agent.\par \par \uc2 The SEC has not set a deadline to reject or approve the application, but has acknowledged the submission.\par \par \uc2 Bitwise Asset Management\uc2  currently has over $11 billion in AUM and has recently been making moves in the market. On Nov. 27, the firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/11/27/2987978/0/en/Bitwise-Rebrands-XRP-ETP-Ripple-To-Invest-in-Product.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rebranded }}}\uc2  its European XRP ETF, launched in 2022, to Bitwise Physical XRP ETP.\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 26, \uc2 NYSE Arca{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-nyse-arca-sec-bitcoin-ether-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed to list a Bitwise ETF featuring direct spot Bitcoin and Ether }}}\uc2  exposure. On Nov. 20, the firm also registered a statutory trust in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-registers-solana-etf-delaware"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Delaware for a proposed spot Solana ETF }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019370a7-5fb3-7601-8881-0257817300a6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitwise files for 10 Crypto Index Fund ETF with the SEC }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/HHorsley/status/1861795159794409943"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hunter Horsley }}}\par \par \uc2 In January, the SEC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-bitcoin-etf-approvals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first approved spot Bitcoin ETFs }}}\uc2  from asset managers for listing and trading on US exchanges. In May, the regulator {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-ether-etf-approved"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 greenlit shares of spot Ether ETFs }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Since President-elect Donald Trump won the US election and hundreds of pro-crypto candidates won seats in Congress, industry leaders have suggested the \uc2 US government\uc2  will become the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/republicans-majority-control-us-senate-pro-crypto-congress"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 most pro-crypto in history }}}\uc2 , which should result in a more favorable regulatory environment.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/how-to-upset-cardanos-charles-hoskinson-by-quoting-him-accurately/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How to upset Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Charles Hoskinson by quoting him accurately }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzZmZGItODc5YS03NzJmLTg4NjAtYmQ5MDVkZmU1MzNl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241128ekbs00005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
