h an initial supply of 100 billion tokens, with 80 billion gifted to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  for development. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  utilizes XRP to enhance network liquidity and support its ecosystem, placing 55 billion XRP in escrow for controlled supply release. The coin operates on a decentralized system, making transactions secure and irreversible. Its features aim to facilitate seamless payment transfers across various currencies, providing potential for significant impact in international finance.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 : A Sustainable Blockchain for Smart Contracts and DeFi\par \par \uc2 Cardano is a blockchain platform designed for smart contracts and decentralized applications. Its native cryptocurrency, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , allows users to store value, make payments, and participate in network governance. Cardano emphasizes sustainability and scalability by using Ouroboros, a proof-of-stake mechanism that is energy-efficient compared to traditional proof-of-work systems. The blockchain is split into two layers: one for transactions and one for smart contracts, enhancing its ability to process potentially up to 1 million transactions per second. Introduced in 2021, Cardano's native tokens enable secure and low-cost interactions with smart contracts. Given its technological advancements and focus on efficiency, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holds potential in the current cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 While XRP and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  may see limited short-term gains, DOGEN emerges as a standout. Designed for those seeking the best in life, it embodies luxury and success. With an expected 700% growth by the end of the presale and potential for thousand-fold returns, DOGEN follows successful tokens like BONK and Popcat, building a community of alpha leaders and offering real benefits to early adopters.\par \par \uc2 Site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dogen.meme/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://dogen.meme/ }}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/dogenmeme"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/dogenmeme }}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/Dogen_Portal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/Dogen_Portal }}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241128ekbr0000q\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 986 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price reached nine-month highs against Bitcoin amid increasing network growth and positive fundamentals, showing that investors are turning to \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market has been riding the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  wave following Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory in the Nov. 5 US Presidential Election, which saw Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) hit a new all-time high of $99,655 on Nov. 22.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has also benefitted as a result, rising an impressive 250% to hit a multi-year high of $1.15 on Nov. 23.\par \par \uc2 After a brief correction over the last three days, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is gaining momentum again, surging more than 10% over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936e18-b05c-7b68-8862-be33e76f897e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/lfxOwM3K/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the factors behind \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s upward momentum.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price buoyed by Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ZK smart contracts\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ada-price-pumps-30-rumors-cardano-founder-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 \u8217\'20\'19s \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  performance }}}\uc2  on Nov. 27 follows the successful launch of the first zero-knowledge (ZK) smart contract on the Cardano mainnet, marking a major milestone for the layer-1 network.\par \par \uc2 The transaction was done by Input Output\u8212\'20\'14the company behind the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano ecosystem }}}\uc2  development\u8212\'20\'14using Halo 2 zk-SNARK technology.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYesterday, Nov. 25, 2024, the IO Research team successfully tested Halo2 verification in Plutus on the mainnet network,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/InputOutputHK/status/1861422103292993683"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  Input Output in an X post on Nov. 26.\par \par \uc2 The first transaction was meant to lock the funds, and the second one used a Zero Knowledge proof from Halo 2 to unfreeze them. This process took some time and involved a small cost of 2.03ADA, about $1.90, which can be considered \u8220\'20\'1Creasonably low\u8221\'20\'1D, according to Input Output.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936e1c-cfe1-7ca9-bbc8-14b6d7dfc984"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/InputOutputHK/status/1861422108552598012"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Input Output }}}\par \par \uc2 Some of the features of Halo 2 are recursive proofs that allow the breaking down of big problems into a series of simpler problems. This feature is expected to enhance scalability and security.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Cardano founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2  has proposed the integration of Bitcoin with Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Hoskinson explained this in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/IOHK_Charles/status/1861555198243807256"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 video }}}\uc2  detailing plans to use Bitcoin as a control layer for Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s smart contracts and assets. This integration will enable users to send Bitcoin to Cardano, generating Cardano-wrapped \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price hits 9-month highs against Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Cardano has outperformed Bitcoin throughout November, rallying approximately 200% month-to-date compared to BTC\u8217\'20\'19s 39% gains against the US dollar.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936e1e-924f-73b1-a3e3-07f556787aa0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD vs. BTC/USD performance. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/W80dfFUt/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 High network activity and general positive market sentiment during the 2021 bull cycle saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC ratio rally 895% from Dec. 21, 2020, to reach an all-time high of 0.00005847 on Aug. 23, 2021.\par \par \uc2 This ratio then dropped during the 2022 bear market, reaching an all-time low of 0.00000336 on Nov. 6.\par \par \uc2 Since then, the ratio has been on a sustained uptrend, rising 148% to reach a nine-month high of $0.00001096 on Nov. 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936e1f-5e15-77ef-b5ef-a1be4d23b865"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC ratio. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://ada/BTC%20ratio.%20Source:%20TradingView%20Cardano%E2%80%99s%20underperformance%20can%20be%20attributed%20to%20diminishing%20network%20activity,%20which%20leads%20to%20reduced%20demand%20for%20ADA%20tokens%20within%20the%20ecosystem.%20This%20negatively%20impacts%20the%20price."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 One of the reasons for such massive gains in a short period is an uptick in user activity on the Cardano network. For example, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked }}}\uc2  (TVL) has been on an uptrend over the last three weeks.\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows that the TVL rose by over 200% from about $199 million on Nov. 5 to an all-time high of approximately $598 million on Nov. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936e1f-e006-75ec-97c9-9f7647810f8d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 TVL on Cardano. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the total value locked in DeFil protocols built on Cardano has also expanded significantly, as shown in the figure below.\par \par \uc2 Among the leading projects in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem, Indigo\u8217\'20\'19s collateralized debt protocol stands out, with its TVL rising by 154% over the last month. The decentralized exchange Minswap has seen its TVL increase by 113% over the last month to $106 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936e20-31c9-77ec-b4cc-06fbe73e7546"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of top DeFi protocols on Cardano\par \par \uc2 The rising TVL on Cardano indicates heightened user interaction, increasing demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens and positively impacting its price.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-risks-40-trump-trade-gains-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano price risks erasing 40% of 'Trump Trade' gains by December }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s uptrend remains intact\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price action between Nov. 5 and Nov. 27 has recorded a series of higher highs and higher lows on the daily chart. This has led to the formation of an ascending parallel channel chart pattern, as shown below.\par \par \uc2 An ascending channel is a chart pattern formed from two upward trend lines drawn above and below a price representing resistance and support levels. It remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as long as the price rises inside the channel.\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price sitting on support provided by the channel's lower boundary at $0.960. If bulls hold above this level, they will likely push the price toward the middle boundary of the rising channel at $1.078.\par \par \uc2 Higher than that, the next logical target would be the upper boundary of the prevailing chart pattern at $1.2. Such a move would bring the total gains to 20% from the current level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936e20-b5ff-7c4d-9848-a502878b3b25"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: Cointelegraph/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/24eBZ7cE/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cross formed on Nov. 24 when the 100-day simple moving average (SMA) crossed above the 200-day SMA and saw \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price make a decisive move toward multi-year highs at $1.15.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal is still in play, suggesting that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price is well-positioned for more gains.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241127ekbr0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP price\par \b \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 772 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Will XRP price explode to $4.0? Several XRP metrics show that the token is breaking out into new all-time highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNjJlNDdlMTgtYmFmMS00YzBiLWFkMDktZGRlZjY1NzYwN2Ew.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) is leading the cryptocurrency market recovery on Nov. 27, up 10.5% over the last 24 hours to trade at $1.43.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\uc2  shows XRP rose from a low of $1.28 on Nov. 26, climbing as much as 14% to an intraday high of $1.46 on Nov. 27. The XRP/USD pair boasts 30% and 179% weekly and monthly gains, respectively.\par \par \uc2 In comparison, the total crypto market capitalization posted only 1.6% daily gains to $3.24 trillion at publication. Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) has risen 2%, while Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://v"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) is up 5% on the day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936d75-3723-76ad-8ff4-ee29efab72e6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ovHpDHM1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look closer at the factors driving the XRP price up today.\par \par \uc2 XRP price rises on \uc2 Ripple\uc2  partnership with \uc2 Archax\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Ripple/status/1860995969375990069"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced }}}\uc2  the launch of a tokenized money market fund on the XRP ledger in collaboration with \uc2 Archax\uc2 , a UK-based \uc2 FCA\uc2 -regulated \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange.\par \par \uc2 According to a Nov. 25 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ripple.com/ripple-press/archax-provides-access-to-abrdn-money-market-fund-on-the-xrp-ledger-in-collaboration-with-ripple/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 press release }}}\uc2 , the fund, which will be managed by the UK asset manager abrdn, is part of its \u163\'00\'A33.8 billion US dollar Liquidity Fund (Lux).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936d75-af85-77cf-803d-a95adda71ffc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: \uc2 Archax\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CArchax, the first \uc2 FCA\uc2  regulated \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange, broker and custodian, has provided access to a money market fund from UK asset manager abrdn in a tokenized form on the XRP Ledger,\u8221\'20\'1D the statement noted.\par \par \uc2 With this new partnership, the payments company plans to tap into the growing potential of tokenized finance, which is estimated at over $1 billion in assets under management for tokenized money market funds and with the total value of tokenized assets projected to reach $16 trillion by 2030, as per McKinsey\u8217\'20\'19s data.\par \par \uc2 Commenting on the collaboration, Markus Infanger, Senior Vice President, RippleX said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere is no question that the onchain economy is gaining traction. By working with companies like \uc2 Archax\uc2 , we are excited to help financial institutions like abrdn to seize the incredible opportunity represented by blockchain and digital assets technology to deliver utility at scale.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 19, \uc2 Ripple{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Ripple/status/1858971049800446359"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced }}}\uc2  a partnership with Mercy Corps Ventures, promoting financial inclusion by utilizing the XRP Ledger (XRPL) for entrepreneurs and small businesses in emerging markets.\par \par \uc2 These partnerships could boost {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-announces-exchange-partners-for-rlusd-stablecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP adoption }}}\uc2 , potentially increasing demand for the token.\par \par \uc2 XRP open interest climbs to new highs\par \par \uc2 Expectations of a crypto-friendly regulatory environment under Trump\u8217\'20\'19s presidency and \uc2 Ripple\uc2  partnerships have sparked growth in XRP-tracked futures, with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-open-interest-in-the-crypto-futures-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 open interest }}}\uc2  (IO) zooming to record highs on Nov. 22.\par \par \uc2 Open interest is a key metric that traders and analysts use to assess market sentiment and anticipate future price movements.\par \par \uc2 The metric remains elevated at near all-time highs and has jumped 5% over the last 24 hours to $2.06. This accompanied a 7.2% price growth over the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936d76-41b0-7ba4-beeb-4a918b671c90"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP open interest. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Higher open interest indicates that more money is entering the market, increasing the chances that the uptrend will resume.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-25-spx-dxy-btc-eth-sol-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/25: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s giant bull flag targets new all-time highs\par \par \uc2 Chart technicals show XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price action forming a bull flag pattern on the daily timeframe, as shown in the chart below.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-a-bull-flag-chart-pattern-and-how-to-spot-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bull flag }}}\uc2  is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation setup that forms after the price consolidates inside a down-sloping range following a sharp price ascent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01936d76-bf6b-7f62-818f-2ac18179615c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/mtxTyPzR/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The pattern will resolve after the price breaks above the upper trendline of the flag at $1.46 and potentially rise by as much as the previous uptrend\u8217\'20\'19s height.\par \par \uc2 This puts the upper target for XRP price at $4.28, marking new all-time highs for the sixth- cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 However, XRP\u8217\'20\'19s daily relative strength index is still overbought at 82 on the daily chart, so the chances of another pullback remain relatively high.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, a retreat from $0.1.43 could see a retest of the flag\u8217\'20\'19s lower trendline at around $1.28. Lower than that, the price could move toward the psychological level of $1.00-$1.05.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNjJlNDdlMTgtYmFmMS00YzBiLWFkMDktZGRlZjY1NzYwN2Ew.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241127ekbr0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
