e highs on Nov. 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019367e4-9f7b-7ff5-a391-36e867617b86"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, DApps, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Decentralized Exchange, Market Analysis, Solana }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/56gGcazs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look closer at the factors driving \uc2 Solana\uc2  price down today.\par \par \uc2 Marketwide sell-off weighs down \uc2 SOL\uc2  price\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  corrects alongside other cryptocurrencies, which have also dropped, triggered by an overheated market and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-bitcoin-price-100-k-trigger-a-big-correction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tag the $100,000 mark }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ), the largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, led the losses and has declined 5.8% over the last 24 hours to exchange hands at $92,536. Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) has dropped more than 1.2% over the last 24 hours to trade at $3,360.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019367e6-477f-775f-918d-a6671c77224f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, DApps, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Decentralized Exchange, Market Analysis, Solana }}}\par \par \uc2 24-hour performance of top-cap cryptocurrencies: Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Other top-cap cryptocurrencies, including BNB ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ), XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 