r \par \uc2 The rise in \uc2 SOL\uc2  price to all-time highs also led to overbought conditions on Nov. 22 when the RSI hit 77, occasioning a correction as buyer exhaustion and profit-booking set in.\par \par \uc2 If the selling intensifies, \uc2 SOL\uc2  price may drop toward the $210 support level or lower to $185.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWM4NWYtNTYyMi03NWM5LWIxODQtMDMyZWFiYzQ3OTBj.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241126ekbq0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
