\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 11-25 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGECOIN: DOGE, POLKADOT: DOT, UNISWAP: UNI, ARBITRUM: ARB\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,436 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Market Hit By Liquidation Wave }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NFTs Register $158M Weekly Sales Volume }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) stalled after coming within touching distance of $100,000 as the cryptocurrency reached a peak of $99,655 before declining to its current level. BTC is marginally down over the past 24 hours but registered a substantial decline over the weekend and dipped to a low of $95,816 late on Sunday before recovering. While BTC reached historic levels during its rally, analysts have noted signs of market exhaustion and potential consolidation around $100,000.\par \par \uc2 Several major cryptocurrencies have also declined over the past 24 hours with the most notable being Ethereum (ETH) and Solana (SOL). ETH is down almost 1% over the past 24 hours and SOL is down just over 1% as buyers look to keep it above $250. Dogecoin (DOGE), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Toncoin (TON), and Polkadot (DOT). Speaking about BTC\u8217\'20\'19s struggles to go above $100,000, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://changenow.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ChangeNOW }}}\uc2  CMO Pauline Shangett stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe rapid ascent to $99,655 has stretched Bitcoin's momentum indicators, signaling potential market exhaustion. While long-term fundamentals remain intact, short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and profit-taking are to be expected. The broader crypto market appears to be mirroring Bitcoin's cooling off. Coins like Ethereum and \uc2 Solana\uc2  are also under pressure, reflecting cautious sentiment among buyers after a strong rally.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto Market Hit By Liquidation Wave\par \par \uc2 The crypto market was hit by a liquidation tsunami as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/crypto-price-analysis-11-22-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-dogecoin-doge-pendle-pendle-injective-inj-apecoin-ape"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) }}}\uc2  plummeted below $96,000 before recovering. However, the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency has still been unable to go above the $100,000 price level. The drop led to one of the most significant crypto liquidations in the past six months, with $500 million worth of crypto positions wiped out. Long liquidations accounted for a hefty $379 million, while short liquidations accounted for $125 million, according to data sourced from CoinGlass. 197,083 traders were liquidated, with the largest liquidation ($13 million) on Binance. BTC and ETH made up a significant chunk of the liquidations, accounting for $121 million worth of positions.\par \par \uc2 Prominent altcoins, including Dogecoin (DOGE), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) }}}\uc2 , and \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM) reported significant liquidations, with 34.20 million, $30.27 million, and $18.95 million wiped out. The drop comes after a substantial rally reported by several altcoins, such as XLM and DOGE. XLM rallied over 50% on November 23-24, and DOGE hit levels not seen since May 2021.\par \par \uc2 NFTs Register $158M Weekly Sales Volume\par \par \uc2 Non-fungible tokens (NFTs) continued their strong weekly sales volumes despite declining marginally. Data from NFT tracker CryptoSlam showed NFTs recorded a sales volume of around $158 million over the past week, a 12.7% decrease compared to the previous week when they recorded $181 million in weekly sales. Despite the decline, weekly trading volume is above its record at the beginning of November. NFTs registered weekly sales volumes of only $93 million between November 4 and 10.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum led in sales volume, recording $49 million in sales, and Bitcoin ranked a close second with $43 million in sales. Meanwhile, \uc2 Solana\uc2  maintained its rank as the third-highest in sales volumes for NFTs, with $23.9 million in weekly sales. However, this was a 9% drop compared to the previous week. Polygon, Immutable, Mythos Chain, and BNB Chain recorded $35.8 million in weekly sales volume.\par \par \uc2 However, \uc2 Solana\uc2  led in the number of NFT buyers with 185,000 buyers for the week, an increase of 57% compared to the week prior. The numbers suggest NFTs are on track to close November positively. NFTs recorded $356 million in sales volume in October, an 18% increase compared to September. Current figures suggest consistent interest despite slight fluctuations.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) }}}\uc2  rally has stalled during recent sessions, losing momentum at a critical level and stopping just shy of $100,000, with sellers pushing the price lower marginally. The loss of momentum can be attributed to traders assessing if optimism from President-elect Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s support for crypto is becoming stretched. The asset fell to a low of $95,776 on Sunday before rising to its current levels. Matt Maley, Chief Market Strategist at \uc2 Miller Tabak\uc2  and Co, stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInvestors are worried Bitcoin will have to take a breather now that it has tested the $100,000 level. Bullishness around the cryptocurrency is getting extreme.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump has promised crypto-friendly \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  and create a strategic Bitcoin stockpile. However, the timeline and feasibility of some promises remain in doubt.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m seeing an increasing skew to the sell side as we near the $100,000 mark. This suggests we may experience consolidation around this level in the near term before a sustained breakthrough above it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin price chart shows BTC losing momentum after reaching a peak of $99,317 on Friday. BTC was \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  the previous week as it surged towards $100,000, beginning with an increase of 1.17% on Monday to go above $90,000 and settle at $90,509. Bitcoin bulls retained control on Tuesday as the price rose by 2.15% and settled at $92,457. Wednesday saw BTC register an increase of almost 2% and settle at $94,204. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Thursday as BTC rose nearly 4% to go above $95,000 and settle at $97,784. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum waned on Friday as BTC approached the $100,000 price level. BTC reached an intraday high of $99,317 before declining and settling at $98,355, registering a marginal increase of 0.58%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/I4y91pDF/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The weekend began with BTC registering a notable decline on Saturday, falling by 1.26% and settling at $97,113. Sellers drove BTC to an intraday low of $94,838 on Sunday as selling pressure increased. However, BTC recovered from this level as sellers lost momentum, rising 0.80% and settling at $97,891. The current session sees BTC marginally up as buyers and sellers look to influence price action.\par \par \uc2 Analysts believe it's only a matter of time before BTC crosses $100,000 and are confident it will happen by the end of November. However, whether it can sustain itself above this level remains to be seen. If BTC goes below $100,000, we could see a correction that could take the price as low as $80,000. For now, the market waits for BTC\u8217\'20\'19s ascent past $100,000.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) }}}\uc2  is struggling to go above $3,400 as it faces significant selling pressure at this level. The altcoin has been trading between $3,000 and $3,400 since November 11 and is down by 1.21% over the past 24 hours. However, despite the recent wobble, ETH is up almost 8% over the past week. ETH started the previous week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, rebounding from a low of $3,051 to register an increase of 4.37% and settle at $3,209. However, it fell back in the red on Tuesday, dropping by 3.13% and settling at $3,109. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Wednesday as ETH dropped by 1.25% and settled at $3,070.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/776Pvq72/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Despite declining on Wednesday, ETH registered a stunning rally on Thursday, rising by 9.44% and settling at $3,360 after reaching an intraday high of $3,388. Buyers attempted to go above $3,400 on Friday as ETH reached an intraday high of $3,427. However, it fell back from this level, dropping 0.96% and settling at $3,328. The weekend saw buying activity increase on Saturday as ETH rose to an intraday high of $3,502. However, buyers lost momentum, and ETH fell below $3,400, settling at $3,396 after registering an increase of just over 2%. Sellers returned to the market on Sunday as ETH fell to a low of $3,286 before recovering and settling at $3,362, a drop of 1.01% compared to Saturday. ETH fell to a low of $3,301 during the current session. However, it has recovered and is currently up by 0.69% and trading at $3,385.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are looking to push ETH above the $3,400 price level. If ETH crosses this level, we could see a rally to $3,500 and beyond. On the other hand, if sellers take control and drive ETH below $3,000, it could drop to $2,850.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) has registered a substantial decline over the past few sessions as it struggles to go above $260, with sellers looking to drive the price below $250. SOL has also been experiencing significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , beginning the previous week with an increase of 1.04% to settle at $239. However, the price fell back in the red after rising to an intraday high of $247 on Tuesday, registering a decline of 0.89% and settling at $237. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Wednesday as SOL fell by 0.97% and settled at $235. Despite the selling pressure, SOL rallied on Thursday, rising almost 9% to move above $250 and settle at $256. SOL encountered considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday as buyers and sellers attempted to wrest control, with the price registering a marginal increase.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/UAbeyXb2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 However, SOL fell into the red over the weekend after failing to stay above $260. SOL reached an intraday high of $264 on Saturday before dropping by 0.78% and settling at $254. Selling pressure intensified on Sunday as SOL dropped to an intraday low of $241. However, buyers propped up the price from this level as SOL reclaimed $250 and settled at $253. The current session sees SOL marginally up as buyers and sellers look to take control. Sellers will look to drive SOL below $250. On the other hand, if SOL rallies past $260, we could see a surge to $280-$290.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) }}}\uc2  has declined during the current session as it struggles to go above $0.45. DOGE began the previous week positively, registering an increase of 1.37% and settling at $0.371. The price rallied to an intraday high of $0.420 on Tuesday before dropping and settling at $0.391. Selling pressure registered a substantial increase on Wednesday as DOGE dropped by 3.42% and settled at $0.378 before recovering on Thursday to register a 2.25% increase and settle at $0.386.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gCV9Bbm1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE surged past $0.40 on Friday after rising almost 7% and moving to $0.413. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Saturday as DOGE rallied to an intraday high of $0.480. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level and fell back, ultimately settling at $0.43. Sunday saw DOGE register substantial \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers attempted to wrest control. As a result, DOGE reached an intraday high of $0.453 and fell to an intraday low of $0.399 before settling at $0.430. The current session sees DOGE marginally down and trading at $0.431.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) has registered an incredible rally that has seen the price surge past $10 as DOT exploded to move above crucial resistance levels. DOT registered a substantial jump on Monday, rising almost 11% and settling at $6. However, it fell back in the red on Tuesday, dropping by 3.33% to $5.80. DOT saw considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday as buyers attempted to reclaim the $6 level. DOT rose to an intraday high of $6.12 before falling back to register a drop of 1.21% and settle at $5.73.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zoZ0RKqk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT fell to an intraday low of $5.47 on Thursday but recovered to register an increase of 3.66% and settle at $5.94. DOT went above $6 on Friday after rallying almost 12% and settling at $6.63. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Saturday as DOT rallied an incredible 28.66% to surge to an intraday high of $9.49 before settling at $8.53. DOT surged to an intraday high of $10.52 on Sunday as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted. However, buyers lost momentum at this level, and DOT fell back to settle at $8.83. The current session sees DOT up by just over 3% as buyers look to push the price above $10.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) has seen \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment return over the past few sessions as it surged past crucial resistance levels. UNI\u8217\'20\'19s latest price jump began on Thursday as it rebounded after dropping to a low of $8.52. UNI recovered to surge to an intraday high of $9.69 before settling at $9.28. The price went above $9.50 on Friday as UNI rose almost 7% to $9.91. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified over the weekend as UNI rallied to an intraday high of $11.33 on Saturday. However, buyers lost momentum at this level and UNI fell back to $10.72. Sunday saw UNI experience considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to take control.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/2oXfvp24/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 As a result, UNI rose to an intraday high of $11.39 and fell to an intraday low of $10.11 before settling at $10.88. The current session sees UNI up by 5.35% and trading at $11.46.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) has gained considerable momentum over the past few sessions as buyers look to push it above $0.90. ARB surged past the 200-day SMA on Thursday, reaching an intraday high of $0.86 before declining and settling at $0.77, registering an increase of almost 16%. Buyers retained control on Friday, pushing ARB up by 3.95% to $0.81. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Saturday as ARB registered an increase of 5.64% and settled at $0.85.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/k4PZOxAm/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Sunday saw a significant spike in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to take control. As a result, ARB fell to an intraday low of $0.79 and rose to an intraday high of $0.91 before settling at $0.86. The price fell to an intraday low of $0.82 during the current session. However, it has recovered and is currently up by 1.60% and trading at $0.87.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241126ekbp0000g\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 763 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano faces selling pressure, with the extended Bollinger Bands highlighting a potential drop to $0.95 due to overbought conditions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is showing weakness today, trading at $1.051, down 1.2% over the last 24 hours. Reduced trading volume and several onchain signals suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could slip lower soon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019362d7-f65e-7cb2-9c95-b148261b80db"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/m0oTdmRV/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the factors driving Cardano price down today.\par \par \uc2 Reduced trading volume hurts \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-ada-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-ada-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has been up }}}\uc2  more than 225% since Nov. 5, when Americans went to the polls in an election that saw Republican {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-declares-victory-crypto-community"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump emerge victorious }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 During this rally, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s trading volume soared from roughly $241 million on Nov. 5 to reach $6 billion on Nov. 16, as per Santiment data.\par \par \uc2 This metric shot again to \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s latest rally to $1.15, setting a 2.5-year high of $6.2 billion on Nov. 24, before dropping sharply to the current level of $3.7 billion.\par \par \uc2 Trading volume is a market indicator used to gauge trader interest by measuring the total value of tokens exchanged within a certain period of time. Rising volume signals heightened investor interest, often preceding a price growth. On the other hand, declining volume indicates waning interest, often resulting in lower prices.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019362d8-85e0-7b90-90c6-fe27e7479c62"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading volume. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 Therefore, if {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-daily-transaction-volume-surges-but-ada-prices-slump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s trading volume }}}\uc2  continues to drop, it will signal reduced demand for the layer-1 token, increasing the likelihood of further price depreciation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Cardano liquidity concentration drops to $0.94\par \par \uc2 Another factor that facilitates \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s downside is the liquidation heatmap, a metric that points out price levels where massive liquidations are likely to occur, according to CoinGlass.\par \par \uc2 When the liquidity is concentrated at a certain point, it often indicates the likelihood of the price dropping toward that area. Levels of high liquidity concentration are represented by a yellow color on the liquidation heatmap.\par \par \uc2 The 24-hour liquidation heatmap for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano }}}\uc2  shows that the liquidity is concentrated around the $0.94 level. This suggests that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price has a good chance of testing $0.94 as support in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019362d9-5f7d-720b-add6-40cc0bb8986f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano liquidation heatmap. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-risks-40-trump-trade-gains-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano price risks erasing 40% of 'Trump Trade' gains by December }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  technical setup signals \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $0.95\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\uc2  shows \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at $.107 at the time of publication, 7% below the multi-year high above $1.15, which has expanded the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.investopedia.com/terms/b/bollingerbands.asp#:~:text=Bollinger%20Bands%20is%20a%20technical%20analysis%20tool%20used%20to%20determine,an%20upper%20and%20lower%20band."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bollinger Bands }}}\uc2  (BB).\par \par \uc2 The BB is a technical indicator that measures the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  around an asset. Depending on the buying or selling pressure in the market, an expanded BB can detect possible overbought and oversold conditions.\par \par \uc2 A potential sell opportunity arises when the price touches the upper band, which is a sign that the price is overbought.\par \par \uc2 The price is currently touching the upper band, suggesting that investors could continue booking profits at current levels, which can precipitate a drop to $0.95, the 23.6% Fibonacci retracement level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019362d9-feb6-777e-8206-c4dadac0bf50"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/slkMmrYC/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The overbought conditions are supported by the position of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relative strength index }}}\uc2  (RS) in the overbought territory at 84. In fact, the \uc2 RSI\uc2  shows \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been massively overbought since Nov. 11.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, this situation might change if demand increases with a resurgence in trading volume. The price could jump back to $1.15 in such a case before moving higher.\par \par \uc2 Pseudonymous crypto investor and analyst DW {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CW8900/status/1860972099407634834"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shared }}}\uc2  a chart showing \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price in a V-shaped recovery on the hourly chart, setting the target at $1.32.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCardano \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  faces a short-term bubble risk with a \u8216\'20\'182\u8217\'20\'19 alert, signaling potential price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CryptoniteUae/status/1860916518202261664"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  fellow analyst CryptoniteUae in a Nov. 25 post on X.\par \par \uc2 The analyst expressed confidence that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Clong-term momentum remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D as the price retests key support areas, and a successful defense of these levels sets the stage for further gains.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInvestors should stay cautious short-term but remain optimistic about Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s recovery potential.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241125ekbp0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\pic