\par\par \b \uc2 Market Cools Down After a Hot News Week: Top Altcoins to Buy Now\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 864 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM) }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 First Convicted Raccon Fred (FRED) }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) }}}\par \par \uc2 The broader crypto appears to have slowed in the last day after a busy week with significant news announcements that saw many coins set new all-time highs. Bitcoin (BTC) came within reach of $100,000, and many large-cap altcoins broke their previous record. With prices down today, an opportunity to secure your spot in the market has presented itself.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) and the broader altcoin market have cooled off after a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  week sent crypto prices through the roof. BTC came within reach of $100,000, while major altcoins such as \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM), Polkadot (DOT), \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) registered massive gains.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s explore which altcoins to buy while the market presents the opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM)\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stellar.org/learn/lumens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar network }}}\uc2  is similar to the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) network - a decentralised payment platform and cryptocurrency that facilitates quick and low-cost cross-border payments, promoting financial inclusion for individuals and businesses globally. The \uc2 Stellar\uc2  network was created to support digital representations of any currency but has its native token called Lumens (XLM). Developed as a fork of the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  protocol, \uc2 Stellar\uc2  aims to create a global network connecting financial institutions, payment processors, and individual users, making cross-border money transfer easier and providing access to essential financial services.\par \par \uc2 Stellar\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/stellar/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM }}}\uc2  gained over 140% over the past week, peaking at $0.63 before pulling back. At the time of writing, XLM traded at $0.47. Down 52% from its ATH of $0.93, now would be an excellent time to get your hands on XLM before the next bull run disrupts the market.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT)\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) witnessed an exceptional surge, gaining over 100% in the past month and 55% over the past week. DOT, the 15th largest crypto by market cap, struggled to make gains over the past while trading as low as $3.69 early in November. Since Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory in the US Election, DOT has slowly been gaining ground, gaining over 52% this past week and 103% in the past month. DOT also reported an increase in its daily trading volume, and its price peaked at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/polkadot-price-analysis-11-24-dot-reclaims-8-briefly-visits-10-can-it-maintain-upward-momentum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $10.29 }}}\uc2  earlier today. Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s (DOT) rally cements its position in crypto and proves why it should not be disregarded despite its recent troubles. DOT\u8217\'20\'19s ATH is $55, meaning the potential profit to be made from this project is still enormous. The market pullback paves the way for investors to secure their stake in Polkadot.\par \par \uc2 First Convicted Raccon Fred (FRED)\par \par \uc2 Yes, you read that correctly. With the misspelling of \u8220\'20\'1CRacoon\u8221\'20\'1D in tow, FRED, like his buddy Peanut the Squirrel (PNUT), had several unbelievable daily gains in the past month. FRED and Peanut lived in the same house and were both seized and euthanized by New York state authorities over rabies concerns. The news of the passing of these beloved pets drew significant attention and quickly became viral sensations, with \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  making multiple posts about Peanut on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 . While not as big of a sensation as PNUT, FRED made a 383% leap in the space of a day.\par \par \uc2 Pet-focused memecoins have become a crypto goldmine with their ability to capture the hearts of traders and investors with the uncanny light-heartedness they bring to the often brutal crypto world.\par \par \uc2 These memecoins are quickly becoming more popular, and the altcoin market may soon be likened to a digital zoo. That brings us to our next subject: Husky Inu (HINU).\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) }}}\uc2  is the latest Solana-based dog-themed memecoin to grace the market. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/top-memecoins-to-invest-in-hinu-shib-floki-and-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  was created to bring its holders more value and utility by leveraging this robust blockchain. The project and its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/exciting-memecoins-to-watch-in-2024-shib-floki-doge-and-hinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU }}}\uc2 , want to make their mark on the saturated memecoin market by building a supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solana-memecoins-to-watch-hinu-maga-bonk-and-dawgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  recently launched the presale for HINU, and the fundraising has attracted a fair amount of attention. Since going live, the presale has generated over $567,000 and will soon reach its fundraising target.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s presale success is powered by its unique qualities and future plans, aiming to its own Earn App and Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the projects and completing minor tasks such as liking, reposting, and sharing content. Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading and, in doing so, will improve the utility and value of HINU for its holders.\par \par \uc2 The HINU presale is very close to reaching its fundraising target, meaning the time left to get in on this project is limited. Hurry now before you miss your chance on the next Shiba Inu (SHIB) or Dogecoin (DOGE).\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter }}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram }}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241125ekbo0000z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
