\par\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Nears $100K, But Dominance Declines as Alts Make Double-Digit Gains. Is This the Start of Altcoin Season?\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 1,395 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Dominance Peaks, Altcoins Step In }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Large Cap Altcoins Witness Price Surge }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cross-Border Payment Networks Ripple (XRP) and Stellar (XLM) Surge }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Weekly Active Addresses Cross 350K }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Crosses $0.40 in Reaction to Gensler News }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) Likely to Benefit on Timing }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) is firmly on its way to $100,000 after setting a new ATH of $99,655. BTC may soon reach this critical level, but its dominance has slightly declined after reaching a 60.58% peak recently. As Bitcoin Dominance (BTC.D) slows, large-cap altcoins are stepping in, making double-digit daily gains. Could this be the start of the altcoin season?\par \par \uc2 BTC set a new all-time high yesterday after news surfaced the previous night that \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 , Chairman of the US SEC, will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/bitcoin-btc-nears-100k-and-altcoins-surge-as-sec-confirms-genslers-exit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resign }}}\uc2  on January 20, 2025 \u8211\'20\'13 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s first day of his second term as President of the USA. The news triggered a price surge, with large-cap altcoins such as XRP, DOGE, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and XLM making double-digit daily gains.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Dominance Peaks, Altcoins Step In\par \par \uc2 BTC.D recently reached a high of 60.1% but has declined since, and top altcoins are stepping up to claim their share of the total market capitalization of cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Looking at the chart below, we see the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/altcoin-season-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoin Season Index }}}\uc2  measures at 32, moving out of Bitcoin Season territory. At the same time, the altcoin market cap reached $1.39 trillion, which is very close to entering the altcoin season territory.\par \par \uc2 Source: Coinmarketcap\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/bitcoin-dominance/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Dominance }}}\uc2  is a metric measuring BTC's relative share or dominance in the overall crypto sector. This measure represents the percentage of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s total market cap compared to the total market cap of all cryptocurrencies combined. The Altcoin Season Index, on the other hand, provides real-time insights into whether the crypto market is currently in Altcoin Season. The Index is based on the performance of the top 100 altcoins relative to BTC over the past 90 days.\par \par \uc2 Large Cap Altcoins Witness Price Surge\par \par \uc2 With the altcoin season nearing, investors have shifted their focus away from Bitcoin to smaller projects, leading to a surge in the prices of altcoins. Several positive news events have resulted in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  week for crypto, the most notable being \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 , Chair of the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s impending resignation.\par \par \uc2 Cross-Border Payment Networks Ripple (XRP) and \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM) Surge\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) }}}\uc2  has witnessed one of its best trading days, and its price gained over 12% in the past week. \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  has been embroiled in a highly publicized legal battle with the securities agency for which \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) paid a hefty price. In 2020, the regulator sued \uc2 Ripple\uc2  for its supposed breach of securities laws, resulting in many exchanges, such as \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Kraken, \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , and \uc2 Gemini\uc2 , choosing to delist XRP. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  finally found some relief after a partial victory in 2023 brought an end to the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s 3-year-long crusade against the company. The Southern District of New York Court delivered a partial victory to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  in its matter with the SEC after Judge Analisa Torres {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/07/xrp-value-soars-as-relisting-wave-follows-ripple-s-sec-victory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruled }}}\uc2  that \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP token is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot necessarily a security on its face.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price gained over 57% in the past week, reaching a day-high of $1.62. XRP\u8217\'20\'19s total market cap increased to $88.89 billion, and its 24-hour trading volume surged over 234% after the SEC announced Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s early. XRP currently trades at $1.56.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stellar.org/learn/lumens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar network }}}\uc2  is similar to the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ($XRP) network - a decentralised payment platform and cryptocurrency that facilitates quick and low-cost cross-border payments, promoting financial inclusion for individuals and businesses globally. The \uc2 Stellar\uc2  network was created to support digital representations of any currency but has its native token called Lumens (XLM). Developed as a fork of the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  protocol, \uc2 Stellar\uc2  aims to create a global network connecting financial institutions, payment processors, and individual users, making cross-border money transfer easier and providing access to essential financial services.\par \par \uc2 Stellar\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/stellar/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM }}}\uc2  gained over 58% in the past day to trade at $0.4516. XLM gained over 194% in the seven-day charts to become one of the top trading altcoins.\par \par \uc2 XRP and XLM are expected to play significant roles in the new global financial system, with XRP uniquely designed to optimize institutional liquidity for cross-border transactions. XLM\u8217\'20\'19s infrastructure, on the other hand, was built to facilitate peer-to-peer transactions and retail-level remittances efficiently. Financial experts envision a two-tiered monetary framework using XRP and XLM at different levels for specific purposes.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Weekly Active Addresses Cross 350K\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is another major gainer in recent weeks after Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s election victory. On-chain metrics show Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s weekly active addresses elevated since the crypto market rally triggered by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s win on November 6 began. The surge in network usage, coupled with whale buying activity, has resulted in a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  further surged after the Cardano Foundation, developers of the Cardano blockchain, released an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/proposal-for-cardano-constitution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 updated proposal for the Cardano Constitution }}}\uc2  to improve network governance. The revised proposal includes changes to constitutional workshops, social media discussion, and expert and community feedback. The changes aim to \u8220\'20\'1Cimprove the accessibility and clarity of the Cardano governance framework,\u8221\'20\'1D shifting its focus to a less technical audience. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is up over 27% in the past 24 hours, with a 51% weekly gain.\par \par \uc2 Interest in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) surged after its founder, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , revealed plans to help shape US crypto policy under Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s incoming administration. All in all, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has gained over 221% in the past month, and its outlook appears highly positive.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Crosses $0.40 in Reaction to Gensler News\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) reached a three-year peak on November 12 after Donald Trump announced \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s involvement in the proposed \uc2 Department of Government Efficiency (DOGE)\uc2  under his upcoming administration. DOGE surged 185% between November 5 and November 12 before a 13% dip in the days after. DOGE, however, reclaimed its $0.40 position after the news of Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s imminent departure was confirmed. DOGE gained over 18% in the past day and is currently trading at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/dogecoin/#News"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $0.4629 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) Likely to Benefit on Timing\par \par \uc2 Market onlookers and crypto enthusiasts reacted positively to the end of \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s brutal and belligerent regime. Under Gensler, several large crypto firms and prominent industry figures faced regulatory scrutiny and enforcement action, which drove many to seek refuge off US shores. Donald Trump won the hearts of a large part of the industry with a promise to make the US the world\u8217\'20\'19s crypto capital, and the relief brought by this promise is reflected in current market behaviour.\par \par \uc2 The renewed optimism toward digital assets will likely benefit new projects as investors regain trust and confidence in the industry.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU), the latest memecoin sensation from the Solana network, will surely reap the rewards of industry news. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-raises-over-55k-in-early-presale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  recently launched the presale of its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-presale-hits-100k-in-sales"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU }}}\uc2 , with tremendous success, and the two are on a mission to conquer the memecoin industry through a robust and supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards.\par \par \uc2 Since going live, the presale has generated over $565,000, with numbers expected to rise rapidly as the crypto market explodes. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  is working on some exciting things, including an Earn App and a Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the project, and the Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading to improve utility and value for HINU holders. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/5-cheap-memecoins-poised-to-make-millionaires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here }}}\par \par \uc2 Join the HINU presale now to enjoy the immense potential of the burgeoning crypto sector.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter }}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram }}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241124ekbn0000k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Dogecoin price\par \b \uc2 How high can the Dogecoin price go?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Biraajmaan Tamuly \par \uc2 723 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Dogecoin is 36% below its previous all-time high at $0.73, with a $1 target in sight before the end of 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzU3ZGEtYjYxYS03NTgzLTllOTgtYTZiZmUyNDhlZDY1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How high can the Dogecoin price go? }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) has rallied another 27% this week, reaching a new yearly high of $0.48 on Nov. 23.\par \par \uc2 The memecoin\u8217\'20\'19s monthly gains are a whopping 236%, and it remains the third-highest traded crypto asset based on 24-hour trading volumes with $19.5 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019357e7-5d2a-7f6c-aa6c-1426a41e9de9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Top 5 crypto 30-day returns chart. Source: CoingGecko\par \par \uc2 With the market speculating an all-time high (\uc2 ATH\uc2 ) retest at $0.73 over the next few days, multiple analysts hinted at higher targets in 2025.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin to $1 is \u8220\'20\'1Cinevitable\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin has demonstrated a strong breakout above its recent high at $0.43 on the 4-hour chart, with the relative strength index (RSI) and 50-day EMA acting as support during its higher-high sideways consolidation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01935834-63f3-7ed3-8bf7-2f315cc239c7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin 4-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 With a confirmed move above previous highs, Javon Marks, an independent analyst, mentioned that another 52.2% upside \u8220\'20\'1Ccould be well on the way.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Marks {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JavonTM1/status/1860091123286556919"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted }}}\uc2  that the immediate target range for Dogecoin is currently between $0.65 and $1.25.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Trader Tardigrade, a pattern analyst, said in an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/TATrader_Alan/status/1859583360127086667"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 X post }}}\uc2  that a $1 target is \u8220\'20\'1Cinevitable\u8221\'20\'1D for the memecoin. The trader observed the formation of a high-tight flag pattern and commented,\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18High Tight Flag Pattern\u8217\'20\'19 stands out as a rare, BUT Extremely \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal that indicates a highly possible significant upward price movement.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin at $3 coincides with Fibonacci targets\par \par \uc2 While a $1 target is expected in the next few days, a move above $0.73 opens up the possibility of a higher target by Q1 2025. On the monthly chart, Dogecoin has followed a repeatable target trend based on Fibonacci lines.\par \par \uc2 Since 2014, each bull market\u8217\'20\'19s cycle top and bottom have accurately predicted the next cycle top based on the 1.50 and 1.618 Fibonacci extensions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01935851-d538-7a6a-a345-bbf1b2187058"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin 1-month chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The expected target was exceeded by 732% in 2021 compared to 2018. With a new all-time high possibly in sight, the expected target in 2024 based on the FIB extensions lies between $2.90 and $3.60.\par \par \uc2 Earlier, Cointelegraph also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-s-parabolic-target-is-3-5-based-on-historically-parabolic-gaussian-channel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2  a high price target for Dogecoin based on the Gaussian principle, which outlined a range between $3 and $5 after incorporating the law of diminishing returns.\par \par \uc2 A similar target range established by a set of different analyses strengthens the possibility of DOGE reaching at least $3, which is another 566% of current prices.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-s-parabolic-target-is-3-5-based-on-historically-parabolic-gaussian-channel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Dogecoin to $5? It\u8217\'20\'19s possible according to a \u8216\'20\'18Gaussian channel\u8217\'20\'19 model }}}\par \par \uc2 Can DOGE price go as high as $30?\par \par \uc2 Most of the price targets for Dogecoin in 2025 are based on its historical performances. Similarly, Dima James Potts, an independent crypto trader, outlined an extremely high target for DOGE beyond $10.\par \par \uc2 James Potts illustrated a recurring pattern for Dogecoin where the cycle peak has occurred after approximately 1446 days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01935868-1277-7e64-8a03-5895391e866a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Markets, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin long-term analysis by Dima James Pott. Source: \uc2 Twitter\uc2 /X\par \par \uc2 Each cycle has outperformed the previous high, as mentioned above. Hence, Potts expected a similar outcome in 2025 as well. The trader mentioned,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe top could occur around January 19th, 2025. I believe this cycle will bring some of DOGECOIN's biggest gains yet, as each previous cycle's percentage gains have increased.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The chart above marked $36 as the price target for Dogecoin, another 80X from current prices. In terms of market cap, it will be roughly around ~$5.3 trillion. For context, the total crypto market is $3.5 trillion. Therefore, it is probably safe to assume that a $30+ price target for Dogecoin by Jan. 19, 2025, is unlikely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-22-btc-eth-sol-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-avax-shib-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Price analysis 11/22: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB, TON }}}\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzU3ZGEtYjYxYS03NTgzLTllOTgtYTZiZmUyNDhlZDY1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241123ekbn0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
