\par\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Nears $100K, and Altcoins Surge as SEC Confirms Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s Exit\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 967 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Rallies as Gensler Plans to Step Down }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  Jumps 13% After Cardano Releases Updated Constitution }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Reaches New ATH }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Great Things Ahead for Solana-Based Husky Inu (HINU) }}}\par \par \uc2 It has been a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  day for cryptocurrencies after the SEC announced that its chairman, \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 , will resign on January 20, 2025, the same day \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  begins his second term as President. Bitcoin (BTC) now nears the crucial $100,000 mark, and altcoins have surged following the announcement.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s been a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  day for Bitcoin (BTC) and some of the top altcoins such as \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) after \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 , chair of the SEC, announced his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/gary-gensler-to-step-down-as-sec-chair-ripple-xrp-surges-25-and-bitcoin-btc-nears-100000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 departure }}}\uc2  from the role on the same day President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  begin his second term. The market reacted favourably to the news, with altcoins including \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) making notable gains. BTC surged to a new ATH of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $99,502 }}}\uc2  and will likely soon reach the critical $100,000 level.\par \par \uc2 The news of Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s upcoming resignation fostered renewed optimism in the market, leading to incredible price runs for altcoins. Join us as we delve into today\u8217\'20\'19s top gainers and explore Husky Inu (HINU), the latest Solana-based memecoin with incredible profit opportunities.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Rallies as Gensler Plans to Step Down\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) }}}\uc2  has witnessed one of its best trading days, and its price gained over 25% after news of Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s planned exit surfaced. \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  has been embroiled in a highly publicized legal battle with the securities agency for which \uc2 Ripple\uc2  paid a hefty price. In 2020, the regulator sued \uc2 Ripple\uc2  for its supposed breach of securities laws, resulting in many exchanges, such as \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Kraken, \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 , and Gemini, choosing to delist XRP. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  finally found some relief after a partial victory in 2023 brought an end to the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s 3-year-long crusade against the company. The Southern District of New York Court delivered a partial victory to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  in its matter with the SEC after Judge Analisa Torres {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/07/xrp-value-soars-as-relisting-wave-follows-ripple-s-sec-victory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruled }}}\uc2  that \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP token is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot necessarily a security on its face.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price gained over 26% in the past 24 hours, reaching a day-high of $1.50. XRP\u8217\'20\'19s total market cap increased to $81.22 billion, and its 24-hour trading volume surged over 234%.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Jumps 13% After Cardano Releases Updated Constitution\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Foundation, developers of the Cardano blockchain, released an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/proposal-for-cardano-constitution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 updated proposal for the Cardano Constitution }}}\uc2  to improve network governance. The revised proposal includes changes to constitutional workshops, social media discussion, and expert and community feedback. The changes aim to \u8220\'20\'1Cimprove the accessibility and clarity of the Cardano governance framework,\u8221\'20\'1D shifting its focus to a less technical audience. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  surged 13% }}}\uc2  after the updated proposal was made public.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of the top-gaining altcoins, surging by over 153% in the past month. The altcoin skyrocketed after Cardano founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2  revealed plans to help shape US crypto policy under \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s incoming administration.\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) Reaches New ATH\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is one of the hottest altcoins this year, with gains exceeding 367% in the past year. The \uc2 Solana\uc2  network is the go-to platform for memecoin developments thanks to its ability to handle high TPS at low transaction fees. The power of the \uc2 Solana\uc2  blockchain and the network\u8217\'20\'19s robust and active community make it the ideal space for memecoin development.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) }}}\uc2  has become a formidable player in the crypto space, and now it is targeting a considerable part of Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s (ETH) market share. \uc2 SOL\uc2  reached a new ATH of $263.70 today as Solana ETF regulatory filings surged after \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  confirmed his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/solana-etf-regulatory-filings-surge-as-gensler-confirms-sec-departure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 departure }}}\uc2  from the SEC.\par \par \uc2 Great Things Ahead for Solana-Based Husky Inu (HINU)\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is reaching its peak dominance after the halving event earlier this year, which signals the start of the altcoin season. Alt season means investors turn their attention to smaller projects, which leads to significant price gains for these projects. Altcoins have witnessed a considerable run recently spurred by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s election win and news of \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s exit from the SEC.\par \par \uc2 As BTC trades at a record price and altcoins reach new heights, investors must look for well-priced alternative investment opportunities to profit from the bull run, and Husky Inu is precisely that.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) }}}\uc2  is the latest Solana-based memecoin to grace the market. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/top-memecoins-to-invest-in-hinu-shib-floki-and-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  was created to bring its holders more value and utility by leveraging this powerful blockchain. The project and its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/exciting-memecoins-to-watch-in-2024-shib-floki-doge-and-hinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU }}}\uc2 , want to make their mark on the saturated memecoin market by building a supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solana-memecoins-to-watch-hinu-maga-bonk-and-dawgz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu }}}\uc2  recently launched the presale for HINU, and the fundraising has attracted a fair amount of attention. Since going live, the presale has generated over $563,000 and will soon reach its fundraising target.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s presale success is powered by its unique qualities and future plans, aiming to its own Earn App and Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the projects and completing minor tasks such as liking, reposting, and sharing content. Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading and, in doing so, will improve the utility and value of HINU for its holders.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter }}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram }}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241123ekbm0001p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
