\uc2 Price analysis 11/22: BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,825 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strength has pulled several altcoins higher, but the risks of a short-term pullback have increased.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzU0ZTctYzUyZC03NTNlLTk3YjMtMDNmM2Q4MWU3ODdk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/22: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB, TON }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) is showing no signs of slowing down as it came within a whisker of hitting the psychologically critical level of $100,000 on Nov. 22. Material Indicators co-founder Keith Alan {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-counts-down-100k-btc-price-shorts-risk-violent-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautioned short sellers }}}\uc2  in a post on X to be \u8220\'20\'1Cprepared to get squeezed\u8221\'20\'1D if they sell at current levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally is supported by strong inflows into United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  said in a post on X that the US spot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-stock-etf-trading-volumes-soar-record-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs crossed the $100 billion mark }}}\uc2  in assets on Nov. 21, which is 82% the size of the gold ETFs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e5-7468-71b8-b97e-a41e85e8a626"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 Newbie traders generally tend to chase prices higher during a strong bull phase, but caution is warranted. The sharp rally of the past few days has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-record-40-monthly-candle-crosses-99-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pushed \b  \highlight22investor sentiment\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  into the \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D category at 87, according to data from CoinMarketCap\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Increasing greed poses a risk of a short-term pullback.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin accelerate once it crosses $100,000, or is a near-term correction possible? How are the altcoins likely to behave? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been in a strong uptrend, but the rally could face resistance at the psychological level of $100,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e5-e904-7733-abbb-0276b6f6f375"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not cede much ground to the bears, it will suggest that the buyers are holding on to their positions as they anticipate the rally to continue. Above $100,000, the BTC/USDT pair could reach $113,331 and then $125,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the uptrend line. That could tempt short-term traders to book profits, pulling the price to the 20-day exponential moving average ($86,473). A break and close below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the bears are on a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($3,042) and broke above the $3,225 resistance on Nov. 21, indicating that the bulls are trying to take charge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e6-8bb9-7af8-9e49-a3d3e6d68577"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength (RSI) in the positive zone indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers pierce the downtrend line, the ETH/USDT pair could soar to $3,900 and eventually to $4,094.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $3,000. The pair may drop to $2,850, which is an important level for the bulls to defend. If this support gives way, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after breaking out of $249 on Nov. 21 and hit a new all-time high above $264 on Nov. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e7-1d05-7915-a62a-1b17fae0f286"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A new all-time high is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as it shows solid demand for the asset. With no overhead resistance, a new high clears the path for further gains. If buyers maintain the price above $248, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to skyrocket to $304.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($218) is the vital support to watch out for on the downside. If the price tumbles below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are rushing to the exit. A local short-term top will be signaled on a break below $200.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day simple moving average ($594) on Nov. 21, indicating that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e7-a60c-7cd9-a44a-7b2ff505ee93"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could rise to $667, a near-term resistance to watch out for. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could surge to $722. This level may act as a strong hurdle, but if the bulls cross it, the pair could jump to $810.\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA is the crucial support to watch out for on the downside. If this level breaks down, the pair could drop to the uptrend line. The deeper the pullback, the greater the time needed for the next leg of the uptrend to begin.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) resumed its up move after buyers pushed the price above the $1.27 resistance on Nov. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e8-5a6e-738c-864f-9f5c9814dd3f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The vertical rally in the XRP/USDT pair has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought territory. If bulls maintain the momentum, the pair could reach $1.70, but vertical rallies are rarely sustainable.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the breakout level of $1.27. A break and close below $1.27 could tempt buyers to book profits. That may increase the selling pressure, pulling the pair toward $1.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a wide range between $0.34 and $0.44 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e8-e3ce-72f6-beff-447eeffb7395"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.32) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought territory indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls drive the price above $0.44, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.50 and then to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to swiftly pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the selling could pick up, and the pair may plummet to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.29 and later to the 61.8% retracement level of $0.25.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose and closed above the $0.80 hurdle on Nov. 20, signaling the start of the next leg of the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354e9-7671-70c9-8cc7-102873b60093"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price to the psychological level of $1, which is expected to act as a strong resistance. If the price turns down from $1 but does not skid below $0.80, it will indicate that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That increases the possibility of a break above $1. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then ascend to $1.25.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below $0.80, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair may plunge to the 20-day EMA ($0.63).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-solana-price-up-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ) broke above the resistance line of the ascending channel pattern on Nov. 22, indicating that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354ea-0d03-7906-8d34-18647fdd1e4c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the resistance line, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could surge to $42 and subsequently to $50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will signal that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair may then dip to the 50-day SMA ($28.71), extending the stay inside the channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB }}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($0.000023) on Nov. 21, signaling that the bulls continue to buy the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354ea-abc0-7fae-9e74-a423d56568c4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the price above the $0.000026 resistance to open the doors for a retest of the $0.000029 level. A break and close above $0.000029 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverted head-and-shoulders pattern, starting an up move to $0.000039 and later to the pattern target of $0.000047.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are back in the game. The SHIB/USDT pair may slump to the SMA ($0.000020).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON }}}\uc2  ) turned up from the moving averages on Nov. 21, indicating that the bulls are attempting to form a higher low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019354eb-38a8-78ed-9eb4-cb23df218e88"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Gold, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CoinMarketCap, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.30) is gradually sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers. The TON/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $6, an essential level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it may propel the pair to $7.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to regain control, they will have to yank the price below the moving averages and challenge the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzU0ZTctYzUyZC03NTNlLTk3YjMtMDNmM2Q4MWU3ODdk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241122ekbm000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 925 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token continues to rise in line with the broader crypto market, and a strengthening market setup points to further upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continued its uptrend on Nov. 22, rising 11% over the last 24 hours to trade at $0.860. The 176% growth in price since Nov. 5 has seen the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/a-beginners-guide-to-understanding-the-layers-of-blockchain-technology"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 layer-1 }}}\uc2  token rise to a 2.5-year high of $0.90 on Nov. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353b2-d69c-7eb6-8a11-204214aad0ba"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  catalysts driving \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price up today.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rises alongside Bitcoin, Ethereum\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment was not only exclusive to Cardano as crypto prices also rallied across the board, buoyed by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-presidential-victory-paves-way-100k-bitcoin-end-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-presidential-victory-paves-way-100k-bitcoin-end-2024 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s march }}}\uc2  toward the $100,00 mark.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ), the largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, led the gains and has jumped 10% over the last week to set a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-record-40-monthly-candle-crosses-99-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time high of $99,502 }}}\uc2  on Nov. 22, including 46% gains since Nov. 5.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) has rallied more than 6.8% over the last 24 hours to trade above $3,330.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353b3-5b4e-74f8-97df-e3191395a370"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 24-hour performance of top-cap cryptocurrencies: Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Other top-cap cryptocurrencies, including BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2 , XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ), and Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ), have also posted significant gains over the last 24 hours. Solana ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-breaks-all-time-high-coinbase-2-years-after-ftx-catastrophe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hit new all-time highs }}}\uc2  of $263 during the early Asian trading hours on Nov. 22.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the total crypto market cap has increased by 3% over the last 24 hours and 48% over the last two weeks to rest at $3.28 trillion at the time of publication.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-20-btc-eth-sol-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-shib-ton-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/20: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB, TON, AVAX }}}\par \par \uc2 This performance comes from the crypto community\u8217\'20\'19s expectation of a more crypto-friendly regulatory environment under Trump\u8217\'20\'19s administration.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2024-182"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announcement }}}\uc2  by the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s (SEC) Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  that he will resign on Jan. 20, the same day that US President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  will be inaugurated, appears to have added to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  mood.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353b3-e87e-7f14-8800-dfa04e37b8e2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/GaryGensler/status/1859658192298574096"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gary Gensler }}}\par \par \uc2 Trump had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/donald-trump-pledges-fire-sec-chair-gary-gensler"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 promised to fire Gensler }}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Con day one\u8221\'20\'1D of his second term in office.\par \par \uc2 The crypto community believes Trump will have a more lenient approach and that any \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be lighter with another person at the helm of SEC than it has been under Gensler.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees a spike in funding rates\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action on Nov. 22 is preceded by a jump in open interest-weighted funding rate. The chart below shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 8-hour OI-weighted funding rate increased to 0.0417% on Nov. 22.\par \par \uc2 This suggests a high appetite for long positions as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price gained around 11% over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353b4-5ead-74e0-bb90-8e678e4b4145"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  OI-weighted funding rates. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rally on Nov. 22 was accompanied by short liquidations totaling $3.17 million against $1.37 million in long liquidations, with that tally continuing at the time of publication.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353b4-e416-729f-b4b9-c65f082c7778"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  liquidations. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 In other words, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rise to $0.860 caught short traders off-guard.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price has strong support at $0.80\par \par \uc2 With \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price trading near $0.90, traders appear to have established a strong demand zone around the $0.80 price range.\par \par \uc2 Data from IntoTheBlock {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.intotheblock.com/market-intelligence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows }}}\uc2  that between $0.7829 and $0.8095, over 66,250 \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  addresses had moved 1.68 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens for an average price of $0.7965.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353b5-4d02-7d7e-afd4-2c47b74dc69a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano IOMAP chart. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 This particular demand zone coincides with the weekly chart\u8217\'20\'19s 200 simple moving average (SMA).\par \par \uc2 The same IOMAP chart above shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  sits on relatively strong support on the downside compared to its upward resistance. This suggests that the path with the least resistance for the token is upward.\par \par \uc2 This view is shared by pseudonymous technical analyst Sssebi who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Av_Sebastian/status/1859818202081132633"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 says }}}\uc2  that there is not much resistance for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price until around the $1.2 supplier congestion zone.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe could see an explosion from here.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A close look at the technical setup reveals that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD seeks to end a multiyear downtrend. The daily chart below shows that the multiyear descending trend line at $0.481, embraced by the 50-week SMA, is another area of strong support for XRP price.\par \par \uc2 The moving average convergence divergence (MACD) indicator has just produced a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal. This happened when the MACD line (blue) crossed above the signal line (orange) during the week ending Nov. 8, suggesting that the bulls are back in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353b5-d27b-72e8-8ec7-729da67c5267"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/dQBzGKV3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 It is worth noting that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s latest rally has seen it flip key levels into support, including the 100-week and 200-week SMAs at $0.408 and $0.759, respectively.\par \par \uc2 The $1.20 will likely serve as the next big milestone for the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bulls.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241122ekbm0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Why is Solana price up today?\par \b \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 564 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  has entered the breakout stage of its prevailing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation pattern, now eyeing a rally to over $280 in November.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWVhNGEtZWU0My03NTk1LTliZjItOTUzOTgyODFlYzJj.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) price is rallying alongside the rest of the cryptocurrency market amid \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-chair-gary-gensler-step-down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decision }}}\uc2  to resign as \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s (SEC) chairman.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  pumps alongside tokens targeted by the SEC\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price jumped by over 12% after Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s announcement, reaching around $264.50 on Nov. 22 (data from \uc2 BitStamp\uc2 ), inching further closer to its record high of $267.50 established three years ago.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353d8-c89e-7f52-adc3-967aae76713c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase, Cryptocurrencies, DApps, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Analysis, Solana }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ongoing price boom is similar to rallies witnessed across assets that were targeted by the SEC under Gensler\u8217\'20\'19s tenure. That includes XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ), a token associated with \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jumped by over 25% }}}\uc2  following the news.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-lawsuits-quietly-go-away-after-gensler-steps-down-pantera-clo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC lawsuits will \u8216\'20\'18quietly go away\u8217\'20\'19 after Gensler steps down: Pantera }}}\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-ada-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jumped by approximately 11.50% }}}\uc2  to reach $0.922, its highest level since April 2022. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and XRP, like \uc2 SOL\uc2 , were targeted in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-cftc-motion-to-compel-subpoenadocs-defend-sec-suit#:~:text=In%20June%202023%2C%20the%20SEC,securities%20exchange%2C%20and%20clearing%20agency."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC\u8217\'20\'19s litigations }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353de-b8ba-7731-a701-0d9d66d15f90"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase, Cryptocurrencies, DApps, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Analysis, Solana }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price performance. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump, a vocal supporter of cryptocurrencies, previously vowed to dismiss Gensler. The president-elect has pledged to establish a crypto-friendly regulatory framework in the US and possibly even create a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/texas-discussion-introduce-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-satoshi-action-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strategic Bitcoin reserve }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Wall Street firms apply for spot Solana ETFs\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 21, the Cboe BZX Exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-etf-issuers-file-19b-4-gary-gensler-resign-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 submitted }}}\uc2  four 19b-4 filings to list spot Solana exchange-traded funds (ETFs) from prominent asset managers like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cdn.cboe.com/resources/regulation/rule_filings/pending/2024/SR-CboeBZX-2024-119.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitwise, }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cdn.cboe.com/resources/regulation/rule_filings/pending/2024/SR-CboeBZX-2024-117.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VanEck, }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cdn.cboe.com/resources/regulation/rule_filings/pending/2024/SR-CboeBZX-2024-116.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 21Shares }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cdn.cboe.com/resources/regulation/rule_filings/pending/2024/SR-CboeBZX-2024-120.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Canary Capital }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 These ETFs will trade on the Chicago Board Options Exchange\u8217\'20\'19s BZX platform if approved.\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, Bitwise had already {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-registers-solana-etf-delaware"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 registered a statutory trust }}}\uc2  in Delaware for a spot Solana ETF on Nov. 20, signaling its intention to join the regulatory race. The company followed up with its S-1 filing on Nov. 21, aligning its efforts with other industry leaders.\par \par \uc2 The timing of these filings\u8212\'20\'14on the same day Gensler announced his resignation\u8212\'20\'14has fueled upside sentiment in the \uc2 SOL\uc2  market, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/lookonchain/status/1859815155930103995"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data }}}\uc2  showing accumulation by Solana whales.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353e5-a6e1-7455-b040-cae690353166"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase, Cryptocurrencies, DApps, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Analysis, Solana }}}\par \par \uc2 Source: Lookonchain\par \par \uc2 In other words, high-net-worth investors anticipate future price growth, which is reinforcing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment among smaller traders.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  bull pennant breakout eyes $280 next\par \par \uc2 Today, \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price gains are part of the breakout emerging from its prevailing bull pennant pattern.\par \par \uc2 The pennant is a triangle-like consolidation pattern, marked by higher lows and lower highs. In technical analysis, this chart pattern is typically considered as a continuation pattern in a bull market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019353ee-b9d0-7269-811f-3d8b42eafacc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase, Cryptocurrencies, DApps, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Analysis, Solana }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD four-hour price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 It resolves when the price breaks above the upper trendline and rises by as much as the height of the previous uptrend. Thus, this month's next major \uc2 SOL\uc2  price target for the bulls is around $284.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWVhNGEtZWU0My03NTk1LTliZjItOTUzOTgyODFlYzJj.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241122ekbm0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Solana\uc2  breaks all-time high on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , 2 years after \uc2 FTX\uc2  catastrophe\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Martin Young \par \uc2 398 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  is one of the best-performing crypto assets today with its price breaching its all-time high set in November 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzUxZGEtMDYxMC03NzE1LTlmNTMtYjMxN2Q5MWM3NGI2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana breaks all-time high on Coinbase, 2 years after FTX catastrophe }}}\par \par \uc2 Solana finally broke a new record high on Nov. 22, two years after the \uc2 FTX\uc2  exchange collapsed and pulled down prices of the layer-1 blockchain token.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) prices tapped $264.31 on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  on Nov. 22, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=COINBASE%3ASOLUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according }}}\uc2  to TradingView. The move follows an impressive 11% gain over the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  has been one of the better-performing altcoins this year, having gained 160% since the beginning of 2024.\par \par \uc2 The asset fell to a cycle low of just under $10 in December 2022 after the collapse of former \uc2 FTX\uc2  CEO \uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s crypto empire.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019351df-6bea-7e26-bf03-714a9a0aaeb3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 . Source: \uc2 Tradingview\par \par \uc2 Momentum for the asset has been driven by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-etf-issuers-file-19b-4-gary-gensler-resign-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filings }}}\uc2  this week from Bitwise, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/odds-favor-solana-etf-2025-van-eck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VanEck }}}\uc2 , \uc2 21Shares\uc2  and Canary Capital to issue spot Solana exchange-traded funds.\par \par \uc2 Analysts have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-targets-400-after-monthly-cup-and-handle-breakout-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 targeted }}}\uc2  a high of $400 for \uc2 SOL\uc2  once the previous all-time high of $260 was overcome.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s popularity and demand for \uc2 SOL\uc2  have been primarily driven by memecoin speculation this cycle since it is cheap and easy to mint them on the network.\par \par \uc2 Decentralized finance (DeFi) on \uc2 Solana\uc2  has also seen impressive growth, gaining more than 500% in terms of total value locked this year, which has now reached $8.8 billion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according }}}\uc2  to DefiLlama.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/memecoin-frenzy-sees-solana-based-dapps-rake-in-record-fees"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana-based DApps rake in record fees as memecoin frenzy returns }}}\par \par \uc2 The promise of friendlier crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  under President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has ignited crypto markets over the past couple of weeks, driving total market capitalization to an all-time high of $3.42 trillion on Nov. 22.\par \par \uc2 Altcoin momentum has also been driven by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-chair-gary-gensler-step-down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announcement }}}\uc2  of SEC Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s resignation in January. During his tenure, Gensler regularly asserted that every crypto asset aside from Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price%20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) was a security.\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) is also performing well, with a 27% surge to top out at $1.40 during early trading on Nov. 22. Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ) were also seeing double-digit gains at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/bitcoins-100k-taxman-btc-commodity-china-vitalik-moo-deng-asia-express/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s $100K push wakes taxman, Vitalik visits real Moo Deng: Asia Express }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzUxZGEtMDYxMC03NzE1LTlmNTMtYjMxN2Q5MWM3NGI2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241122ekbm00005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
