\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,816 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally to $100,000 is likely to trigger aggressive buying in select altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzRhOTMtNDgzMS03MmVmLWFlMmUtODZkMTg1MWViZDI4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/20: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB, TON, AVAX }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) bulls have kept up the pressure, and the price is trying to climb above $95,000. Options contracts on \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF), the \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust ETF\uc2  (IBIT), launched on Nov. 19, were an instant hit.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg ETF analyst James Seyffart said in a post on X that IBIT options recorded {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-options-unheard-of-day-one-volume"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 roughly $1.9 billion in notional exposure }}}\uc2 , and that could be the reason for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s new all-time high on Nov. 19.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is nearing $100,000, but \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , the largest corporate holder of Bitcoin, is not showing any signs of slowing down its purchases. The business intelligence firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/micro-strategy-to-sell-2-6-b-in-notes-increasing-from-1-75-b-to-fund-bitcoin-purchases"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed plans to raise $2.6 billion }}}\uc2  from senior convertible notes to buy more Bitcoin and for general corporate purposes.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a74-6830-767c-8fec-93e68e5a5b08"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 Although several analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s prospects, onchain data service CryptoQuant highlighted in a post on X that five indicators warn that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/warning-signs-bitcoin-nearing-price-peak-crypto-quant"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could be close to its local peak }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin break out of $100,000, triggering solid buying in the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose to a new all-time high on Nov. 20, indicating the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a75-06ed-7674-8fc8-dd9ce76a0d7b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair is likely to reach $100,000, where the bears will try to halt the up move. However, the upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($83,818) and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the overbought zone signal that the bulls remain in control. If the $100,000 resistance is surpassed, the rally could reach $113,331.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the uptrend line. That could tempt short-term traders to book profits. A deeper correction could begin on a close below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push and maintain Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) above the $3,220 level on Nov. 18, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a75-e4ae-7af3-98f9-92bd06e5d067"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The crucial support to watch out for on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($2,986). If the support holds, the bulls will again try to kick the price above $3,220. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair may rally to the downtrend line. Sellers are expected to mount a vigorous defense at the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The trend will tilt in favor of the bears if the price skids below the 20-day EMA. The pair may tumble to $2,850 and later to the 50-day SMA ($2,688).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $248 on Nov. 18, but the shallow pullback suggests that the bulls are not rushing to the exit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a79-e961-7a70-ac0b-c305eb6f869b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the overbought territory, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the upside. There is stiff resistance at $260, but if the buyers bulldoze their way through, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could ascend to $304.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, the failure to shove the price above the overhead resistance zone of $248 to $260 could tempt several short-term traders to book profits. That may pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($209).\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) is taking support at the 20-day EMA ($610), indicating that the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a7a-9617-7aa8-9cf4-81e19755acfe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to quickly propel the price above $667 to strengthen their position. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $722. This level is expected to act as a solid barrier, but if the bulls prevail, the pair may skyrocket to $810.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price closes below the 50-day SMA ($591). The pair may then descend to the uptrend line, which is again likely to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $1 and $1.20 after the recent vertical rally, indicating that the bulls are not hurrying to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a7b-2714-7640-a276-93805766b3fd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again attempt to drive the price above $1.27. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could resume the uptrend. The pair could extend its rally to $1.27 and subsequently to $1.70.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the $1.27 resistance and pull the price below the psychological support of $1. If that happens, the pair may enter a deeper correction toward the 20-day EMA ($0.81). Such a move is likely to delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted to push Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) above the $0.44 resistance on Nov. 19, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a7b-c249-7584-a0bb-421cab76f1a2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair is stuck between $0.33 and $0.44 for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the price rises above $0.44, it will signal that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That could drive the pair to $0.50 and later to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break below $0.33 will indicate that the bulls are dumping their positions. That could sink the pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.30), an important short-term support to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the $0.80 barrier on Nov. 20, indicating the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a7c-5888-7997-a5e6-80d7b93c00b6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $0.80, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could surge to the psychological level of $1. This level may act as a strong obstacle, but if cleared, the pair may move up to $1.25.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $0.70. That could tempt short-term buyers to book profits, pulling the pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.58).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-all-time-high-above-94k-hodler-sell-off-warning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price all-time high above $94K comes amid Bitcoin sell-off warning }}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB }}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 20-day EMA ($0.000023), but the bulls have failed to clear the $0.000026 hurdle. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a80-62db-75d6-a1d6-d7271451d49e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.000026. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory give a slight edge to the buyers. A close above $0.000026 could propel the SHIB/USDT pair to the overhead resistance of $0.000029.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may slump to the 50-day SMA ($0.000019), which is expected to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON }}}\uc2  ) is struggling to start a rebound off the moving averages, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a80-fce9-7022-b22a-d6f14cc82389"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the TON/USDT pair could fall to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. Buyers are expected to defend this zone with all their might because a close below $4.44 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That may sink the pair to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and retain the price above $6 to signal a comeback. The pair may then climb to $7.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers thwarted attempts by the bulls to push Avalanche ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX }}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the ascending channel on Nov. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934a81-a635-7b17-ab40-60fff916e0ff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, Bitcoin ETF, ETF }}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($31.59) is the critical support to watch out for on the downside. If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will signal buying on dips. That increases the likelihood of a breakout above the resistance line. The AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $42 and then to $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then dip toward the 50-day SMA ($28.24), extending its stay inside the channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzRhOTMtNDgzMS03MmVmLWFlMmUtODZkMTg1MWViZDI4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241120ekbk000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
