\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 11-19 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, INJECTIVE: INJ, CHAINLINK: LINK, APTOS: APT, UNISWAP: UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,805 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump Media In Talks To Buy Crypto Trading Platform Bakkt }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Goldman Sachs To Spin Out Crypto Platform }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Faces Potential Correction }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Injective (INJ) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aptos (APT) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) continued to hover around the $90,000-$91,000 levels as sellers continued to prevent a move higher. The world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency registered a marginal increase over the past 24 hours, trading just above the $91,000 level. Analysts believe BTC has plenty of room to grow, with ARK Invest\u8217\'20\'19s Cathy Wood stating that despite its significant upside, BTC has a long way to go before it reaches its full potential.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has been relatively muted, with other altcoins making small gains. Ethereum (ETH) is up almost 2%, while Solana (SOL) is up 0.68%. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) }}}\uc2  has continued its upward trajectory and is currently up by 1% as bulls look to flip the $1 level to support. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) }}}\uc2  also notched up minor gains. However, Toncoin (TON), Chainlink (LINK), \uc2 Stellar\uc2  (XLM), and Polkadot (DOT) defined market trends and notched up substantial gains. The global crypto market cap inched higher by 1% and is currently at $3.08 trillion. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://changenow.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ChangeNOW }}}\uc2  CMO Pauline Shangett stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe crypto market's muted performance may be the calm before the storm. Bitcoin's resilience in the $90K-$91K range, coupled with steady gains in Ethereum and Solana, suggests that a broader breakout could be on the horizon if market sentiment shifts. Cathy Wood's assertion aligns with our view: Bitcoin's true potential is far from realized. While the $91K level acts as a key psychological marker, the real story is in the sustained adoption and innovation fueling the sector.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump Media In Talks To Buy Crypto Trading Platform \uc2 Bakkt\par \par \uc2 Trump Media is in advanced talks to buy crypto trading platform \uc2 Bakkt\uc2 , sending shares of the platform soaring. The company, majority-owned by President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , also operates the Truth Social app, also saw its shares surge following the reports. Kelly Loeffler, a former CEO of \uc2 Bakkt\uc2 , is the co-chair of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inauguration committee. \uc2 Bakkt\uc2  went public in 2021 and generated over $50 million in revenue last year, according to data from \uc2 FactSet\uc2 . The exchange\u8217\'20\'19s current market capitalization is just over $400 million.\par \par \uc2 Trump is also set to meet \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brian Armstrong\uc2  in the pair\u8217\'20\'19s first meeting since the election. However, details on the meeting\u8217\'20\'19s agenda remain unclear. The meeting comes as Trump picks his cabinet and decides on other crucial roles. The President-elect plans to appoint a Bitcoin and crypto advisory council. Armstrong has publicly supported Hester Pierce, a Trump SEC Commissioner to lead the regulator. \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  also contributed over $100 million to various political action committees.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  To Spin Out Crypto Platform\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  is preparing to spin out its crypto platform and create a new company focused on creating and trading financial instruments on various blockchain networks. The bank revealed it is speaking to potential collaborators to add to the platform\u8217\'20\'19s capabilities and help develop new offerings. Mathew McDermott, Goldman\u8217\'20\'19s Head of Digital Assets, said the spinout would be completed in 12-18 months, depending on regulatory approvals, stating it was in the market's best interest to have something industry-owned. He also revealed \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  was planning to create marketplaces for tokenized real-world assets and focus on the \u8220\'20\'1Cfund complex\u8221\'20\'1D in the United States and European debt markets.\par \par \uc2 The bank will target large financial institutions over retail investors, and the new products will depend entirely on permissioned blockchains.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Faces Potential Correction\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/crypto-price-analysis-11-18-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-polkadot-dot-dogecoin-doge-ripple-xrp-celestia-tia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) }}}\uc2  has remained around $90,000 over the past few sessions. However, analysts have warned it could face a significant short-term correction. According to a market update by CryptoQuant, BTC could face a potential dip to the $70,000 price range due to a market cooling phase. This means despite its recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency could face a significant pullback before it reaches $100,000 or higher. CryptoQuant suggested two possible scenarios for BTC in the near term. The first scenario could see BTC consolidate within the $87,000 to $93,000 range before gathering momentum and going beyond $100,000. BTC could see a jump to $120,000\par \par \uc2 The second scenario could see BTC drop to $70,000 before resuming its upward trajectory to reach $100,000. However, despite the potential for a significant dip, BTC whales continue accumulating Bitcoin, indicating strong market confidence.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) }}}\uc2  is trading around the $91,500 mark, registering an increase of just over 1% during the past 24 hours. Market watchers have mixed predictions about BTC\u8217\'20\'19s future price movements. CryptoQuant has stated BTC may decline to $70,000 before resuming its uptrend or consolidate between $87,000-$93,000 before going past $100,000. ARK Invest\u8217\'20\'19s Cathy Wood, a long-time supporter of BTC, has stated that despite its impressive performance, the asset has a long way to go before reaching its full potential, adding that ARK Invest remains confident in the asset\u8217\'20\'19s future trajectory. Wood believes BTC will continue to gain momentum as regulatory concerns ease under a new administration.\par \par \uc2 BTC has registered a marginal decline since registering a new all-time high just under a week ago. However, buyers have prevented a drop below $90,000, indicating that \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment could resume and power the asset past $100,000.\par \par \uc2 Looking at the price chart, BTC may have entered into a consolidation phase after setting a new all-time high, with the price oscillating between $88,000 and $93,000. BTC started the previous week with a significant increase of 9.43% and settled at $87,706. However, it faced considerable selling pressure on Tuesday, dropping to a low of $82,709 before recovering and settling at $87,210, registering a marginal decline. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned Wednesday as BTC surged to a new all-time high, hitting $93,434 before declining and settling at $90,150. However, sellers regained control on Thursday as BTC fell just over 3%, slipping below $90,000 and settling at $87,324.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/FPbjDRG8/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Friday saw BTC recover and push back above $90,000, rising almost 4% and settling at $90,726. However, BTC turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend, dropping by 0.67% on Saturday and 0.73% on Sunday to slip below $90,000 and settle at $89,464. Buyers attempted to go above $93,000 on Monday as the price rose to an intraday high of $92,549 before declining and settling at $90,509. The current session sees BTC up by 1.25% and trading around $91,600 as it inches towards the $92,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 So, what next for BTC? Analysts expect BTC to enter a period of consolidation before breaking past $95,000 and surging to $100,000. On the other hand, some analysts predict a considerable decline in the short term which could see the \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $70,000 before resuming its upward trajectory. However, the consensus is BTC will push above $100,000 during this bull run.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) }}}\uc2  failed to push above $3,400 at the beginning of last week, with sellers driving the price down considerably. However, buyers kept the price above $3,000, preventing a further decline. ETH started the previous week on a highly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note as the price surged almost 6% to go above $3,300 and settle at $3,373. Buyers attempted a move to $3,500 on Tuesday as ETH reached an intraday high of $3,443 before losing momentum. As a result, sellers took control and drove the price down by 3,78% to $3,246. ETH registered a significant increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, rising to an intraday high of $3,338 and falling to an intraday low of $3,120 before settling at $3,191, a drop of almost 2%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Thursday as ETH fell by 4.12% to $3,059, struggling to stay above $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zJjWAlb2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH fell to an intraday low of $3,013 on Friday but recovered to register an increase of 0.99% and settle at $3,090. The weekend began with buyers in control on Saturday as the price rose to an intraday high of $3,218 before settling at $3,133. However, the price fell back in the red on Sunday, dropping almost 2% to $3,075. However, despite the selling pressure, ETH remained above $3,000. The current week began with ETH registering a significant increase of 4.37% and settling at $3,209. However, the current session sees ETH back in the red, down by 2.52% and trading at $3,130.\par \par \uc2 If sellers can drive ETH below $3,000, we could see the \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $2,850. However, buyers have not ceded ground to the bears and prevented a drop below this level. If buyers can retake control and build momentum, ETH could test the resistance at $3,400. A break above this level could see ETH surge past $3,500.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) started the week positively, surging past $225. However, it faces considerable resistance at $250, with sellers preventing a move above this level. SOL lost momentum the previous week after starting it positively, rising almost 6% and settling at $222. Sellers took control on Tuesday as SOL dropped by 4.69% and settled at $211. Sellers continued influencing the price on Wednesday as SOL dropped to an intraday low of $201. However, it recovered from this level to register an increase of 1.69% and ended the day at $215. Buyers attempted to build on Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s momentum as SOL reached an intraday high of $222 on Thursday. However, the price fell after reaching this level, dropping almost 3% to $209.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/YRiROvpm/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL recovered on Friday as it attempted to break out of its trading range, rising over 4% and settling at $218. The weekend began with a decline as SOL dropped 1.30% on Saturday and settled at $215. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Sunday as SOL rallied over 10% to surge past $225 and settle at $237, ending the weekend on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Monday as SOL rose to an intraday high of $248, with bulls setting their sights at $250. However, with sellers active at this level, SOL fell back to settle at $239, an increase of 1.04%. The current session sees SOL marginally up, trading at $241 as buyers look to build momentum and retest the resistance at $250. On the other hand, sellers will attempt to retake control and drive the price below $225.\par \par \uc2 Injective (INJ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Injective (INJ) has seen significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past week as buyers attempt to push the price above $27 and sellers look to drive it below the moving averages. INJ started the previous week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, rising almost 5% to settle at $26.89. However, with sellers active at this level, INJ dipped nearly 9%, falling to an intraday low of $23.47 before recovering and settling at $24.50. INJ registered a substantial increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday as it surged to an intraday high of $27.08 and fell to an intraday low of $22.34 before settling at $24.15. Buyers attempted a recovery on Thursday, pushing INJ to an intraday high of $25.87. However, they lost momentum after reaching this level, and sellers took control, driving the price down by 3.62% to $23.27.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/P200qrM3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Despite overwhelming selling pressure, INJ recovered on Friday, rising by 5.66% and settling at $24.59. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Saturday with INJ rising just over 5% and settling at $25.84. INJ surged to an intraday high of $27.20 on Sunday as buyers attempted to break past the resistance. However, sellers overwhelmed buyers, and INJ fell back in the red, dropping by 5.02% and settling at $24.54. The current week began positively, as buyers returned to the market, helping INJ register an increase of 4.78% and settle at $25.72. INJ is marginally down during the ongoing session as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) }}}\uc2  has made an impressive recovery after a substantial decline the previous week. However, it is struggling to maintain its position above $15 as sellers look to lower the price. LINK began declining on Tuesday after failing to push above $15. As a result, the price fell by 6.56% and settled at $13.95. Wednesday saw a substantial increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers struggled to exert control. Ultimately, buyers gained the upper hand, and LINK fell over 3% to $13.50. LINK continued to drop on Thursday, falling by 3.70% and settling at $13, a crucial support level.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/nEcgiCHC/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 LINK recovered from this level on Friday, registering an increase of 6.33% and settling at $13.83. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Saturday as LINK rose by 5.02% to reclaim $14 and settled at $14.52. However, the price fell back on Sunday as buyers lost momentum, dropping over 5%, going below $14 and settling at $13.78. The current week began with \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returning to the market as LINK soared almost 11% on Monday to go above the $15 resistance level, reaching an intraday high of $16.01 before declining and settling at $15.27. However, LINK is back in the red during the current session, with the price down by 1.37% as sellers look to drive it below $15.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Aptos\u8217\'20\'19s (APT) momentum has stalled over the past few sessions as it struggles to build momentum and reclaim $12. APT started the previous week on a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, surging almost 26% and settling at $13.72. However, buyers lost momentum after reaching this level, and APT registered a drastic drop on Tuesday, falling to an intraday low of $11.49 before recovering and settling at $12.36. Wednesday saw a substantial uptick in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers attempted to regain control. Sellers ultimately gained the upper hand, and APT dropped over 5% to slip below $12 and settle at $11.73. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Thursday as sellers thwarted another recovery to push APT down by 4.23% to $11.23.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6ermRnnX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 APT recovered on Friday, registering an increase of 5.66% to move to $11.87. Buyers retained control on Saturday as APT reclaimed $12 and moved to $12.30 but fell back in the red on Sunday, dropping over 4% and settling at $11.78. The current week began with APT reclaiming $12 and settling at $12.04. However, the price is back in the red during the current session, down 2.46% and trading at $11.75.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) registered a significant decline during the previous week but has made an impressive recovery to climb above $9 at the beginning of the week. UNI surged to an intraday high of $10.77 on Tuesday but lost momentum after reaching this level, allowing sellers to take control. As a result, UNI plummeted to a low of $8.64 before recovering to settle at $8.96, a decline of just over 4%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Wednesday and Thursday as UNI fell by 3.70% and 5.31% to settle at $8.17.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/aqR7PLbT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 UNI recovered on Friday after falling to an intraday low of $7.87, rising almost 5% to settle at $8.56. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Saturday as UNI rose nearly 6% to reclaim $9 and settle at $9.06. However, the price fell back in the red on Sunday, dropping by 3.60% and settling at $8.73. Buyers returned to the market on Monday as UNI registered a substantial increase of 5.75% and settled at $9.23. The current session sees the price marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control. Sellers will look to drive UNI below $9. In such a scenario, UNI could drop to its support level of $8.50. On the other hand, if buyers regain control, we could see an attempt to move above $9.50.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241120ekbj0000r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Dogecoin\par \b \uc2 Dogecoin to $5? It\u8217\'20\'19s possible according to a \u8216\'20\'18Gaussian channel\u8217\'20\'19 model\u160\'00\'A0\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Biraajmaan Tamuly \par \uc2 560 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Analysts say Dogecoin could rally well above its all-time high if a certain historical price trend repeats.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzQzZWItODJjYS03ZTM0LWFkMmUtZWViZjZkYTc5YjMx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin to $5? It\u8217\'20\'19s possible according to a \u8216\'20\'18Gaussian channel\u8217\'20\'19 model }}}\par \par \uc2 Following a 159% rise between Nov. 6 and Nov. 12, Dogecoin (DOGE) has exhibited a period of higher-range consolidation. On Nov. 18, the largest memecoin completed a daily \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  engulfing candle, which welcomed market speculations for its next ascend near its all-time high of $0.73.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193440f-11e3-7a35-8260-3d51f721d6a9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Markets, Elon Musk, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin 1-day chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 With the market turning its attention toward DOGE again, one particular indicator highlighted its historical probability of undergoing another parabolic rally over the next few weeks.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1CGaussian Channel\u8221\'20\'1D hints at breakout\par \par \uc2 Trader Tardigrade, a market pattern analyst,  {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/TATrader_Alan/status/1858121670076379372"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mentioned }}}\uc2  in an X post that Dogecoin is currently en route to repeat its historical price trajectory based on the Gaussian channel.\par \par \uc2 A Gaussian channel is an indicator that allows traders to identify the upper and lower channels of price action based on the principle of asset distribution.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934435-d87e-7087-afb0-3d8d2aa890ce"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Markets, Elon Musk, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin weekly analysis by Tardigrade. Source: X.com\par \par \uc2 As analyzed, Doge has gained support from the mid-band line of the Gaussian channel for the third time in history. If history repeats itself, the trader concluded that \u8220\'20\'1CDOGE will experience an incredible PUMP.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Javion Marks, an independent trader,  {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JavonTM1/status/1858631202367742233"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believed }}}\uc2  that Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s retest to its previous all-time high (ATH) at $9.73 is \u8220\'20\'1Cpractically imminent.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Marks has drawn similarities between each parabolic rise in 2016, 2021, and 2024, facilitating similar setups on each occasion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-dogecoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Why is Dogecoin price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin rally could extend as far as $3 to $5\par \par \uc2 While a parabolic rise beyond $1 has been outlined based on the Gaussian channel, the upper limit target was calculated based on the laws of diminishing returns, roughly estimated on its previous return on investment (ROI) percentage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934447-869a-7f56-a2d8-1710da9f0d80"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Markets, Elon Musk, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin 1-week chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 As illustrated in the chart, the blue curve represents the diminishing returns on a logarithmic scale, where Dogecoin is expected to top between $3 and $5 in 2025.\par \par \uc2 Historically, Dogecoin has faced a bit of resistance just below its previous all-time high range during its breakout, so there is a possibility that the memecoin might grind out a position above $0.73 at a steady pace before undergoing rapid price discovery.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Santiment, a data analytics platform,  {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/santimentfeed/status/1858630642348577179"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted }}}\uc2  that DOGE wallet activity had declined over the past day. From an onchain perspective, this is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign, as the platform mentioned,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen a network's overall amount of wallets declines, it is a sign of FUD and capitulation from novice traders that is often a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicator for the coin's price (since those liquidated coins are likely being bought by larger whales and sharks who are hodling for the long-term.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-18-spx-dxy-btc-eth-sol-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Price analysis 11/18: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB }}}\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzQzZWItODJjYS03ZTM0LWFkMmUtZWViZjZkYTc5YjMx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241120ekbj00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Why is Dogecoin price up today\par \b \uc2 Why is Dogecoin price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 747 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is up today, fueled by \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s win, growing investor interest and strengthening market setup.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMzAyMDU4OWUtMmQ1My00ZDEzLWJjNGEtZTQ0N2I2MmYyNmEy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Dogecoin price up today? }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) price has risen over 5% in the last 24 hours to $0.3918, outperforming the cryptocurrency market, which rose by around 0.9% in the same period to rest at $3.09 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\uc2  shows that DOGE has been in an uptrend over the last two weeks, rising 209% from a low of $0.1420 on Nov. 3 to a three-year high of $0.4329 on Nov. 12.\par \par \uc2 Although DOGE currently trades 11% below this high, several factors support more upside for the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest memecoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019343e0-89c3-7819-8ee8-9ea95a91dc3c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zzNXKtuP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  and the D.O.G.E\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  argument stems from increasing investor interest following US President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  and the proposed Department of Government Efficiency (D.O.G.E.). Social media has also played a significant role in amplifying this attention as mentions of Dogecoin surged across platforms.\par \par \uc2 This interest was intensified among investors and the Dogecoin community when Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/realDonaldTrump/status/1856658569124262092"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selected }}}\uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  to lead the proposed government department alongside \uc2 Vivek Ramaswamy\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Musk is often referred to as the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-launches-new-update-to-improve-security-and-efficiency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Doge Father }}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D due to his influential role in promoting Dogecoin, and whenever he posts about the memecoin on his X platform, its price tend to react positively.\par \par \uc2 Although this interest seems to have waned over the past few days as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-dogecoin-doge-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE price retraced }}}\uc2 , investor interest in Dogecoin is yet to reach its peak, according to data from \uc2 Google\uc2  Trends. The chart below shows the social media interest in Dogecoin over time.\par \par \uc2 Although the latest rally has resulted in the highest interest since 2021, it is yet to rival the interest seen in May 2021 when DOGE's price hit its all-time high of $0.7376.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019343e1-44b9-7fb6-a34f-8dd53d6648b0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin interest over time. Source: \uc2 Google\uc2  Trends\par \par \uc2 This data highlights that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-is-pricing-in-a-trump-win-eyeing-a-30-roi-to-new-2024-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin price }}}\uc2  has more room for gains as most retail traders are still on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 DOGE whales accumulate\par \par \uc2 Responding to a slight market correction over the last few days, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/what-is-dogecoin-a-beginners-guide-to-doge-cryptocurrency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin }}}\uc2  whales took advantage of the drop to $0.35. Data shows that whale addresses holding between 10 million and 100 million DOGE have increased sharply between Nov. 4 and Nov. 18.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-18-spx-dxy-btc-eth-sol-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/18: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB }}}\par \par \uc2 These large investors have accumulated approximately 140 million DOGE, worth about $56 million, between Nov. 17 and Nov. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019343e1-b6a1-7436-a4cd-90b0b18fe06f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 Total addresses holding between 10M and 100M DOGE. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 This buying likely helped Dogecoin move back to the $0.38 range as Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s largest holders appear to be positioning for higher prices in the future.\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s bull flag points to new all-time highs\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, DOGE price action has painted a bull flag pattern on the daily chart, as shown below.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-a-bull-flag-chart-pattern-and-how-to-spot-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bull flag }}}\uc2  is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation setup that forms after the price consolidates inside a down-sloping range following a sharp price rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019343e2-6a88-71d3-992e-6f3e2cd0211e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Tgler4mh/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The pattern will resolve after the price breaks above the upper trendline of the flag at $0.40 and rises by as much as the previous uptrend\u8217\'20\'19s height. This puts the upper target for DOGE price at $0.87, marking new all-time highs for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/price-indexes/memecoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 memecoin }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s daily relative strength index is still in the overbought zone at 77, suggesting that the chances of a major pullback are relatively high.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, a retreat from $0.38 could see a retest of the flag\u8217\'20\'19s lower trendline at around $0.355. Lower than that, DOGE/USD could move toward the $0.30 psychological level.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMzAyMDU4OWUtMmQ1My00ZDEzLWJjNGEtZTQ0N2I2MmYyNmEy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241119ekbj0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
