pward movement. If the bulls maintain control, XRP could soon test higher levels, offering potential gains from current prices. The charts are hinting at a strong push ahead, and XRP might be gearing up for a significant move.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Set to Soar as Altcoin Season Approaches\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 's price is showing promising signs within the $171.70 to $231.97 range. Over the past month, it has climbed by 37.73%, indicating strong upward momentum. The nearest resistance level is at $253; breaking through this could propel \uc2 SOL\uc2  towards the next target of $314. The Relative Strength Index stands at 52.66, suggesting there's room for further growth before reaching overbought territory. With the stochastic at 72.72, buyers are gaining control, hinting at potential price increases. Although the MACD level is slightly negative, the recent 8.48% rise over the past week signals \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. If \uc2 Solana\uc2  continues this trend, we could see significant gains in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 While DOT, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , XRP, and \uc2 SOL\uc2  are solid, their short-term potential may be limited in the current bull run. In contrast, DOGEN is a meme token for alpha males seeking luxury and success. Following the success of BONK, WIF, and Popcat, DOGEN expects 700% growth by presale's end, offering real value and exclusive perks for early adopters.\par \par \uc2 Site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dogen.meme/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://dogen.meme/ }}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/dogenmeme"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/dogenmeme }}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/Dogen_Portal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/Dogen_Portal }}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241119ekbi00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/18: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,894 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing stiff resistance at $92,000, but the buyers have kept up the pressure, indicating the possibility of an upside breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzQwNTYtNGI1Zi03YzljLTg3NTktNDMwN2NkZDNhMGNi.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/18: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to start the new week on a positive note by rising above the $92,000 resistance. The sharp rally of the past few days has not deterred the long-term bulls from buying more Bitcoin. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  announced on Nov. 18 that it had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-buys-52-k-bitcoin-4-6-billion-btc-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquired 51,780 Bitcoin for roughly $4.6 billion}}}\uc2  at an average price of $88,627. That takes \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s total haul of Bitcoin holdings to 331,200 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Paul Tudor Jones\uc2  is another famed investor who has increased exposure to Bitcoin. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-1-7-billion-weekly-inflow-6-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 billionaire investor added $130 million}}}\uc2  worth of \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds shares in the third quarter, boosting his fund\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin holdings to $160 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934050-ec13-7d33-8ea0-0b2605201508"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The long-term investors expect Bitcoin to go much higher. ARK Invest\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Cathie Wood\uc2  said in an interview with CNBC that Bitcoin has \u8220\'20\'1Ca long way to go.\u8221\'20\'1D Wood believes that a \u8220\'20\'1Cregulatory relief\u8221\'20\'1D from the new United States administration {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-still-long-way-at-90-k-cathie-wood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 would keep the momentum intact}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the important resistance levels in Bitcoin and altcoins that need to be crossed for the uptrend to continue? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) witnessed profit booking last week, pulling the price down to the 20-day exponential moving average (5,877).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934051-7bb6-7835-b5b5-d887521af06c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bulls usually buy the dips to the 20-day EMA in a strong uptrend. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will improve the prospects of the continuation of the up move. A break and close above 6,017 could open the doors for a rally to 6,221 and eventually to 6,500.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the 20-day EMA gives way, the index could descend to the 50-day simple moving average (5,780). A break and close below the 50-day SMA could tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) continued its scintillating run last week, indicating solid demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934052-973e-7d95-b91f-e95ba0661f0a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up move is expected to face solid selling in the 107 to 108 resistance zone. If the price continues lower and breaks below 106, it will signal booking profits by the bulls. The index could then decline to the 20-day EMA (105). Buyers will have to defend the 20-day EMA if they want to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum intact.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, if buyers pierce the overhead resistance zone, it will signal the start of a new uptrend. The index could surge to 114 and then to the pattern target of 116.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are trying to resume the uptrend but are facing stiff resistance from the bears in the $92,000 to $93,265 zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934053-1eff-7207-a9a8-565da5add6a6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the uptrend line. If this support is violated, the BTC/USDT pair could slump to $85,000. Buyers are expected to aggressively protect the $85,000 level because a break below it may sink the pair to the 20-day EMA ($81,772). The deeper the pullback, the longer the time it is likely to take for the next leg of the uptrend to begin.\par \par \uc2 If the price continues higher and breaks above $93,265, it will signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum remains intact. The pair may travel to $100,000 and thereafter to $113,331.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is taking support at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $3,028, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934053-ab96-7ade-b180-d2c417c0ce8f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($2,953) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If the bulls propel the price above $3,220, the ETH/USDT pair could retest the downtrend line. This level is expected to behave as a stiff resistance, but if the bulls overcome it, the pair may rise to $3,900.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may drop to $2,850 and then to the 50-day SMA ($2,664).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) successfully held the retest of the breakout level of $210, indicating that the bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934054-4141-7a78-8117-ae584eae17c1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair started a new uptrend after breaking above $225 on Nov. 17. The pair could rally to $260, which may pose a substantial challenge to the bulls. However, if the buyers bulldoze their way through, the pair could skyrocket to $304.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to prevent the up move, they will have to swiftly pull the price back below $210. Such a move will indicate that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair may tumble to the 50-day SMA ($171).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price above the $635 resistance on Nov. 17, but the bears held their ground. A minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) to slide below the 20-day EMA ($609).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934054-c5d2-7919-b39c-84f847daf9cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will again attempt to push and maintain the price above $635. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $667. This level may act as a hurdle, but if the bulls clear it, the pair may ascend to $722.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls have given up. That may sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($588) and then to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $1.27 on Nov. 17 but found support near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.97.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934055-4e61-7c7e-b456-b5da90fd01fc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip and are again trying to push the price above $1.27. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could soar to $1.40 and subsequently to $1.70.\par \par \uc2 However, the recent rally has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deeply into the overbought territory. This suggests that the markets are overheated in the short term. That could result in a minor correction or consolidation for some time. If the price turns down from $1.27, the pair may fall to $1 and remain between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been taking support just above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.33.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934055-dcff-7dfc-aaa0-b5d6022769de"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The shallow pullback suggests the bulls expect the uptrend to continue. If buyers push the price above $0.39, the DOGE/USDT pair could jump to $0.44. This level may act as a barrier, but if the bulls overcome it, the pair could surge to $0.50 and later to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $0.32. The pair may tumble to the 20-day EMA ($0.28), which is expected to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to stall Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) up move near $0.80 on Nov. 16, but the shallow pullback on Nov. 17 shows buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934056-5ad2-764a-9396-1dd820287b94"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again attempting to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.80. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may rise to $1 and, after that, to $1.25.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from $0.80, it will signal that the bears are fiercely defending the level. Sellers will have to tug the price below $0.70 to start a deeper correction to $0.65 and then to the 20-day EMA ($0.54).\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the 20-day EMA ($0.000022), but the bulls are struggling to start a strong rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01934056-db52-7728-864d-0b591e3e24fc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, CNBC, Cardano, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy, S&P 500, Bitcoin ETF, BlackRock, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a close above $0.000026. If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair could climb to $0.000030. Sellers will pose a strong challenge at $0.000030, but if the bulls prevail, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverted head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair could rally to $0.000039 and then to $0.000047.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may slump to the 50-day SMA ($0.000019).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzQwNTYtNGI1Zi03YzljLTg3NTktNDMwN2NkZDNhMGNi.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241118ekbi000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 799 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token continues to rise as the network\u8217\'20\'19s activity and total value locked remain in an uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is displaying strength, rising 5% over the last 24 hours to trade at $0.762 on Nov. 18. This price growth over the last two weeks has seen the layer-1 token rise to a 30-month high of $0.820 on Nov. 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01933f4a-aff4-7b28-89ac-14ceae34da74"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/OZpopuLe/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look closer at the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  catalysts driving {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-worst-week-may-2021-ada-price-rebound-40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price}}}\uc2  up today.\par \par \uc2 Cardano Foundation discloses 2023 figures\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance on Nov. 18 followed the release of Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s financial report for 2023, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-foundation-2023-financial-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighting}}}\uc2  the firm\u8217\'20\'19s financial performance and investments in 2023.\par \par \uc2 In a report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/financial-insights-report-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 published}}}\uc2  on Nov. 13, the Cardano Foundation said it spent $19.22 million on three critical areas: adoption ($12.92 million), education ($4.18 million), and operational resilience ($2.12 million). It revealed spending a further $4.55 million on central operational costs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01933f4b-9147-75f7-acfe-d5a08ed42cb3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Cardano_CF/status/1856663641317081530"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Foundation}}}\par \par \uc2 Through investments promoting Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s adoptions, the foundation launched Aiken, an open-source programming language to simplify smart contract development on the network.\par \par \uc2 The $2.12 million allocated to operational resilience was spent on improving Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cresilience, reliability, and durability,\u8221\'20\'1D the report explained, adding that it also worked to improve the \u8220\'20\'1Cbroader understanding of blockchain and its associated opportunities and risks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Among the highlights of the spending on education include the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/cardano-summit-2023-cardano-spot-reports-live-from-dubai"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Summit 2023}}}\uc2  held in Dubai, the launch of the Cardano Academy, Cardano Explorer, and the \u8216\'20\'18Let\u8217\'20\'19s Talk Cardano\u8217\'20\'19 webinar, all aimed at providing reliable information to support regulatory clarity and contribute to broader blockchain research.\par \par \uc2 The report also disclosed that the Foundation closed the year 20203 with an asset portfolio valued at $478.24 million: 82.5% ($394.54 million) in the network\u8217\'20\'19s native token \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , 10.1% ($48.3 million) in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), and 7.4% ($35.38 million) as liquidity in the United States dollar.\par \par \uc2 Cardano Foundation CEO Frederik Gregaard said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis report highlights the importance of accountability, disclosing the allocation of our resources, and how they help advance Cardano as a public digital utility across a wide range of industries.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Increasing onchain activity boosts \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance on Nov. 18 was preceded by high network activity as transactions deployed on the blockchain approached the 100 million milestone.\par \par \uc2 According to the latest update by Input Output Global (IOG), the developer of Cardano, the network has handled 99.07 million transactions to date.\par \par \uc2 This highlights the growing adoption and vigorous activity within the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/articles/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano ecosystem}}}\uc2 , which has evolved significantly, seeing continuous upgrades and the introduction of new features since its launch in 2017.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01933f51-91be-764f-b544-a243f91ca08a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano weekly development report. Source: Input Output Global\par \par \uc2 With 10.5 million native tokens, 1.314 million delegated wallets, 1,973 projects building on the Cardano platform, and 94,835 plutus scripts, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem continues to expand.\par \par \uc2 This is further evidenced by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  network, which has jumped by 101% from $233 million on Nov. 6 to $470.7 million on Nov. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01933f51-fd91-7d0a-b701-eb239d0170c2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Total value locked on Cardano. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 Increasing network activity typically reflects greater demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens. This positively impacts the token's price, explaining today\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ada-price-pumps-30-rumors-cardano-founder-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price pumps 30% amid rumors of Cardano founder-Trump collaboration}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bull flag target at $1.11\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action has led to the formation of a bull flag pattern in the four-hour timeframe, as shown below.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-a-bull-flag-chart-pattern-and-how-to-spot-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bull flag}}}\uc2  is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation setup that forms after the price consolidates inside a down-sloping range following a sharp price ascent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01933f52-a720-77e5-bc05-5c62a93edb6d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD four-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/alZAW5dX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Bull flags typically resolve after the price breaks above the upper trendline and rise by as much as the previous uptrend\u8217\'20\'19s height. This puts the upper target for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price at $1.11\u8212\'20\'14 levels last seen in April 2022.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s daily relative strength index is also still in the neutral zone at 59. This suggests that the chances of a major pullback are relatively low.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241118ekbi0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
