c2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls took a small break on Nov. 14 but resumed their purchases on Nov. 15, pushing the price near $89,500. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  founder and Bitcoin bull \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  told CNBC that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-wont-fall-60k-no-threats-microstrategy-michael-saylor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is unlikely to plunge to $60,000}}}\uc2  as some analysts are predicting. He expects Bitcoin to hit $100,000 before the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 VanEck\uc2  head of digital assets research Matthew Sigel also echoed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view when he told CNBC that Bitcoin could \u8220\'20\'1Cmake repeated all-time highs over the next two quarters,\u8221\'20\'1D He expects {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-repeated-all-time-highs-expected-over-next-2-quarters-vaneck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to reach $180,000 next year}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330bd-3063-7f2b-983b-0c2af186fcfd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, no bull market goes up in a straight line. Strong rallies are followed by sharp intermittent dips, which shake out the weak hands.\par \par \uc2 Real Vision chief crypto analyst Jamie Coutts said in a post on X that the strength of the United States dollar is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analyst-says-strong-dxy-no-good-for-bitcoin-price-urges-leverage-traders-to-be-careful"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not good for Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . He remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the long term but cautious in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin reach $100,000, or will a correction set in? Are the altcoins showing signs of tiring out? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Nov. 14 and again on Nov. 15, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330bd-b047-7ea8-a5ee-b9ed52387d9e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the overbought territory signal advantage to buyers. A break and close above $93,265 could start the next leg of the uptrend to the crucial level of $100,000. The bears will try to halt the up move at $100,000, but the rally could extend to $113,331 if the bulls prevail.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below $85,000, the BTC/USDT pair may witness sharp selling. That could sink the pair to the 20-day exponential moving average ($78,496).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pullback has reached the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $3,028, which is likely to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330be-3a76-7693-a8da-cfaaee3bc071"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the downtrend line. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair could surge to $3,800 and later to $4,084.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break below $3,028 will suggest that the bears are maintaining their selling pressure. The pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($2,887), which is again likely to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the breakout level of $210, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330be-c58b-7612-9b9a-b94fc5951589"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push the price above $225 to start the up move. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $260, which is expected to act as a formidable hurdle. Buyers will have to overcome this obstacle to clear the path for a rise to $304.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($192), it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair could then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($167).\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is finding support at the 20-day EMA ($604), indicating that the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330bf-a554-701a-8a7a-0841c02d18db"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to propel the price above the overhead resistance of $667 to signal the start of a new up move. The BNB/USDT pair could rally to $722, which is again expected to behave as a solid resistance. However, if buyers overcome this barrier, the pair may soar to $810.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair may then slump to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) pullback is finding support near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330c0-313f-7920-8da1-a99582e6eec4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A shallow pullback suggests that the bulls are not hurrying to book profits as they anticipate the uptrend to continue. If buyers propel the price above $0.44, the DOGE/USDT pair could climb to $0.50 and thereafter to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 If sellers want to prevent the upside, they will have to tug the price below $0.35. That could start a decline to $0.32 and later to the 50% retracement level of $0.29. Such a move will suggest that the pair has formed a short-term top at $0.44.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the large $0.41 to $0.74 range on Nov. 14, indicating the start of a new uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330c0-bc32-7428-a724-d983c1d93ae2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought territory, indicating that the XRP/USD pair is at risk of a short-term correction or consolidation. The breakout level of $0.74 remains the key short-term level to keep an eye on. If buyers flip the level into support, the pair may surge to $1.07.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below $0.74 will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair may collapse to the solid support at $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from $0.52 on Nov. 13, indicating aggressive buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330c1-4bc1-7f2a-85b8-f84d62fb9d64"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the $0.66 resistance on Nov. 15 but are struggling to maintain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears have not given up and are selling on rallies. The failure to close above $0.66 may pull the price down to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a close above $0.66 will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $0.77, where the bears are again expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back to the 20-day EMA ($0.000021), an important level to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330c1-d382-7d06-9707-075a00c3812f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the SHIB/USDT pair above $0.000029. If they succeed, the pair will complete a large \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair may rise to $0.000039 and then to the pattern target of $0.000047.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price continues lower and plummets below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to keep Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages but are struggling to start a strong rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330c2-6205-751a-a66c-8696ea31855f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above $5, it will signal that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. The TON/USDT pair could rally to $6, which is a crucial level to watch out for. If buyers overcome this barrier, the pair could surge to $7.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price skids below the moving averages, it will indicate that the bears are maintaining their pressure. The bulls will have to defend the $4.44 level with all their might because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern. That may start a down move to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continues to slide toward the 20-day EMA ($29.31), indicating that the price may remain stuck inside the ascending channel for some time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019330c3-0207-7f8b-aa6c-6fd20f08e072"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may again try to rise toward the resistance line. A break and close above the channel will signal the start of a new up move toward $42 and then $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if 