d{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://purchase.blockdag.network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://purchase.blockdag.network}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/blockDAGnetworkOfficial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/blockDAGnetworkOfficial}}}\par \par \uc2 Discord: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241115ekbe0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Pepe\par \b \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 826 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 PEPE price rallies to a new all-time high, keeping pace with the memecoin craze that has dominated the crypto market in 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzJiNmUtNTI5My03MzgzLWFjNGMtZGZjZDQzMmFhODJh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B}}}\par \par \uc2 Pepe ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/pepe-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE}}}\uc2  ), the largest Ethereum-based memecoin by market capitalization, is on track to continue the recovery it began on Nov. 5. PEPE has climbed approximately 230% from its Nov. 5 low of around $0.0000078, bringing its price up to an all-time high of $0.00002597 on Nov. 14.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=CRYPTOCAP%3APEPE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows PEPE trading at $0.00002093, up 15% over the 24 hours and 104% over the last seven days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932b67-f076-78ff-a3d7-9f1ace2047e2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B}}}\par \par \uc2 PEPE/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/NnU83qRk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s trading volume has jumped 124% over the last 24 hours to $19.6 billion, and its market capitalization also jumped, briefly touching $10.2 billion on Nov. 14 before retracing to the current level of $8.8 billion.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine the factors that have fueled PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s price momentum over the last week.\par \par \uc2 PEPE price rises on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  listing\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pepe-hits-all-time-high-memecoins-soar-after-famous-gamestop-stock-trader-returns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s performance}}}\uc2  comes as several major cryptocurrency exchanges listed the memecoin. On Nov. 13, Robinhood Crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/RobinhoodApp/status/1856699618815513040"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that Pepe, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) were available to trade for customers in the United States.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932b68-c584-7e8b-9d0e-1423240dcc84"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/RobinhoodApp/status/1856699618815513040"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Robinhood}}}\par \par \uc2 Shortly after \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s announcement, \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/coinbase/status/1856744112189260193"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declared}}}\uc2  that it would list PEPE later on Nov. 13. \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  is the largest crypto exchange in the US and the third-largest exchange worldwide by trading volume, so a listing there is expected to send PEPE even higher.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Upbit, the largest crypto exchange in South Korea, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Official_Upbit/status/1856879928333262912"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allowed}}}\uc2  trading of PEPE trading pairs on Nov. 16. The South Korean exchange is ranked fifth on CoinMarketCap\u8217\'20\'19s top spot exchanges. In the past 24 hours, Upbit has processed over $8.7 billion in trade volume.\par \par \uc2 The listings come in the wake of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-win-bitcoin-100k-crypto-regulation-influence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s election}}}\uc2  as the next US president. While on the campaign trail, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-promises-crypto-election-usa"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump promised}}}\uc2  to remove \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 , who has repeatedly sued US exchanges for listing speculative tokens like PEPE.\par \par \uc2 Memecoins flash green across the board\par \par \uc2 PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s rally on Nov. 14 mirrors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-memecoins-2024-listings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  price movements}}}\uc2  across the broader memecoin sector. Most cryptocurrencies in this sector have posted double-digit gains over the last day. Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) and Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ), the leading memecoins, have jumped 1.2% and 2% over the last 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Solana-based Dogwifhat ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/dogwifhat-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WIF}}}\uc2  ) recorded 30% daily gains, while Base\u8217\'20\'19s Brett ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/brett-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BRETT}}}\uc2  ) rallied 38% over the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932b6b-bb87-7dd6-96fa-ea6ee06075dd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B}}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of top-cap memecoins. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 This widespread rally has pushed the total memecoin market value to $116.5 billion, a 111.5% leap in the past week, as per CoinMarketCap data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932b6c-9e46-7393-b3e5-fd837ac5d54f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B}}}\par \par \uc2 Memecoin market cap and volume. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 Over $75.7 billion in memecoin trading volume was recorded in the past 24 hours alone. The resurgence is driven by investors once again embracing risk-on assets like memecoins amid increasing anticipation of a crypto-friendly business environment in the US under Trump\u8217\'20\'19s administration.\par \par \uc2 Increasing open interest backs PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s upside\par \par \uc2 The surge in the price of PEPE over the last seven days comes after a significant jump in its open interest (OI) over the same timeframe.\par \par \uc2 Open interest is a key metric that traders and analysts use to assess market sentiment and anticipate future price movements.\par \par \uc2 PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s total OI on all exchanges rose by 160% from $108 million on Nov. 5 to an all-time high of $282.2 million on Nov. 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932b6d-49b0-7762-800a-f262a00964ed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B}}}\par \par \uc2 PEPE open interest across all exchanges. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Additional data from CoinGlass shows increasing demand for leveraged long positions in PEPE over the last few days, as indicated by the OI-weighted futures funding rate.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932b6e-45ad-7ddb-b1fe-2ea2207146ec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE rallies 78% to new all-time highs as memecoin market cap tops $116B}}}\par \par \uc2 PEPE average perpetual contracts 8-hour funding rate. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Note that the current 0.0327% eight-hour rate translates to a 0.68% cost over seven days, which is significant for traders building futures positions.\par \par \uc2 Increasing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/funding-rates-in-crypto-markets#:~:text=The%20impact%20of%20funding%20rates,hinting%20that%20prices%20could%20fall."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 funding rates}}}\uc2  usually suggests that futures traders are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , expecting future price increases, which may indicate a continuation of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzJiNmUtNTI5My03MzgzLWFjNGMtZGZjZDQzMmFhODJh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241114ekbe000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
