\par\par \b \uc2 Breaking: Pepe Price Hits New All-Time High Following \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Robinhood Listing\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 353 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How High Can The Pepe Price Go After Coinbase, Robinhood Listings?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Whales Stack Pepe Unchained - Best Meme Coin To Buy Now?}}}\par \par \uc2 The Pepe price has hit a new all-time high of $0.00001979, following its highly-anticipated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinbase.com/blog/increasing-transparency-for-new-asset-listings-on-coinbase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://robinhood.com/eu/en/crypto/PEPE/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Robinhood}}}\uc2  listings.\par \par \uc2 The PEPE market capitalization soared by over 50% today on Wednesday, surpassing the $8.2 billion mark before a marginal pullback.\par \par \uc2 The listings have added to the ongoing bull market euphoria, with experts now calling on investors to raise their meme coin price targets.\par \par \uc2 Lower-cap frog meme coins are mirroring PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength. For instance, Apu Apustaja is up by 24% while presale token {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.care/b_pepeunchained-en_97819?referrer=breaking:-pepe-price-hits-new-all-time-high-following-coinbase-robinhood-listing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pepe Unchained}}}\uc2  has surged past the $28 million mark behind large whale investments.\par \par \uc2 How High Can The Pepe Price Go After \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Robinhood Listings?\par \par \uc2 Pepe is now one of the rare few meme coins listed on the big two crypto exchanges - Binance and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  listing was so highly anticipated that Chief Legal Officer \uc2 Paul Grewal\uc2  personally announced it to users on X.\par \par \uc2 You've long wanted the frog. Well, soon you'll get the frog. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/coinbase?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @coinbase}}}\uc2  is adding PEPE to our listing roadmap with the goal of listing later today. Thanks for your patience.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 paulgrewal.eth (@iampaulgrewal) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/iampaulgrewal/status/1856698280123740601?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 13, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 However, with over 24 million TradFi investors, \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Pepe listing could be an even bigger milestone than the meme coin\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  debut. \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  has also listed Solana, XRP and Cardano, cryptocurrencies which it had de-listed previously during the crypto bear market.\par \par \uc2 Good morning. I\u8217\'20\'19d just say morning, but we offer {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24PEPE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $PEPE}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}\uc2 , and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  now.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  (@RobinhoodApp) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RobinhoodApp/status/1856702329703285115?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 13, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Prominent crypto traders were already highly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the Pepe coin. However, the meme coin\u8217\'20\'19s recent listings are certainly forcing them to push their price targets higher. There is now a growing consensus that the PEPE market capitalization could surpass the $50 billion mark in this meme coin supercycle.\par \par \uc2 $PEPE\par \par \uc2 No one is ready for what comes next\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241114ekbd0000l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/13: BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, TON, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,749 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is not ceding ground to the bears, signaling that the uptrend is likely to extend further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzI2ODgtY2ViNC03NDFkLTgxNWQtYThhNGUwZGZmOGI2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/13: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOGE, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB, TON, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is in no mood to slow down as it rose above $93,000 on Nov. 13, signaling strong appetite at higher levels. United States-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-rally-spot-etfs-inflows-nov-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sharp inflows of $4.22 billion}}}\uc2  between Nov. 6 and Nov. 12, according to data sourced by Farside Investors.\par \par \uc2 Copper.co head of research Fadi Aboualfa {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-win-bitcoin-100k-crypto-regulation-influence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in an interview with Cointelegraph}}}\uc2  that Bitcoin could reach $100,000 \u8220\'20\'1Cby the time of the presidential inauguration\u8221\'20\'1D on Jan. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932673-e5ab-70ca-aa1f-15d1d618f26d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, some analysts are cautious in the near term and believe that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-bitcoin-price-all-time-high-unlikely-trader-70k-floor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin needs to take a break}}}\uc2  before continuing its up move.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBTC needs to slow down the pace and build some structural support in the new range,\u8221\'20\'1D said Material Indicators co-founder Keith Alan in a post on X.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins extend their up move, or is a correction around the corner? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is in a strong uptrend, which has pushed the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) into the overbought territory. This increases the possibility of a minor correction or consolidation in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932674-950e-75d2-99fa-9c5147b49ec5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is $85,000. If the price turns down and breaks below $85,000, the short-term bulls may be tempted to book profits. That could start a pullback to the 20-day exponential moving average ($76,451).\par \par \uc2 The $93,554 level may act as a resistance, but if the bulls overcome it, the BTC/USDT pair could soar to the psychological resistance at $100,000. If this level is crossed, the next stop is likely to be $113,331.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $3,443 on Nov. 12, indicating that the bears are defending the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932675-3e3a-7ef5-8d78-7d049f8c55a3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pullback is finding support near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $3,028, signaling solid buying on every minor dip. The ETH/USDT pair may reach the downtrend line, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If buyers pierce the downtrend line, the pair could surge to $3,800 and eventually to $4,094.\par \par \uc2 The short-term advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the price continues lower and plummets below the 50% retracement level of $2,900.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke out and closed above the $210 resistance on Nov. 11, indicating advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932675-c913-7537-9126-96f53b94010d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back below the $210 level, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests the buyers are trying to flip the $210 level into support. If they manage to do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $225 and later to $260.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly yank the price below the 20-day EMA ($188). If that happens, several aggressive bulls may get trapped, resulting in a long liquidation. That could start a decline to the 50-day SMA ($164).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed above the $635 resistance on Nov. 11, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932676-5320-7f2b-ae30-16394edc21af"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair slipped back into the range on Nov. 12, but the price rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($602) on Nov. 13, indicating buying on dips. Buyers will try to start a new up move by pushing the price above $667. The pair may then surge to $722.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close below the moving averages will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may descend to the uptrend line, which is expected to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose vertically after breaking out of the $0.23 resistance on Nov. 10, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932676-e703-7cb7-8d8a-4795c4a828c4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall the up move at $0.44, as seen from the long wick on the Nov. 12 candlestick, but the bulls bought the dip to $0.35 on Nov. 13 and are again trying to clear the overhead hurdle. If the price sustains above $0.44, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.50 and subsequently to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.32 and then the 50% retracement level of $0.29. A deeper pullback below $0.29 could delay the continuation of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the $0.64 resistance on Nov. 12 and reached the formidable hurdle at $0.74.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932677-6d52-7876-99a1-5c5657e0238d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back below $0.64 on Nov. 13, but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels. The XRP/USDT pair could consolidate in the $0.64 to $0.74 range for a while, increasing the possibility of an upside breakout. The breakout from the large range between $0.41 and $0.74 gives a pattern target of $1.07.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price skids and sustains below the $0.64 support.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the $0.66 resistance on Nov. 12, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932677-f2b1-7dc6-b0ba-37f15b63845b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 That started a pullback, which found support in the zone between the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.53 and the 50% retracement level of $0.49. The bulls will try to clear the hurdle at $0.66 and resume the uptrend toward $0.77.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break and close below $0.49 will signal that the bulls are rushing to the exit. That may sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.44), which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-follows-classical-charting-principle-which-hints-at-1-000-doge-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin follows \u8216\'20\'18classical charting principle\u8217\'20\'19 which hints at 1,000%+ DOGE rally}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) rally stalled at the overhead resistance of $0.000030 on Nov. 12, signaling profit-booking by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932678-8ef6-7381-b2b8-ee7e5e231be0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the $0.000024 support on Nov. 13, but the lower levels attracted solid buying by the bulls. Buyers will attempt to drive the SHIB/USDT pair above $0.000030. If they can pull it off, the pair may rise to $0.000033 and later to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below $0.000023, it will suggest that the pair may swing inside the large range between $0.000030 and $0.000013 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) closed above the 50-day SMA ($5.21) on Nov. 10, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932679-1ada-73dd-bbaa-4cc23e6ade06"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers are trying to pull the price back below the moving averages. If they do that, the TON/USDT pair could drop to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. This remains the critical zone for the bulls to defend because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The negative setup could start a decline to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and maintain the price above the $6 overhead resistance to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the resistance line of the ascending channel pattern on Nov. 12, signaling profit booking by the short-term buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01932679-a397-70a9-a8d7-fab074e5f39f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price down on Nov. 13, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. The bulls will again try to drive the AVAX/USDT pair above the resistance line. If they succeed, the pair may soar to $41.80.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level or the resistance line, it will suggest that sellers are active at higher levels. A break below the 20-day EMA ($28.99) will signal that the pair may remain inside the channel for some time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegrap