\par\par \b \uc2 Altcoin Season is Coming: 4 Projects Gearing Up for Massive Gains\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 867 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins Make Significant Gains}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Gains 70%}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Exceeds Expectations}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s Popcat (POPCAT)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join the Altcoin Surge with Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s (HINU) Presale}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s (BTC) dominance is close to its peak after the halving event, signalling that altcoin season is upon us. The crypto market has witnessed a spectacular run since the US election, which resulted in a Trump win. BTC set a new \uc2 ATH\uc2  today, while altcoins make double digital gains.\par \par \uc2 Overwhelming \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment following the US election has triggered massive gains. Bitcoin (BTC) smashed its all-time high today, reaching the $89,956 level. The market has corrected since, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  trades around the $87,000 price point.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins Make Significant Gains\par \par \uc2 BTC remains the undisputed leader of the crypto world and maintains its reputation as the most trusted \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 . As the dominant store of value, BTC is the go-to choice for institutional investors, and spot BTC ETFs witness record inflows. While BTC asserts its position as the top investment choice, many altcoins have surpassed its profit potential. We are approaching the peak of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance following its halving event, and investors are turning their attention to smaller assets, signalling the start of the altcoin season.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Gains 70%\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  has been one of the top performers in recent days, gaining nearly 70% in the past week. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  skyrocketed after Cardano founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2  revealed plans to help shape US crypto policy under \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s administration. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is a dynamic crypto market player prized for its robust fundamentals and innovative approach to blockchain. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s recent surge in interest stems from its active community and continued improvements to its infrastructure. Investors are optimistic about Cardano's potential in the bull run, fueled by its unique features and unrelenting commitment to academic research. With an emphasis on security and scalability, Cardano is well-positioned for future growth, making it a prime investment opportunity. As more and more projects build on the Cardano blockchain, demand for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is expected to rise, solidifying its already strong market position.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Exceeds Expectations\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) is undoubtedly following BTC\u8217\'20\'19s trajectory, surging over 105% in the past week and trading at $0.3644. The OG memecoin is the largest by market cap and is the 6th largest crypto with a market cap exceeding $53.4 billion. \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , the world\u8217\'20\'19s richest man with a net worth exceeding $300 billion, is the CEO of \uc2 Tesla\uc2 , owner of social media platform X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ), and one of the president-elect\u8217\'20\'19s most prominent supporters and has long endorsed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/solana-flips-binance-coin-dogecoin-set-to-surpass-xrp-time-to-buy-meme-coins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin}}}\uc2 . Musk recently joined the Trump campaign and was integral to Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory, and his involvement with the republican party could see DOGE run to new highs in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Popcat (POPCAT)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/popcat-sol/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 POPCAT}}}\uc2  is a recent addition to the crypto sector, aiming to revive the market that is still plagued by challenges such as inactive wallets and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . POPCAT addresses common issues like pump-and-dump schemes and rug pulls by promoting transparency and security. Utilizing innovative blockchain technology and leveraging the power of the Solana network, POPCAT seeks to provide fast and secure transactions. The project's goals are robust, and its potential to deliver significant returns makes it a coin of interest for those looking to explore new ventures in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  space. POPCAT\u8217\'20\'19s (POPCAT) market cap has grown to $1.5 billion, and its price has increased by almost 9% over the past month. POPCAT\u8217\'20\'19s recent performance indicates \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, and its upward momentum will likely continue. The memecoin\u8217\'20\'19s success as the first-ever cat-themed project demonstrates that meme culture, backed by strong community support, can propel projects to the top of the market.\par \par \uc2 Join the Altcoin Surge with Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s (HINU) Presale\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) is one of the newest members of the Solana network, created to bring its holders more value and utility by harnessing the power of this popular blockchain. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-raises-over-55k-in-early-presale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  recently launched the presale of its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-presale-hits-100k-in-sales"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU}}}\uc2 , with tremendous success, and the two are on a mission to conquer the memecoin industry through a robust and supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards.\par \par \uc2 Since going live, the presale has generated over $483,000, with numbers rapidly rising. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  is working on some exciting things, including an Earn App and a Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the project, and the Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading to improve utility and value for HINU holders. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/5-cheap-memecoins-poised-to-make-millionaires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241113ekbc00010\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
