\par\par \b \uc2 The Top 4 Trending Cryptos of Nov 2024: \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , Avalanche, Cardano and BlockDAG!\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 814 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 1. BlockDAG (BDAG): Leading Layer 1 Coin with 30,000x ROI Potential}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2. Ripple (XRP): Breaking Barriers in Global Transfers}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3. Avalanche (AVAX): A World of Mini Blockchains}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 4. Cardano: Greener, Smarter & Built to Last}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Final Analysis: Top Trending Cryptos}}}\par \par \uc2 Through the ups and downs of 2024, four cryptocurrencies have shown remarkable power \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), Avalanche (AVAX), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and BlockDAG (BDAG).\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  stands out in global payment networks, using its speed to push cross-border transactions to new levels. Avalanche brings an innovative approach with its \u8220\'20\'1Cmini blockchain\u8221\'20\'1D subnets, giving businesses flexible blockchain solutions.\par \par \uc2 Cardano remains committed to eco-friendly, user-friendly blockchain technology. Finally, BlockDAG, with its hybrid blockchain and DAG model, offers a potential of 30,000x ROI for early holders.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s explore each of these coins to see why they\u8217\'20\'19re trending this month and what sets each one apart for the future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blockdag.network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 1. BlockDAG (BDAG): Leading Layer 1 Coin with 30,000x ROI Potential\par \par \uc2 Imagine if a traffic jam could magically disappear, letting every car move freely without anyone slowing down. BlockDAG works in a similar way, designed to let thousands of transactions flow smoothly without clogging up. Unlike older blockchains like Bitcoin and Ethereum which struggle to be fast, secure, and decentralized all at once (known as the \u8220\'20\'1CBlockchain Trilemma\u8221\'20\'1D), BlockDAG does things differently.\par \par \uc2 It combines the traditional blockchain with a directed acyclic graph (DAG). This hybrid setup means BlockDAG can handle a high volume without losing security or decentralization\u8212\'20\'14something the crypto world has wanted for years.\par \par \uc2 When BlockDAG presale launched less than a year ago, the market was quick to notice its potential. In less than a year, the project raised $120.5 million in presale and the BDAG coin price soared by 2100%. Considering BlockDAG\u8217\'20\'19s robust tech and super-hit presale success, experts now forecast that the BDAG coin will bring 30,000x ROI for early holders in the future.\par \par \uc2 2. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): Breaking Barriers in Global Transfers\par \par \uc2 XRP functions as a core asset on \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s payment network, allowing seamless transfers between various currencies, including both fiat and prominent cryptocurrencies. Recent news reveals that XRP has broken through its resistance levels, showing a 6.3% rise, and it currently trades at around $0.595.\par \par \uc2 Many are watching to see if it will maintain this upward trend and potentially push up to its next resistance point at $0.626. However, XRP\u8217\'20\'19s RSI indicator sits at 70, an \u8220\'20\'1Coverbought\u8221\'20\'1D level suggesting that a reversal could be looming. If RSI dips, a price pullback becomes more likely, signaling caution for traders.\par \par \uc2 3. Avalanche (AVAX): A World of Mini Blockchains\par \par \uc2 The Avalanche network, powered by \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , presents a unique vision. Its standout feature, \u8220\'20\'1Csubnets,\u8221\'20\'1D allows users to build personal blockchains on the main Avalanche network\u8212\'20\'14a novel idea that could make \uc2 AVAX\uc2  a powerhouse if widely adopted.\par \par \uc2 Ava Labs imagines a future where businesses and even individuals will use their own mini-blockchains. \uc2 AVAX\uc2  has shown strong growth, rising 115% over the past year. However, it\u8217\'20\'19s also down 29% in 2024 so far, a reminder of the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in crypto. Due to this fall, the current \uc2 AVAX\uc2  price forecast remains largely uncertain.\par \par \uc2 4. Cardano: Greener, Smarter & Built to Last\par \par \uc2 Founded by Ethereum co-founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s mission focuses on energy-efficient blockchain technology and creating a user-friendly space for decentralized apps (dApps). Unlike Ethereum, Cardano has a hard cap on its total supply at 45 billion coins, and with 78% of its supply already issued, dilution worries are minimized.\par \par \uc2 Cardano has seen notable growth, gaining nearly 80% in 2023, reaching around 45 cents, and boasting a market cap of over $15 billion. Yet, 2024 hasn\u8217\'20\'19t been as kind, as Cardano has dropped 32% this year.\par \par \uc2 Final Analysis: Top Trending Cryptos\par \par \uc2 In closing, it\u8217\'20\'19s clear that \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , Avalanche, Cardano, and BlockDAG each bring something remarkable to the world of crypto. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  is redefining global payments; Avalanche is building flexible, customizable subnets; and Cardano is setting new standards for eco-friendly blockchain.\par \par \uc2 Yet among these established coins, the newest entrant BlockDAG stands out as a crypto goldmine waiting to be tapped. Its hybrid model is designed to support the demands of today while paving the way for years of growth.\par \par \uc2 Add to this BDAG coin\u8217\'20\'19s impressive 2100% price surge since batch 1 and the buzz around a potential 30,000x ROI, and BlockDAG seems truly unstoppable. Ultimately, crypto buyers now have a range of choices, each offering distinct strengths and visions for the future!\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241113ekbc00006\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
