$74,949 with a daily trading volume of $63.94 billion.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Whales Stock Up On Cardano\par \par \uc2 Data from IntoTheBlock highlights a recent surge in Cardano whale holders. Over the past week Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s netflow was down by 1,181%. This trend suggests that Cardano whales are moving their holdings from exchanges to private wallets. Should this trend continue, it could lead to Cardano price increases in November.\par \par \uc2 Over the past year Cardano has been one of the market's worst performing top altcoins with an increase of just 9.22%. However, with the crypto market looking to enter a bull run in 2025 and large investors stacking \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens, Cardano is in a strong position to soar before the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Cutoshi Prepares For Stage 3 Of Its Presale\par \par \uc2 Cutoshi is benefiting from the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market trends as stage two of its presale closes out. This exciting new project has already raised over seven hundred thousand dollars and is turning the meme coin market on its head.\par \par \uc2 Cutoshi looks to build on the traditional meme coin model, offering great utility alongside a Chinese lucky cat themed meme coin. The project's ecosystem includes a decentralized exchange, an educational platform, NFTs and an exciting farming program.\par \par \uc2 The Cutoshi exchange focuses on usability. It lets investors trade assets across blockchains at extremely low fees with transactions being completed in less than a second.\par \par \uc2 $CUTO tokens will be used to power the Cutoshi ecosystem. Tokens can be staked for lucrative rewards and holders will also benefit from the project buyback program which will make $CUTO deflationary.\par \par \uc2 Over the last week, Cutoshi launched its farming program. By engaging with the Cutoshi community investors can earn CUTO points which can be redeemed for $CUTO tokens once the project officially launches. Over 1,300 people are already farming just days since the program was released and thousands more are expected to join in the upcoming weeks.\par \par \uc2 Spectators are anticipating huge returns for early adopters. With fantastic passive income opportunities, a rapidly growing community and a dynamic ecosystem, Cutoshi is certainly a project to look out for as the crypto market builds momentum.\par \par \uc2 For more information on the Cutoshi (CUTO) Presale:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cutoshi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cutoshi.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Join and become a community member:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CutoshiToken"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/CutoshiToken}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/cutoshi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/cutoshi}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241112ekbb00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/11: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, DOGE, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,785 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin chases consecutive all-time highs, while altcoins continue to tack on double-digit gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzFjMTQtNzNhOS03NTU0LTk5NTAtMzdhZmVlZDJiOTdi.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/11: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOGE, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , TON}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been on a roll and shows no signs of slowing down. The latest leg of the rally above $84,500 pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ath-market-cap-1-6-trillion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s total market capitalization above $1.67 trillion}}}\uc2  for the first time.\par \par \uc2 Analysts remain optimistic that Bitcoin will extend its month-to-date gains of 17% as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/80k-btc-price-gold-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November\u8217\'20\'19s average return is 44%}}}\uc2 , according to CoinGlass data. Veteran trader Peter Brandt said in a post on X that \u8220\'20\'1Cwhen BTC runs - it runs.\u8221\'20\'1D He projects Bitcoin to reach $125,000 by the end of the year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c0b-ddad-703e-a205-e526518b804a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp up move has turned select analysts \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju said in a post on X that Bitcoin could give up a large part of its gains to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptoquant-ceo-expects-pullback-58k-by-end-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 close the year at $58,974}}}\uc2 . In case Bitcoin sees a solid year-end rally, Ki expects a bear market in 2025.\par \par \uc2 What important resistance levels could attract profit booking in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) broke out to a new all-time high on Nov. 6 and has continued its northward march since then.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c0c-a5c8-740f-8f93-7666ba9257b3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch out for on the downside is the breakout level of 5,879. If the price stays above this level, the likelihood of a rally to 6,221 increases. This level may again act as a solid resistance, but if the bulls surpass it, the uptrend could extend to 6,500.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to swiftly pull the price below 5,879. If they do that, the index could slide to the next significant support at 5,670. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the 5,670 support.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) made a strong comeback on Nov. 6 and skyrocketed above the overhead resistance of 104.80.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c0d-af45-74f6-a76f-26b5072541c7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to trap the bulls by pulling the price below 104.80 on Nov. 7, but the lower levels attracted buyers. The bulls cleared the minor hurdle at 105.50 on Nov. 11, clearing the path for a rally to 106 and then to 106.50.\par \par \uc2 The breakout level of 104.80 and the 20-day exponential moving average (104.05) are likely to act as solid support on the way down. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has not looked back since breaking out of the overhead resistance at $73,777 on Nov. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c0e-61e8-7053-bc05-3415361d06a9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rally above $84,000 has pushed the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) into the overbought territory, suggesting that the BTC/USDT pair may soon enter a minor correction or consolidation. The support on the downside is at $80,000 and then at $77,000. A shallow pullback will improve the prospects of a rally to the pattern target of $93,554.\par \par \uc2 The short-term advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if they sink and sustain the price below the breakout level of $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) signaled a potential trend change after the price rose above the $2,850 resistance on Nov. 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c0f-059c-74bf-ab80-cd9efd6927e3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall the up move at $3,250 on Nov. 10, but the bulls did not cede ground to the bears. If buyers push and maintain the price above $3,250, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense at the downtrend line, but if the bulls have their way, the pair could surge to $4,094.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($2,756).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $210 resistance on Nov. 10, signaling the start of a new up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c0f-a816-7c15-ad6d-49b44c23eefe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the price above $210, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to start its journey toward $260. The bears are likely to fiercely defend the $260 level.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $210, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair may drop to $189 and thereafter to the 20-day EMA ($182). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to push the pair above $210 and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bulls tried to push the price above the overhead resistance at $635, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c10-3c62-730e-9bd6-34682bfde438"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price may dip to the moving averages, which are the near-term support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the $635 hurdle. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could surge toward $722.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the moving averages, the pair may drop to the uptrend line. That will indicate the continuation of the range-bound action between $635 and $460 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong up move for the past few days. The momentum picked up after buyers surmounted the $0.23 resistance on Nov. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c10-dfec-7619-a637-138297393cfa"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Nov. 11 candlestick shows that the bears are trying to stall the up move at $0.30. If buyers do not cede much ground to the bears, the DOGE/USDT pair may continue its uptrend toward $0.34.\par \par \uc2 A correction may set in if buyers fail to drive the pair above $0.30. The pair could drop to $0.26 and then to the breakout level of $0.23. Buyers will have to defend the $0.23 level to keep the positive sentiment intact.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-gains-significant-pullbacks-ruled-out-before-150k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price gains see 'significant pullbacks' ruled out before $150K}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rally to $0.64 on Nov. 10, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling near the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c11-8f3e-76c7-a185-d166552e1e87"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price finds support at the 20-day EMA ($0.54), the bulls will again try to drive the XRP/USDT pair to $0.64. The bears are expected to pose a strong challenge at $0.64, but if the bulls overcome it, the pair may rally to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then spend some more time inside the $0.41 to $0.64 range.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed after breaking out of the $0.45 resistance on Nov. 9, indicating the start of a new up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c12-1df9-7f71-a7bf-6c8a3b5f365f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rally is facing selling at $0.66, as seen from the long wick on the Nov. 10 candlestick. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has support at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.53 and then at the 50% retracement level of $0.49. A shallow pullback will increase the possibility of a rally to $0.78.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a drop below $0.49 will suggest that the short-term traders are rushing to the exit. The pair may then decline to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($5.03) on Nov. 9 and followed it up with a move above the 50-day SMA ($5.21) on Nov. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931c12-d530-7e8b-a539-ad278dfe4c67"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above the 50-day SMA, the bulls will try to push the TON/USDT pair to $6. The bears are expected to defend the level with vigor because a break and close above it will open the doors for a rally to $7.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $6 and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate near the bottom of the range. Sellers will have to sink the price below the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzFjMTQtNzNhOS03NTU0LTk5NTAtMzdhZmVlZDJiOTdi.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241111ekbb000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Ethereum Polkadot USDT Tether Cardano \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2  XRP Ripple Labs stellar BCH Bitcoin Cash XLM Link Chainlink Litecoin\par \b \uc2 What happened to the top 10 cryptos from when Trump was last president?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yohan Yun \par \uc2 2,145 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Half of the top 10 cryptocurrencies from \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s last term in the White House have since fallen from the rankings.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzFiOGUtMjljOS03NzhkLWJmZTUtMDEwYzdjN2ZhNDc0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What happened to the top 10 cryptos from when Trump was last president?}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has hit new all-time highs as President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  secured victory in the 2024 United States presidential election.\par \par \uc2 Set to return to the White House after departing in January 2021, Trump now appears to be bringing a pro-crypto stance with him. His campaign made several pledges in support of the cryptocurrency sector, marking a difference with the previous administration.\par \par \uc2 As Trump prepares to resume office, Cointelegraph looks back on how the cryptocurrency landscape appeared during his last term. The industry has seen major shifts since then \u8212\'20\'14 half of the top 10 coins from his previous term have fallen out of the rankings.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931bab-3f99-755e-8e83-938dd5e271d9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin, Stellar, XRP, Bitcoin Cash, Cardano, Tether, Chainlink, Polkadot}}}\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a look at how the top 10 cryptocurrencies from Trump\u8217\'20\'19s last presidency are faring today.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price Jan. 20, 2021: $35,302.18\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price Nov. 11, 2024: $82,379.60\par \par \uc2 Since Trump\u8217\'20\'19s last White House stint, Bitcoin has gone through more {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/joe-biden-withdraws-united-states-presidential-race"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 twists than the president-elect\u8217\'20\'19s path}}}\uc2  to election victory. First, there was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-in-classic-bull-pennant-breakout-as-btc-whales-go-on-buying-spree"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an all-time high}}}\uc2  of about $67,000 in November 2021. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-collapse-the-crypto-industry-s-lehman-brothers-moment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Then came FTX}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 the seismic crash of November 2022 that took Bitcoin down to $17,000 and left everyone wondering if the ride was over\par \par \uc2 Fast forward through a bear market for both Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the global economy, with BTC dragging its feet through most of it.\par \par \uc2 Still, like any good comeback story, Bitcoin rebounded in 2024 as it became accessible to institutions on the US stock market through those {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-bitcoin-etf-approvals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shiny new spot exchange-traded funds (ETFs)}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 With {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-election-win-bitcoin-100k-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts\u8217\'20\'19 eyes glued to the $100,000 mark}}}\uc2  as Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory signals the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gary-gensler-elections-sec-trump-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 beginning of the end for crypto\u8217\'20\'19s supervillain}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  at the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC), the asset has already {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-sets-fresh-all-time-high-near-77k-long-squeeze"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 smashed past the $82,000 mark}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In addition, Bitcoin now hosts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-are-bitcoin-ordinals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 digital trinkets like Ordinals}}}\uc2  (an iteration of non-fungible tokens) and some of the internet\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-runes-nft-protocol-transaction-fees-stats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 favorite memecoins through Runes}}}\uc2 . So while Bitcoin remains the gold-standard crypto in the age of Trump 2.0, it\u8217\'20\'19s also found some new ways to keep itself interesting along the way.\par \par \uc2 From undisputed king to layer-2 lab rat\par \par \uc2 Ether price Jan. 20, 2021: $1,361.05\par \par \uc2 Ether price Nov. 11, 2024: $3,175.47\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) was the undisputed monarch of smart contracts, reigning over a kingdom of decentralized applications. Now the crown isn\u8217\'20\'19t quite as secure and the network has some serious competition.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 , the fast, flashy upstart is now ranked fourth by market cap, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/total-economic-activity-solana-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taking the lead among the \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killer\u8221\'20\'1D blockchains}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Ethereum, however, has chosen a different route to stay relevant. Rather than battling it out for raw speed, it opted to expand with layer-2 solutions. This has helped ease the infamous congestion and sky-high fees, but there\u8217\'20\'19s a cost.\par \par \uc2 These layer-2 networks have drained liquidity and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/heres-how-to-tackle-defi-fragmentation-through-unified-liquidity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fragmented Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem}}}\uc2 , transforming its once-unified realm into a sprawling collection of mini-kingdoms.\par \par \uc2 In its quest to evolve, Ethereum also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-historic-day-for-crypto-as-ethereum-merge-to-proof-of-stake-occurs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 went green with The Merge}}}\uc2  in September 2022, swapping out proof-of-work for a more eco-friendly proof-of-stake consensus mechanism.\par \par \uc2 The upgrade {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-merge-a-year-later-energy-consumption-down-centralization-fears-ongoing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 slashed Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s energy use by 99%}}}\uc2  and set the stage for future scalability tweaks like sharding. The crypto world applauded, and it was a big step for Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s sustainability, though it didn\u8217\'20\'19t come with the explosive price surge some investors anticipated.\par \par \uc2 And while Bitcoin has been busy breaking records, Ethereum was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-underperforming-compared-to-the-wider-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 left in the dust}}}\uc2  despite {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cboe-official-launch-date-spot-ethereum-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 listing spot ETFs of its own}}}\uc2 . For now, Ethereum is still hanging on to its No. 2 spot, but simply being a legacy brand might not be enough to keep the crown.\par \par \uc2 Ignoring the haters\par \par \uc2 In the wake of the Terra-Luna collapse\u8212\'20\'14an implosion that rattled faith in algorithmic stablecoins everywhere\u8212\'20\'14Tether\u8217\'20\'19s USDT has not only weathered the storm but emerged stronger than ever. Now the third-largest cryptocurrency by market cap, USDT\u8217\'20\'19s valuation has ballooned to about $120 billion.\par \par \uc2 Despite raking in a net profit of $2.5 billion in the third quarter, bringing 2024\u8217\'20\'19s total to $7.7 billion, the company still hasn\u8217\'20\'19t undergone a full, comprehensive audit. Instead, Tether provides regular attestations.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-record-q3-profits-earnings-rise-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tether posts $2.5B in Q3 profits, with 2024 earnings reaching $7.7B}}}\par \par \uc2 So, what\u8217\'20\'19s driving this profit parade? US Treasury Bills, mostly. Tether\u8217\'20\'19s reserves now claim a comfortable $6 billion buffer, with $102.5 billion in Treasury Bills, making {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoins-boosting-demand-us-treasury-bills"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uncle Sam\u8217\'20\'19s debt Tether\u8217\'20\'19s golden goose}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But with great profits come great questions. Without a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-transparency-business-structure-118b-ftx-concern"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 formal audit}}}\uc2 , many are left wondering if Tether\u8217\'20\'19s vaults are as solid as they claim. Tether may be the titan, but trust is still the currency that matters most.\par \par \uc2 From contender to rebuilder\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price Jan. 20, 2021: $15.94\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price Nov. 11, 2024: $5.13\par \par \uc2 Back in Trump\u8217\'20\'19s last term, Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) was riding high. With a market value of $17 per token and the fourth spot in the crypto rankings, it looked poised to become the bridge across blockchain ecosystems, promising a future of seamless crosschain communication. In 2024, though, Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s shine has dulled \u8212\'20\'14 a $4.10 price tag and a drop to the 21st spot by market cap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931b93-e919-7ee3-90ef-41c65b169078"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 X post discusses users migrating to Soland from Polkadot}}}\par \par \uc2 Polkadot is no longer a top 10 crypto. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/_0numa/status/1851703896013455869"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Logan Saether}}}\par \par \uc2 Still, Polkadot is not waving a white flag. This year, it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://es.cointelegraph.com/news/polkadot-has-implemented-agile-coretime-in-its-systems"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rolled out Agile Coretime}}}\uc2 , a new system letting developers buy processing time directly on its core layer. It\u8217\'20\'19s part of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-polkadot-is-transforming-blockchain-technology-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot 2.0 upgrade}}}\uc2 , a major pivot from the old auction model.\par \par \uc2 With the introduction of \u8220\'20\'1Cinscriptions\u8221\'20\'1D \u8212\'20\'14 a playful nod to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Ordinals \u8212\'20\'14 Polkadot smashed transaction records in December 2023, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://polkadot.com/blog/polkadot_q4_update_data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 clocking in over 17 million transactions}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Still, Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s got a tough crowd to impress. Ethereum and \uc2 Solana\uc2  have cemented themselves as powerhouses in decentralized finance (DeFi), with other advanced chains nipping at their heels.\par \par \uc2 Clear skies ahead for XRP\par \par \uc2 XRP price Jan. 20, 2021: $0.285924\par \par \uc2 XRP price Nov. 11, 2024: $0.581592\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  held the fifth spot in crypto rankings in January 2021. It has dropped a bit to seventh, but growth has been mostly positive. Its price has jumped from $0.2958 to $0.5355, and its market cap has more than doubled to a cool $30.5 billion. Not bad for a cryptocurrency that\u8217\'20\'19s been through a legal saga intense enough for a courtroom drama series.\par \par \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2 , the San Francisco company that developed technology around the XRP Ledger and advocates for its use in cross-border transactions, scored a partial win in court in 2023.\par \par \uc2 After years of back-and-forth, the judge ruled that while some private sales of XRP did cross into unregistered securities territory, XRP itself {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 doesn\u8217\'20\'19t qualify as a security}}}\uc2 . It\u8217\'20\'19s a half-victory for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  and a full game-changer for the XRP ecosystem, which has long operated under a regulatory cloud.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-ripple-appeal-no-challenge-xrp-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC\u8217\'20\'19s Ripple appeal doesn\u8217\'20\'19t challenge XRP non-security status}}}\par \par \uc2 Now, with legal uncertainty clearing up, XRP is even being discussed as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-etf-21shares-sec-listing-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 candidate for an ETF}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 alongside {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/canary-capital-files-spot-solana-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 up-and-comers like Solana}}}\uc2 . An XRP ETF could open doors to a more mainstream audience, sparking fresh excitement among investors who\u8217\'20\'19ve weathered the ups and downs. So, while XRP might have slipped a couple of notches in the rankings, its resilience, steady growth and newfound legal clarity hint at the start of an unlikely comeback.\par \par \uc2 The \u8217\'20\'1990s band of crypto fighting for a comeback\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price Jan. 20, 2021: $0.358738\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price Nov. 11, 2024: $0.592937\par \par \uc2 Back in the last election cycle, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) was cruising comfortably in the top 10, with a reputation as an \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killer\u8221\'20\'1D and its roots tracing back to an Ethereum co-founder. Today, Cardano is a bit like that band from the \u8217\'20\'1990s that\u8217\'20\'19s still hanging around the charts, occasionally {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-ada-loses-spot-in-top-10-biggest-market-cap-cryptos-as-tron-sees-growth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 slipping in and out of the top 10}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Critics love to call it a \u8220\'20\'1Cghost chain,\u8221\'20\'1D claiming there\u8217\'20\'19s not much building going on and even fewer users to show up. And the numbers do raise an eyebrow: Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s core developer and active user count have dropped.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931b96-af22-7e4a-b8a9-cb40f75496ad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chart of Cardano's developers and code commits declining}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s code commits and core developer count drops. Source: Token Terminal\par \par \uc2 Yet Cardano isn\u8217\'20\'19t sitting back and letting the doubters have their say. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-the-cardano-chang-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Chang hard fork}}}\uc2 , completed in September 2024, ushered in fresh features and scalability upgrades, signaling it\u8217\'20\'19s still got some tricks up its sleeve. The network has also entered the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-voltaire-era-june-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Voltaire phase}}}\uc2 , aiming for a decentralized governance model where users can participate directly in decision-making.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  and Bitcoin Cash: The original rebels fighting for relevance\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price Jan. 20, 2021: $149.80\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price Nov. 11, 2024: $77.38\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash price Jan. 20, 2021: $501.72\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash price Nov. 11, 2021: $438.73\par \par \uc2 In the early days of crypto, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) were the champions of \u8220\'20\'1Cspendable\u8221\'20\'1D cryptocurrency \u8212\'20\'14 two coins vying to be digital cash for everyday use.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , the \u8220\'20\'1Clite\u8221\'20\'1D version of Bitcoin, offered faster transactions and lower fees, while Bitcoin Cash split off from Bitcoin with a bold promise: to fulfill the original peer-to-peer cash vision of \uc2 Satoshi Nakamoto\uc2  by boosting block sizes and reducing fees.\par \par \uc2 Both coins gained loyal followings and even some merchants, but their paths feel more like nostalgia trips than the revolution they aimed to spark.\par \par \uc2 In a world where Bitcoin has solidified itself as \u8220\'20\'1Cdigital gold\u8221\'20\'1D and newer cryptos offer advanced features like smart contracts and decentralized applications, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  and Bitcoin Cash struggle to stand out.\par \par \uc2 Countries banning crypto payments and regulatory red tape haven\u8217\'20\'19t helped, either. While some small pockets of adoption persist \u8212\'20\'14 think cafes in Townsville, Ljubljana, and parts of Buenos Aires \u8212\'20\'14 the broad use case for everyday transactions hasn\u8217\'20\'19t materialized.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  and Bitcoin Cash have both dropped out of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market cap, sitting at the 25th and 19th spots respectively.\par \par \uc2 Behind the scenes of DeFi\par \par \uc2 LINK price Jan. 20, 2021: $20.51\par \par \uc2 LINK price Nov. 11, 2024: $13.99\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) isn\u8217\'20\'19t here to be \u8220\'20\'1Cdigital cash\u8221\'20\'1D or a \u8220\'20\'1Csmart contract superstar,\u8221\'20\'1D but rather the backbone of the crypto world, quietly holding the DeFi universe together.\par \par \uc2 While other cryptocurrencies chase headlines and retail hype, Chainlink is hard at work feeding price data, weather forecasts and other real-world information to blockchains that need them. Since Trump\u8217\'20\'19s last term, Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s role as the go-to oracle service has only solidified, making it the ultimate backstage hero of decentralized finance.\par \par \uc2 The recent rollout of Chainlink 2.0 added even more muscle to its oracle network. This upgrade introduced decentralized oracle networks, enabling dynamic non-fungible tokens, automated blockchain functions and all kinds of new DeFi magic.\par \par \uc2 With staking finally available, LINK holders can now secure the network and earn rewards \u8212\'20\'14 a long-awaited perk that gives a boost to this data-driven ecosystem. Chainlink is now better equipped for complex tasks, proving that it\u8217\'20\'19s not just reliable but versatile too.\par \par \uc2 LINK\u8217\'20\'19s price hasn\u8217\'20\'19t enjoyed the same steady rise as its reputation. The token has been buffeted by \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and competition. New oracle providers have entered the scene, and some DeFi projects are building their own oracles.\par \par \uc2 Not so stellar\par \par \uc2 XLM price Jan. 20, 2021: $0.291680\par \par \uc2 XLM price Nov. 11, 2024: $0.109166\par \par \uc2 Launched by \uc2 Ripple\uc2  co-founder \uc2 Jed McCaleb\uc2  in 2014, Stellar set out to offer quick, low-cost international transactions, connecting everyone from financial institutions to the unbanked.\par \par \uc2 Since Trump\u8217\'20\'19s last term, Stellar has made strides in the central bank digital currency (CBDC) arena, particularly with its pilot project in Ukraine to test a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ukraine-central-bank-now-officially-allowed-to-issue-digital-currency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 digital version of the hryvnia}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/tokenization-projects-transforming-farmers-lives-africa/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Real life yield farming: How tokenization is transforming lives in Africa}}}\par \par \uc2 But Stellar\u8217\'20\'19s journey hasn\u8217\'20\'19t been all, well, stellar. The competition in cross-border payments has only ramped up. Governments exploring CBDCs often look toward centralized solutions or established platforms like Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 Stellar\u8217\'20\'19s XLM token has suffered as the market increasingly tilts toward DeFi-focused chains with high-profile use cases. It\u8217\'20\'19s dropped from the 10th spot to the 35th spot, as of Nov. 8, 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzFiOGUtMjljOS03NzhkLWJmZTUtMDEwYzdjN2ZhNDc0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241111ekbb0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Why is Dogecoin price up today\par \b \uc2 Why is Dogecoin price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 788 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is up today, fueled by \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s with over \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  in the 2024 US presidential election.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMzAyMDU4OWUtMmQ1My00ZDEzLWJjNGEtZTQ0N2I2MmYyNmEy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Dogecoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index#:~:text=Aside%20from%20a%20few%20brief,reaching%20%240.74%20on%20May%207."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), the largest memecoin by market capitalization, has rallied more than 23% in the past 24 hours, emerging as the best crypto market performer amid anticipation surrounding \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s support of the memecoin in the Trump administration.\par \par \uc2 Currently trading at $0.2771, DOGE has reached its highest value since Oct. 2021, marking an 86% climb over the last seven days and is up 152% over the last month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931a79-3908-7755-908d-a0076e1cb86d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/XCWjoc8v/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE now commands a market capitalization of over $41.2 billion at the time of publication, surpassing USDC\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ) $36.9 billion and XRP's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) $32.7 billion capitalization to become the sixth-largest crypto by market value.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931a79-b5a4-747c-9f5b-e3b64d7a9aa2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of top 10 cryptocurrencies by market cap. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 Pro-crypto Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory boosts DOGE price\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance coincides with rallies across the crypto market, which sent Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) into price discovery, setting a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-move-to-80-000-could-trigger-a-rally-in-eth-sol-sui-and-aave#:~:text=Bitcoin%20price%20analysis&text=That%20pushed%20the%20price%20above%20%2480%2C000.&text=The%20target%20objective%20of%20the,running%20out%20for%20the%20bears."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time high above $82,000}}}\uc2  on Nov. 11. This comes less than seven days after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-declares-victory-crypto-community"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump emerged victorious}}}\uc2  in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-elections"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2024 US presidential election}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 DOGE, with its reputation as a community-driven, high-\b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  memecoin, is benefiting from renewed trading interest due to the possibility of its abbreviation becoming a part of \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s new administration.\par \par \uc2 While on the campaign trail in support of Trump, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-net-worth-soared-over-20-billion-trump-victory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk}}}\uc2  proposed the establishment of the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-breakout-3-year-channel-500-rally-potential-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Department of Government Efficiency}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D aimed at reducing government waste\u8212\'20\'14a concept conveniently abbreviated as D.O.G.E.\par \par \uc2 This has triggered speculation among traders that there could be more to D.O.G.E. than just an abbreviation for a possible government department, fueling attention and interest in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-dogecoin-a-beginners-guide-to-doge-cryptocurrency#:~:text=Dogecoin%20features%20a%20block%20confirmation,the%20same%20amount%20of%20time."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931a7a-5f64-7923-8308-76606bff594d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/DogeGuy14/status/1855757619190763864"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DogeGuy}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE funding rates spike\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action on Nov. 11 is preceded by a jump in open interest-weighted funding rate, suggesting that new capital is entering the market. The chart below shows that DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s 8-hour OI-weighted funding rate increased to 0.0448% on Nov. 11, the highest since June 2024.\par \par \uc2 This suggests a high appetite for long positions as DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s price gained around 23% over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931a7a-b811-7573-92ed-234908e9334b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE OI-weighted funding rates. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s rally on Nov. 10 was accompanied by short liquidations totaling $37.25 million against $24 in long liquidations. This has resulted in more than $36.4 million short DOGE liquidations over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931a7b-0f53-7cb6-9586-0d2271759fd8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE liquidations. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 In other words, short traders were caught off-guard by DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s rise to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s U-shaped pattern points to a rise to $0.37\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s gains today are part of a 259%% rebound from the Aug. 5 lows around $0.080, leading to the formation of a golden cross on its daily chart, recouping all the losses incurred between March 28 and Aug. 5.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-8-btc-eth-sol-bnb-xrp-doge-ton-ada-shib-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/8: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-a-golden-cross-pattern-and-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 golden cross}}}\uc2  is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  technical pattern that occurs when a shorter-term moving average, typically the 50-day moving average (MA), crosses above a longer-term moving average, usually the 200-day MA.\par \par \uc2 The formation of this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal on Nov. 6 saw DOGE price make a decisive move above the neckline of a U-shaped recovery pattern at $0.228.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931a7b-99f0-7d09-a19e-308a5b3c0337"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Twitter, Cryptocurrencies, Markets, Donald Trump, Tesla, Elon Musk, Tech Analysis, Grayscale, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch, Memecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/1y7UlR8s/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A decisive close above the psychological level at $0.30 will likely push DOGE/USD toward the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target of the prevailing pattern at $0.377, representing more than 34% gains from the current price.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a retreat from $0.28 could see a retest of the U-shaped neckline at around $0.22.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMzAyMDU4OWUtMmQ1My00ZDEzLWJjNGEtZTQ0N2I2MmYyNmEy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241111ekbb0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
