\par\par \b \uc2 Altcoins to Buy as BTC Smashes $80K in post-Trump Victory\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 1,014 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC Sets ATH and ETH Breaks Though $3,000 Level}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins Surge}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sui (SUI)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)}}}\par \par \uc2 The surge after the recent presidential election outcome sent Bitcoin (BTC) and altcoins to new all-time highs. BTC briefly rose above $80,000, and altcoins such as Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Solana (SOL), Sui (SUI) and Ethereum (ETH) have seen equally impressive gains.\par \par \uc2 BTC Sets ATH and ETH Breaks Though $3,000 Level\par \par \uc2 Markets are overwhelmed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment triggered by \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory over \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 . We have seen unprecedented runs following Trump\u8217\'20\'19s landslide victory, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  broke through $80,000 to set a new ATH of $80,071. Ethereum (ETH), the second biggest crypto by market cap, has witnessed significant gains over the past week and has gained much of the traction it lost in recent months. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  is up 32% in the past week to trade at $3,205.\par \par \uc2 Pauline Shangett, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://changenow.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ChangeNOW}}}\uc2 , commented on the market\u8217\'20\'19s performance, saying:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWow. What can we say? BTC and altcoins are finally showing a glimpse of their potential, and market watchers are going all out. Market interest is at an all-time high, and ongoing momentum suggests more is to come.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Altcoins Surge\par \par \uc2 The crypto scene is often accompanied by amusing phrases such as \u8220\'20\'1CWhen Lambo?\u8221\'20\'1D or \u8220\'20\'1CWhen Moon?\u8221\'20\'1D referring to the eager anticipation of crypto holders for the time the market finally breaks out and delivers long-awaited gains. Crypto enthusiasts have waited years and years for this to happen. They are continuously searching for a project to reap the rewards of the highly anticipated breakout, and it appears investors are close to realizing their dreams. We have seen many projects surpass Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s growth, with this number increasing daily. While Bitcoin will forever remain the OG crypto regarded in the highest esteem, altcoins are more likely to deliver significant gains.\par \par \uc2 Join us as we delve into four exciting altcoin projects set for explosive growth.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of the best-performing altcoins in recent days, having gained over 36% in the past 24 hours and is up nearly 80% in the past week, trading at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $0.5975}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Cardano network was created through a rigorous research-driven approach and focuses on scalability, sustainability, and interoperability to address the limitations of existing blockchain technologies. It is a prominent third-generation blockchain that prioritizes notable concerns in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  world, such as sustainability, scalability, and security. It is one of the most sophisticated and effective blockchain systems owing to its Design For Telecom (DFT) architecture and unique proof of stake (PoS) consensus mechanism.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is a dynamic crypto market player prized for its robust fundamentals and innovative approach to blockchain. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s recent surge in interest stems from its active community and continued improvements to its infrastructure. Investors are optimistic about Cardano's potential in the bull run, fueled by its unique features and unrelenting commitment to academic research. With an emphasis on security and scalability, Cardano is well-positioned for future growth, making it a prime investment opportunity. As more and more projects build on the Cardano blockchain, demand for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is expected to rise, solidifying its already strong market position.\par \par \uc2 Sui (SUI)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/sui/#About"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sui (SUI)}}}\uc2  is one of the top-performing cryptocurrencies in 2024. SUI is a revolutionary L1 blockchain platform designed to support the needs of global adoption by offering a robust, secure and scalable development platform. At the heart of Sui is a novel object-centric data model and secure development programming language that addresses common inefficiencies of existing blockchain structures. Sui puts user experience at the forefront by reducing issues with blockchain interoperability. Sui\u8217\'20\'19s native token, SUI, set its all-time high earlier today, reaching $3.14 and has gained nearly 26% in the past day. SUI also gained a massive 61% in the past week.\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF)\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat ($WIF) is still a newcomer to the crypto market and has significantly impacted the industry. WIF has high hopes of becoming the new top dog, and despite its infancy, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/memecoins-wif-brett-and-bonk-at-or-approaching-good-buy-zones"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WIF}}}\uc2  yielded an immense 1,495% gain in the past year, currently trading for $2.69. Dogwifhat (WIF) has been one of the top-performing memecoins throughout the year, and despite losing much of its value after reaching an all-time high (ATH) of $4.8, Dogwifhat (WIF) is back in the spotlight and has joined BTC\u8217\'20\'19s upward momentum. WIF\u8217\'20\'19s recent upward momentum has analysts predicting a potential 2000% increase for the year, placing it firmly on investors' radar.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/dogwifhat/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WIF\u8217\'20\'19s}}}\uc2  impressive gain is supported by its strong community engagement, strategic partnerships, and \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU)\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu (HINU) is one of the newest members of the highly coveted Solana network, created to bring its holders more value and utility by harnessing the power of this blockchain. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-raises-over-55k-in-early-presale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  recently launched the presale of its native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/husky-inu-hinu-presale-hits-100k-in-sales"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HINU}}}\uc2 , with tremendous success, and the two are on a mission to conquer the memecoin industry through a robust and supportive community with innovative features and enhanced rewards.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 The HINU presale has been immensely popular. Since going live, the presale has generated over $480,000, with numbers rapidly rising. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  is working on some exciting things, including an Earn App and a Decentralized Exchange. The Earn App will reward users with HINU tokens for engaging with the project, and the Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading to improve utility and value for HINU holders. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/5-cheap-memecoins-poised-to-make-millionaires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241111ekba00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $80K for the first time \u8212\'20\'14 New 'inflation-adjusted' all-time high\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 553 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is on the road to deliver its best weekly performance since February following Trump's reelection.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzE2MDktMjE5ZS03Y2ViLWI0ZGUtY2EzMWFkMjRiMGY2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $80K for the first time \u8212\'20\'14 New 'inflation-adjusted' all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price crossed the $80,000 mark for the first in history, just days after \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s reelection in the recent United States presidential elections.\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 10, the top cryptocurrency rose by almost 4.50% to reach a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-new-price-target-80k-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflation-adjusted}}}\uc2  record high of $80,116 (data from \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Smaller tokens, including Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) also rallied.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931600-9258-7e85-a361-f6cd66eab902"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $80K for the first time \u8212\'20\'14 New 'inflation-adjusted' all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 During his election campaigns, Trump had vowed to position the US as a leader in the crypto industry, further proposing to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-case-bitcoin-reserve-asset-bitcoin-policy-institute"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 develop a strategic Bitcoin reserve}}}\uc2  and appointing pro-crypto regulators. Following his win on Nov. 6, Bitcoin has risen by 15.65% and is on the course to deliver its best weekly performance since February.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin beats gold, stocks in 2024\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has surged roughly 80% in 2024, driven by strong demand for US-based exchange-traded funds (ETFs) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-the-feds-rate-cut-means-for-crypto-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Federal Reserve interest rate cuts}}}\uc2 . In doing so, it has outpaced traditional investments like stocks and gold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931608-b5c2-7a23-9bf3-de742cf3b297"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $80K for the first time \u8212\'20\'14 New 'inflation-adjusted' all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 Gold and S&P 500 index vs. BTC/USD year-to-date performance. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Spot Bitcoin ETFs such as \uc2 BlackRock Inc.\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s $35 billion \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (IBIT) have played a huge role in the ongoing BTC price boom.\par \par \uc2 For instance, IBIT recorded daily net inflows of nearly $1.4 billion on Nov. 8, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/btc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Farside Investors}}}\uc2  data. The day before, trading volume for the iShares ETF had reached an all-time high, highlighting the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  impact of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s political comeback on the crypto industry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193160b-a5a4-7c4b-8137-48c529fed0a5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $80K for the first time \u8212\'20\'14 New 'inflation-adjusted' all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs net cumulative flow. Source: Farside Investors\par \par \uc2 BTC price will hit $100K next, asserts top analysts\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s climb above $80,000 has raised anticipations for a continued bull run in the coming weeks, with multiple analysts anticipating a rise {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-presidential-victory-paves-way-100k-bitcoin-end-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 toward $100,000 next}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-200k-end-2025-bernstein-forecast"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin forecast to hit $200K by end of 2025: Bernstein Research}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Rover, for instance, cited Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s tendency to establish record highs \u8220\'20\'1C50-60 days after the US elections,\u8221\'20\'1D noting that the price could reach $100,000 by January 20245 if the fractal plays out as intended.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01931615-84fe-7b4b-a739-3161e1e402cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $80K for the first time \u8212\'20\'14 New 'inflation-adjusted' all-time high}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/rovercrc/status/1853140335221727461"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Rover}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn the last few days 60,000 BTC were bought by retail investors, 1800 BTC was bought by \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , at the same time only 450 Bitcoin are mined each day and only two million BTC are available to buy on exchanges,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/DrProfitCrypto/status/1855032693295317403"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2  analyst Doctor Profit, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf we continue in this speed we will reach $100,000 by end of year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzE2MDktMjE5ZS03Y2ViLWI0ZGUtY2EzMWFkMjRiMGY2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241110ekba0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
