\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 11-8 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGECOIN: DOGE, CHAINLINK: LINK, DOGWIFHAT: WIF, INTERNET COMPUTER: ICP\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,573 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Surges As Industry Braces For Monumental Shift}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump Win Ignites A $300B Surge In Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fed Chair Jerome Powell Not Stepping Down}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) surged to a new all-time high, reaching $76,943, only a couple of days after it smashed its previous all-time high of $76,191, as markets continued their upward trajectory following \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory. BTC also reported a surge in trading volume, which rose to $128 billion in the past 24 hours. Trump has vowed to make the US the \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin superpower of the world\u8221\'20\'1D and potentially hinted at firing current SEC Chair, \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 , who has pursued legal action against several crypto firms.\par \par \uc2 BTC is now up almost 10% over the past week. Other major cryptocurrencies have also continued their upward trajectory. Major gainers include Ethereum (ETH), Solana (SOL), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ADA-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , Chainlink (LINK), Stellar (XLM), Injective (INJ), and others. However, despite the price jump, the overall crypto market cap registered a drop of 1.04% and fell to $2.51 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Speaking about BTC\u8217\'20\'19s surge to a new all-time high, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://changenow.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ChangeNOW}}}\uc2  CMO Pauline Shangett stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin's recent rally to a new all-time high reflects renewed optimism in the market, especially following Trump\u8217\'20\'19s pro-crypto stance. His promise to make the U.S. a 'Bitcoin superpower' has fueled \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , while speculation around potential regulatory changes is creating a fertile environment for growth in the space.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto Surges As Industry Braces For Monumental Shift\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/11/crypto-price-analysis-11-7-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-toncoin-ton-artificial-superintelligence-alliance-fet-cosmos-atom-optimism-op"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  set a new all-time high hours ago, and crypto-related stocks posted significant gains following \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s victory in the elections. The surge indicates growing optimism about a potential change in regulatory approach under the new administration. Crypto stocks like \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  (COIN) registered a sharp jump, gaining 31% to close at $254. Other major players reported similar gains, with Robinhood registering a 19% increase, \uc2 MARA Holdings\uc2  registering an increase of almost 19%, and \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  registering an increase in excess of 13%. Cryptocurrencies besides BTC and ETH also posted significant increases while Uniswap (UNI) registered a staggering 35% increase.\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brian Armstrong\uc2  expressed optimism about crypto moving forward, stating,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAmerica is going to follow a path toward economic freedom which is our source of strength, based on limited government, rule of law, meritocracy, fiscal discipline, respecting the free market (not government).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump Win Ignites A $300B Surge In Crypto\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market cap registered an increase of $330 billion in value as investor interest skyrocketed, buoyed by the prospect of a crypto-friendly administration. The market cap currently sits at a staggering $2.51 trillion. Crypto behemoths Bitcoin (BTC) and Ethereum (ETH) led the rally. BTC surged to a new all-time high in the hours following the election and surged to $76,943 earlier today.\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory has sparked significant optimism among investors and energized the crypto community, thanks to his association with figures like \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 . Under a Trump presidency, investors anticipate a drop in regulatory restrictions, allowing greater flexibility in the crypto sector. The Republican party has been quite critical of the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 's (SEC) handling of the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  Not Stepping Down\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  announced a second rate cut, marking a cautious shift in monetary policy. The move comes as Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  quashed discussions about his resignation, asserting the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s autonomy from presidential influence. The Fed\u8217\'20\'19s decision to approve a second rate cut of 25 basis points indicates it is continuing to adjust monetary policy following September\u8217\'20\'19s rate cut of 50 basis points.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  confirmed he would not be stepping down if President-elect \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  requested, adding that the president does not have legal authority to fire or demote him as it is not permitted by law.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  surged to a new all-time high of $76,943 hours ago as markets continued their post-election rally. The world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency is up almost 10% over the past week, with analysts expecting a push to $80,000 by the end of the year. As we can see in the price chart, BTC has come down slightly after hitting its new all-time high and is currently trading just under $76,000. The world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency also reported a spike in trading volume in the past 24 hours. The Fed\u8217\'20\'19s decision to lower interest rates by 25 basis points further buoyed market optimism. The cut brought the benchmark rate down to $4.50%, following a 50 basis point rate cut in September. Following the FOMC meeting, Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  stated he was optimistic about economic activity.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf the economy remains strong and inflation is not sustainably moving toward 2%, we can dial back policy restraint more slowly. If the labor market were to weaken unexpectedly, or inflation was to fall more quickly than anticipated, we can move more quickly.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Historically, BTC and the crypto markets have responded positively to low interest rates. This is because low rates increase investor appetite for risk assets like cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Looking at the price chart, BTC was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  leading up to the elections but has posted a significant rally and set new all-time highs following the results. After registering a substantial drop last Thursday, BTC continued to drop on Friday, slipping below $70,000 and settling at $69,562 after a fall of just over 1%. BTC posted a marginal increase on Saturday but fell back in the red on Sunday, dropping almost 1% to $68,909. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Monday as BTC slipped below the 20-day SMA and dropped to an intraday low of $66,832. However, it recovered from this level and settled at $67,882, a drop of 1.49%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/9knMopfX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, it recovered on Tuesday as market sentiment began changing on the eve of the elections. As a result, BTC pushed back above the 20-day SMA and settled at $69,458 after an increase of 2.32%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Wednesday as BTC surged over 8% to move past 70,000 and settle at $75,125 after setting a new all-time high at $76,000. BTC set a new all-time high on Thursday, rising to an intraday high of $76,943 before declining and settling at $75,776. The current session sees BTC marginally up and trading just below the $76,000 mark. Analysts expect BTC to remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and push to $80,000 by the end of the year. However, with the \uc2 RSI\uc2  currently in the overbought zone, we may see a slight pullback before BTC resumes its upward trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  is looking to push above the 200-day SMA and $3,000 but faces considerable selling pressure at these levels. ETH has rallied strongly following the elections and has surged past the 20 and 50-day SMAs and crucial resistance levels. As we can see in the price chart, ETH slipped below the 20 and 50-day SMAs last week as sellers dominated the market. By Friday, it dipped to an intraday low of $2,466 before recovering and selling at $2,512. However, selling pressure returned over the weekend as ETH dropped by 0.79% on Saturday and 1.43% on Sunday, dropping to a low of $2,410 before settling at $2,456.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/JU5IfZvi/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Monday as ETH slipped below $2,400 after a drop of 2.41% pushed the price down to $2,397. However, sentiment began shifting on Tuesday as ETH recovered from $2,400, rising by 1.23% to $2,423. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment surged on Wednesday following election results, and ETH rallied over 12% to go past the 20 and 50-day SMAs and $2,700 to settle at $2,723. Bulls remained in control on Wednesday, and ETH surged past $2,850 on its way to $2,897 after an increase of 6.41%. The current session sees ETH up by 0.80%, moving past $2,900 and trading at $2,920. ETH reached an intraday high of $2,955 before declining to its current level. Should \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persist, we could see ETH push above the 200-day SMA and $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) is on the brink of pushing above $200 but is facing considerable resistance as buyers and sellers battle to dictate price movements. SOL spent most of the previous week in the red, dropping below $170 on Friday and settling at $166, just above the 20-day SMA. Buyers and sellers struggled to take control on Saturday, leading to considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Ultimately, neither could take the upper hand, and SOL remained at $166. However, buyers took control on Sunday, driving SOL down to an intraday low of $157. SOL recovered from this level to push above $160 and settle at $162, a drop of 2.20% from the previous day.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/11JkGDVs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisting as SOL dipped by almost 3% to go below $160 and settle at $157. The price recovered Tuesday as market sentiments began changing, rising nearly 6% to reclaim $160 and settle at $166, just below the 20-day SMA. Markets surged on Wednesday following the election, and SOL surged over 12% to go past the 20-day SMA and settle at $186, with buyers setting their sights on $190. SOL breached $190 on Wednesday after registering a substantial increase of 5.23% and settling at $196. The current session sees SOL up by 1.30% as buyers look to push the price above $200. If SOL can go above this level, we could expect a jump to $220 or $230. However, with the \uc2 RSI\uc2  creeping into the overbought zone, we could see a slight pullback in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  surpassed all expectations after a staggering 25% increase on election day. However, its price has since retreated and is back under $0.200, with the popular meme coin reporting a substantial cutback following profit booking after its price jump. DOGE was trading in the red during the latter half of the previous week as sellers drove the price down from $0.175. By Sunday, DOGE dipped below the 20-day SMA and fell to an intraday low of $0.141 before reclaiming $0.150 and settling at $0.151.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/eGT5FbAb/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE began the current week positively, rising by 4.43% and settling at $0.158. The price surged to an intraday high of $0.179 before settling at $0.170, an increase of almost 8%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment gathered momentum on Wednesday as DOGE surged over 25% to an intraday high of $0.218 thanks to a decisive Trump victory. However, it retreated from these levels, slipping below $0.200 and settling at $0.196, ultimately registering an increase of almost 17%. The price dropped by nearly 2% on Thursday as DOGE slipped to $0.192. However, it is back in the green during the current session and is up almost 3% as buyers look to push the price above $0.200.\par \par \uc2 With the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone, analysts expect a marginal decline in the short term before \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment resumes.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/LINK-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK)}}}\uc2  is testing the overhead resistance as it looks to go above the 200-day SMA and $13 after registering an unprecedented surge following election results. LINK was extremely \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the previous week and slipped below the 20 and 50-day SMAs on Friday after a drop of 1.21% to settle at $11.26. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Saturday as LINK dropped by 0.78% to $11.17. Sunday saw LINK slip below a crucial support level after a drop of almost 4% and settle at $10.76.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/9CjlgQz3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with sellers retaining control as LINK dropped almost 5% to $10.24. However, markets began recovering on Tuesday as LINK registered an increase of nearly 6% to settle at $10.85. LINK rallied over 12% on Wednesday to surge past the 20 and 50-day SMAs, reclaiming crucial levels and settling at $12.18. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum persisted on Thursday as LINK rose to $12.60. The current session sees LINK up by 1.40% as buyers look to push the price above the 200-day SMA and $13. A break above this level could see LINK rise to $14.\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) has declined over the past couple of sessions despite rising substantially on Tuesday and Wednesday. The popular Solana-based meme coin was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  the previous week and ended the weekend in the red after dropping to a low of $1.96 before settling at $1.07. WIF slipped below $2 on Monday as it started the week in the red, dropping over 7% to $1.92. Despite the overwhelming \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, WIF recovered on Tuesday, rising by 9.46%, reclaiming $2 and settling at $2.10.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ipFgDJsL/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price rallied on Wednesday, surging past the 20 and 50-day SMAs and settling at $2.40 after registering an increase of almost 15%. However, with strong resistance at upper levels, WIF fell back in the red, dropping by 0.91% on Thursday after reaching a high of $2.48 and settling at $2.38. Buyers attempted to push above $2.50 during the ongoing session but were unsuccessful. As a result, sellers took over and WIF is down almost 3%, trading below the 20 and 50-day SMAs at $2.32.\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) also faced considerable selling pressure during the previous week, slipping below crucial support levels. By Friday, it had dipped below $8 and settled at $7.80. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified over the weekend as ICP dropped by 3.59% on Saturday and 4.39% on Sunday to settle at $7.19. Sellers remained in control on Monday as ICP fell to an intraday low of $6.83. However, it recovered from this level to reclaim $7 and settle at $7.02. With markets turning \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday, ICP registered an increase of 4.99% to settle at $7.37.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/TLmh1k8B/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment picked up on Wednesday as ICP rose over 7% to move past the 20-day SMA and settle at $7.89. \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  picked up on Thursday as buyers and sellers attempted to exert influence. Buyers looked to push ICP above $8, while sellers tried to drive the price below $7.50. As a result, ICP rose to an intraday high of $8.12 and fell to an intraday low of $7.53 before settling at $7.82, a drop of almost 1%. The current session sees sellers retain control, with ICP down nearly 2% and trading at $7.67.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241109ekb80000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/8: BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,790 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s breakout to a new all-time high has improved sentiment, attracting buyers to select altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzBjYTctNjIyMC03YWM5LWIzYzMtZmI0MGIyYmQzNDY1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/8: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price hit a new all-time high at $77,000 on Nov. 8 and traders anticipate the up move to continue. Bitget Research chief analyst Ryan Lee anticipates {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-high-can-bitcoin-price-go-before-trump-inauguration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to surge}}}\uc2  to \u8220\'20\'1C$100,000 within the next three months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Analysts believe that the recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-all-time-highs-not-overheated-signals-crypto-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin rally is not overheated}}}\uc2  and is backed by solid fundamentals. Galaxy head of research Alex Thorn said in a Nov. 7 market report viewed by Cointelegraph that Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies are likely to trade \u8220\'20\'1Cat levels significantly above today\u8217\'20\'19s all-time high over the next 12-18 months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c93-a418-762f-8484-a573e78ba93c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Popular trader and analyst Rekt Capital said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-can-go-parabolic-btc-price-above-71-5-k-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a weekly close above $71,500}}}\uc2  could start the \u8220\'20\'1Cparabolic phase.\u8221\'20\'1D He expects \u8220\'20\'1Ca very, very limited prospect of additional consolidation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While signs point to a continued uptrend, traders need to be careful because the consensus is leaning heavily toward the long side. When that happens, the possibility of a sharp dip to shake out the weak hands cannot be ruled out.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels to watch out for during any correction in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading above the breakout level of $73,777 for the past two days, indicating that the bulls are holding onto their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c94-2d0c-7844-b138-411ad62a5289"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The target objective of the breakout from the large range of $54,000 to $73,777 is $93,554. However, the bulls are expected to encounter stiff resistance from the bears who will try to yank the price back into the range.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($70,290). A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will signal that the bulls remain in control.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls are hurrying to book profits. The pair could then plunge to the 50-day simple moving average ($66,263).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) blew past the symmetrical triangle\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line and the $2,850 resistance on Nov. 7, signaling a potential trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c94-b7c1-73ca-9fb7-057bdc241f2d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are unlikely to give up easily and will try to pull the price back toward the triangle. If the bulls do not allow the price to re-enter the triangle, it will signal buying on dips. The ETH/USDT pair could climb to the downtrend line, where the bears will again try to halt the up move.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the price slips back into the triangle, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair may tumble to the moving averages and then to the support line.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after breaking out of the $180 overhead resistance on Nov. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c95-42af-7c15-a0d1-b8ef79a23ae4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair has continued its northward journey toward the critical resistance of $210. Sellers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break above it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The pair could then skyrocket to $260.\par \par \uc2 The support on the downside is at $189 and thereafter at $180. If the price stays above the support, the possibility of an upside breakout remains high. Sellers will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA ($172) to weaken the bulls.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) reached the $612 level on Nov. 7, where the bears are mounting a solid resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c95-c36c-7bb9-9c5d-2c16422d6c33"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers pierce the overhead resistance, the BNB/USDT pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern. There is solid resistance at $635, but if the bulls overcome it, the pair may rally to the pattern target of $689.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair could extend its stay inside the triangle for some more time. The bears will be back in the game if they sink the pair below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($0.55) on Nov. 7 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c96-3f92-7bd0-a963-1ea13b96a1b0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price below the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($0.53), which is expected to attract buyers. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the bulls will make another attempt to drive the pair to $0.64.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then drop to the crucial support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rally hit a wall at $0.22 on Nov. 6, but the bulls have managed to keep the price above the breakout level of $0.18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c96-c1fd-71b6-9ed7-d120ef56a33f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Nov. 7 and again on Nov. 8, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears. If the price skids below $0.18, it will signal that the bulls are rushing to the exit. The pair may then descend to the 20-day EMA ($0.16).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and closes above $0.20, the bulls are likely to have another go at the $0.22 resistance. If this level is scaled, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend toward $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing selling at the 20-day EMA ($4.95), indicating that the bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c97-717b-774d-923a-f0b4e4f5f820"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the $4.44 support, which remains the critical short-term level to watch out for. If this support gives way, the TON/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The TON/USDT pair could plummet to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the selling pressure is reducing. The bulls will gain strength after they push and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA ($5.24). That could open the doors for a rise to $6 and after that to $7.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-signs-shiba-inu-bull-market-sleeping-giant"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 signs Shiba Inu (SHIB) is this bull market's 'sleeping giant'}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) soared and closed above the $0.40 resistance on Nov. 7, indicating that the consolidation resolved in favor of the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c97-f5dc-7d69-9c51-4639fe00f264"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is minor resistance at $0.45, but if the bulls do not allow the price to slip below $0.40, the possibility of a break above the overhead resistance increases. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then surge to $0.49.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below $0.40. That will indicate aggressive selling at $0.45. The pair may slump to the moving averages, suggesting a large range formation between $0.31 and $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) reached the overhead resistance of $0.000020 on Nov. 6, but the bulls failed to clear the hurdle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c98-811d-78a7-895b-1d674c1413a2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. That improves the prospects of an upside breakout. A close above $0.000020 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverted H&S pattern, propelling the SHIB/USDT pair to $0.000026 and later to $0.000029.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to pull the price below the moving averages to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The pair may then slump to $0.000016, which is expected to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) closed above the 50-day SMA ($26.89) on Nov. 6, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930c99-1887-7cd9-bbc4-bb1d7b246587"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair is near the resistance line, where the bears are likely to step in. If the price turns down from the resistance line but rebounds off the moving averages, it will signal a positive sentiment. That will increase the likelihood of a break above the resistance line. The pair may rise to $33 and subsequently to $37.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzBjYTctNjIyMC03YWM5LWIzYzMtZmI0MGIyYmQzNDY1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241108ekb8000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 740 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token recovery begins buoyed by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s presidential election victory and 0.25% Fed rate cuts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price staged a solid rebound in the last four days, rising by over 33.7% to reach an intraday $0.436 on Nov. 8 as the market gathered strength following \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s win in the United States {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-elections"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2024 Presidential Election}}}\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price is up 17% over the last 24 hours, outperforming the rest of the market, and up 28% over the last seven days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930a6e-aa11-7722-a753-327ceaf07047"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/NTrZydBc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the factors driving the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price up today.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rises alongside Bitcoin, Ethereum\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment was not only exclusive to Cardano as crypto prices also rallied across the board, buoyed by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-presidential-victory-paves-way-100k-bitcoin-end-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory}}}\uc2  in the US presidential race.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, led the gains and has jumped 9.6% over the last week to set a new all-time high of $76,943 on Nov. 7, including 12.7% gains since Nov. 5. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-trader-turns-38k-30m-after-8-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rallied more than 3%}}}\uc2  over the last 24 hours to trade above $2,900.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930a73-2230-7633-9406-ec64f035c6be"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 24-hour performance of top-cap cryptocurrencies. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Other top-cap cryptocurrencies, including BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), have also posted significant gains over the last few days.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the total crypto market cap has increased by 2% over the last 24 hours and 14% over the last four days to rest at $2.57 trillion at the time of publication.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/019306f7-6431-7927-8cd0-07328c996288"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/AP/status/1854111190273642830"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Associated Press}}}\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s win is viewed as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the crypto market following his promise to foster a crypto-friendly business environment, boosting risk-on sentiment.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the political factors, the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s decision to reduce interest cuts by 0.25% on Nov. 7 has added tailwinds to the crypto market as the Fed cites easing labor market conditions and increasing confidence that inflation is moving sustainably toward the 2% target.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930a7c-8f03-7693-baa1-430d2d343694"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/KobeissiLetter/status/1854600385282908656"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Kobeissi Letter}}}\par \par \uc2 Lower rates generally boost market liquidity and support asset valuations, creating a risk-on environment where investors seek higher returns, including crypto.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees a spike in funding rates\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action on Nov. 8 is preceded by a jump in open interest-weighted funding rate. The chart below shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 8-hour OI-weighted funding rate has increased to 0.0159% on Nov. 7, the highest since June 2024.\par \par \uc2 This suggests a high appetite for long positions as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price gained around 17% over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930a82-1041-7d82-bad9-6126a79446ff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  OI-weighted funding rates. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rally on Nov. 8 was accompanied by short liquidations totaling $1.67 million against $247,484 in long liquidations, with that tally continuing at the time of publication.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930a84-93ee-773d-a1cd-0b3e447202cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  liquidations. Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 In other words, short traders were caught off-guard by \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rise to $0.438.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price more gains ahead\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s gains today are part of a technical rebound that started on Nov. 5. Notably, the latest rally has seen the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-to-understanding-the-layers-of-blockchain-technology"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 layer-1}}}\uc2  token break above its multimonth descending trendline resistance, as shown below.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has witnessed various failed attempts to rise above this resistance, the most recent being its 32%-plus gains between Sept. 6 and Sept. 27, which was capped by sellers at $0.42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930a88-b0f2-7997-b4c6-83e2fac0deab"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Trading, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 As a result of this technical setup, the next logical target for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bulls will be the April 22 range high of $0.52, a 19% uptick from the current price.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzA2ZWEtZDcwYy03ZjY2LWJlMDYtMWRlNjQ4NzFlNDVl.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241108ekb800001\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
