\par\par \b \uc2 Dogecoin Price Prediction: Crypto Traders Suggest DOGE Price To Hit $1 After U.S. Elections, Cardano And Cutoshi To Reach $1 First\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 875 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cutoshi\u8217\'20\'19s Meme Coin Appeal And DeFi Goals Set To Push Its Price To $1}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Could Dogecoin Price Repeat Its 15,000% Historic Rally?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Price Crashes: Can \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  Price Reach $1 In 2025}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Will Cutoshi Hit The $1 Mark Before Dogecoin?}}}\par \par \uc2 Often considered the original meme coin, Dogecoin is predicted to repeat its historic 15,000% rally. Its technical indicators remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , displaying a historical pattern that hints at 8,600% potential gains. Any additional momentum will push its value towards the $10. This positive sentiment is fueled by growing adoption and community support.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, other promising tokens like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cutoshi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cutoshi}}}\uc2  (CUTO) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) could also breach the $1 milestone in the same period. Cutoshi, in particular, is gaining traction due to its innovative features, potential for exponential growth, and discounted presale promotions like the spooky savings events. This has positioned the project as a strong contender to compete with the DOGE token in the next bull run.\par \par \uc2 Cutoshi\u8217\'20\'19s Meme Coin Appeal And DeFi Goals Set To Push Its Price To $1\par \par \uc2 Cutoshi is an emerging genre of meme projects aiming at redefining the meme coin market. Backed by its hybrid DeFi ecosystem, the project has significantly captured market attention in just its stage two presale, where the CUTO token is trading at $0.022. This reflects an over 46% surge from its starting price of $0.015.\par \par \uc2 The reason behind this success is the plans for the Cutoshi DEX, a decentralized multi-chain exchange that allows for easy asset swapping across different chains. Moreover, its soon-to-launch farming protocol will allow the Cutoshi community to enjoy an extra way of earning rewards by completing quests.\par \par \uc2 These features, coupled with the total supply capped at 440 million, could see Cutoshi witness significant demand, pushing its price to the $1 mark. With the second stage presale nearing completion with over 90% sold out, investors should anticipate further CUTO price rallies through its next presale stages.\par \par \uc2 Could Dogecoin Price Repeat Its 15,000% Historic Rally?\par \par \uc2 The price of Dogecoin has been signaling a familiar pattern from the 2021 price trajectory, sparking broader market speculation on whether history will repeat itself. During this period, the DOGE token rallied by 15,000%, drawing the market\u8217\'20\'19s attention. Despite Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s downturn, the token remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as traders prepare to ride the next bull market. Following its previous signal, Dogecoin noted a two-month logarithmic moving average convergence divergence that had crossed \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Dogecoin has formed a golden cross on its weekly. The last golden cross in 2023 pumped DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s price from $0.069 to $0.23, a 233% surge. If the same scenario were to repeat itself, the price of Dogecoin would reach $0.47. From Severino\u8217\'20\'19s observation, drawing calculations from these two previous surges, it would mark an 8,600% increase.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/u/Soldout_Vin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This would put the price of DOGE around the $10 mark, with a potential market capitalization of around $1.466 trillion. Moreover, the average of the two phases, the token took to spike 4,300% and 12,000% in 213 days. This indicates that its candlestick had begun to form when the breakout happened. Therefore, the 8,600% DOGE rally will likely occur in 213 days, ending April 2025.\par \par \uc2 Cardano Price Crashes: Can \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Price Reach $1 In 2025\par \par \uc2 While Cardano's price has been underperforming amid the current relief rally, its supporters remain hopeful that the network\u8217\'20\'19s upcoming developments will bolster its position. While the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is trading stably, it faces resistance around the $0.38 mark. The diagonal red line highlights a declining resistance over six months.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/u/TimHakki/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, in the last three months, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s price has recorded multiple peaks around the $0.36 mark. This indicates that the altcoin may form a new resistance, with the bulls fighting off this zone to reach the next leg. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s relative strength index has been rising and is currently around the 58 mark, indicating investors are buying the token.\par \par \uc2 This buying pressure could challenge the new resistance, but if unexpected headwinds should occur, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token has strong support around the $0.34 mark. A \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market trend and ground-breaking network development could successfully pump the price of Cardano near the $1 mark.\par \par \uc2 Will Cutoshi Hit The $1 Mark Before Dogecoin?\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price is looking to hit $1 with Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s presidential win, but analysts believe it could reach $10 if history repeats itself. Cutoshi, on the other hand, has seen an impressive presale, pushing its price closer to the $1 mark. If such momentum continues, Cutoshi could make better gains than Dogecoin in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 For more information on the Cutoshi (CUTO) Presale:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cutoshi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cutoshi.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Join and become a community member:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CutoshiToken"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/CutoshiToken}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/cutoshi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/cutoshi}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241108ekb70000d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
