he views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241108ekb70000h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/6: BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,875 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sideways price action resolved to the upside with a break above $75,000. Which altcoins will follow?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzAyMjMtZTFiOC03ZGYxLThkN2MtZjJiNDg3MzllNDRh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/6: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SHIB, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) hit a new all-time high of $75,407 on Nov. 6, eclipsing the previous high of $73,777 made on March 14. The rally was triggered after Donald Trump edged closer to winning the United States presidential election.\par \par \uc2 A Trump win is positive because the crypto industry hopes the incoming President will keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-election-us-crypto-industry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 promises made to the crypto community}}}\uc2  throughout the campaign trail. 10x Research head of research Markus Thielen {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-short-positions-liquidated-btc-all-time-high-75k-crypto-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Cointelegraph that Bitcoin could skyrocket to $100,000}}}\uc2  by Q1 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930218-dab1-7ce2-abc4-17bad838b490"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto rally is not limited to Bitcoin. Memecoins have been outperformers, signaling a risk on sentiment. The total meme market capitalization hit over $67.5 billion, nearing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/memecoins-outperform-crypto-market-trump-wins-us-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 1 high of $69.8 billion}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Although the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , whipsaws cannot be ruled out as bears try to halt the rally. What are the important support and resistance levels to watch out for on Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin soared to a new all-time high of $75,407 on Nov. 6, indicating that the bulls are trying to assert their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/01930219-73df-7fd6-aec4-3be0b645cadf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the positive territory indicate advantage to the bulls. If the price sustains above $73,777, it will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pattern target of the breakout from the range is $93,554.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to swiftly pull the BTC/USDT pair back below the 20-day exponential moving average ($68,808). If they do that, it will suggest that the breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) closed below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Nov. 4, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021a-07a9-77d2-847c-41a3f7cfbbe2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back into the triangle on Nov. 6. The ETH/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line and then to $2,850, where the bears are expected to sell aggressively. If buyers overcome this hurdle, the pair may rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the resistance line, it will signal that the pair may remain inside the triangle. The trend will favor the bears if they can pull the price below $2,300.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply from the 50-day simple moving average ($156) and rose above the 20-day EMA ($166) on Nov. 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021a-9588-7075-96e4-f8c364b50f3b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair has risen above the $183 resistance on Nov. 6, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls. There is minor resistance at $189, but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may retest the stiff overhead resistance of $210.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $210 and breaks below $189, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the large range. On the contrary, a break above $210 could open the doors for a rally to $260.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the uptrend line on Nov. 5, and the bulls are attempting to maintain the price above the moving averages on Nov. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021b-378e-7911-a71c-55ab2fab4443"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $612 and after that to $635. Buyers will find it difficult to overcome the barrier at $635, but if they can pull it off, the pair may start a new up move to $722.\par \par \uc2 The uptrend line is the critical support to watch out for on the downside. A break and close below the uptrend line will signal that the pair may continue to swing inside the large range between $460 and $635 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to maintain XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.50 support started a recovery, pushing the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.52).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021b-d267-7aee-8ce6-4d53b7b62e1d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to stall the relief rally at the 50-day SMA ($0.54), but if the buyers bulldoze their way through, the XRP/USDT pair could ascend to $0.64. Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense at the $0.64 level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bears are active at higher levels. The selling could accelerate if the pair skids below the $0.50 support.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) up move picked up momentum after breaking out of the $0.18 resistance on Nov. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021c-6cf8-72d0-bb02-c6e06b6401ac"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have not given up and are trying to halt the rally at $0.22, as seen from the long wick on the candlestick. However, if the DOGE/USDT pair does not give up much ground from the current level, the possibility of a break above $0.23 increases. If that happens, the pair may surge to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly drag the price below the breakout level of $0.18. The pair could then fall to the 20-day EMA ($0.15). Such a deep pullback may delay the next leg of the up move.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) again found support in the $4.44 to $4.72 range on Nov. 5, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021d-0e56-7b4c-88eb-48e76a03fcf6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to start a relief rally but are likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($4.94) and again at the 50-day SMA ($5.26). If the price turns down from the moving averages, the likelihood of a break below $4.44 increases. If that happens, the TON/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The next support on the downside is at $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close above the 50-day SMA will signal that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may rise to $6, which is expected to act as a minor resistance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside the $0.31 to $0.40 range for several days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021d-a815-71de-96ad-a3b2d095b4b6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the resistance of the range at $0.40. This level is likely to act as a solid resistance, but if the bulls prevail, the pair may rally to $0.45 and subsequently to $0.49.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level or $0.40, it will signal that the sellers are fiercely defending the overhead resistance. That could extend the stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 50-day SMA ($0.000017) on Nov. 3, but the bears could not capitalize on the advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021e-49f3-7c6d-8cee-250a345c516e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price to the overhead resistance of $0.000020 on Nov. 6. This is an essential level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it will complete an inverted H&S pattern. That could start a new up move to $0.000026 and thereafter to $0.000029.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the $0.000016 support. That will suggest the SHIB/USDT pair may remain inside the $0.000013 to $0.000020 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $22.35 on Nov. 5 and rose above the 20-day EMA ($25.59) on Nov. 6, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0193021e-e2e4-7c71-8dd4-aeda28281d55"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Market Capitalization, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Memecoin, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen into positive territory, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback. The AVAX/USDT pair could reach the resistance line, which is a crucial near-term level to watch out for. If buyers overcome this barrier, the pair could start a new up move to $33 and later to $37.50.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to regain the advantage, they will have to swiftly pull the price below $22.35. If they do that, the pair may plummet to $20.50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MzAyMjMtZTFiOC03ZGYxLThkN2MtZjJiNDg3MzllNDRh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241106ekb60008d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
