ome, the highly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Bernstein group maintains its $200,000 price target for Bitcoin by the end of 2025, indicating the \u8220\'20\'1Cgenie is out of the bottle\u8221\'20\'1D for this $1.4 trillion \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This anticipation highlights the potential for significant gains in the cryptocurrency market. As we navigate this landscape, exploring the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.qubetics.com/?utm_source=CryptoDaily&utm_medium=Bitcoin%27s+Path+Under+Harris+vs.+Trump+Find+The+Best+Cryptos+to+Earn+Passive+Income+In+November+2024&utm_campaign=CryptoDaily&utm_id=CryptoDaily"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Best Cryptos to Earn Passive Income In November 2024}}}\uc2  is crucial. Qubetics is at the forefront for its innovative ecosystem, followed by Bitcoin, Ethereum, Polkadot, and Cardano.\par \par \uc2 1. Qubetics: Enhancing the Ecosystem with dVPN Integration\par \par \uc2 The Qubetics Network is set to revolutionise the crypto landscape by integrating its decentralised virtual private network (dVPN) into its broader ecosystem. This addition strengthens the platform\u8217\'20\'19s value proposition, providing privacy-focused applications that support the fundamental ideals of Web3. The dVPN\u8217\'20\'19s secure, private connections protect users\u8217\'20\'19 activities, making it a foundational service for other decentralised platforms such as DeFi, NFTs, and decentralised storage solutions. By championing user privacy and secure interactions, Qubeticspromotes autonomy and the decentralised ethos central to blockchain technology.\par \par \uc2 Currently, Qubetics is in Presale Phase 7, with 1 $TICS token priced at $0.01932612. The project has raised over $1.6 million, attracting over 1,400 holders and selling 150 million $TICS tokens. A $300 investment at this stage would yield approximately 15,523.03 $TICS tokens. If the token price reached $10, that investment would soar to $155,230.33. A future value of $15 per token would bring the investment to an astounding $232,845.50. With its dVPN integration and potential for massive returns, Qubetics is a top pick among the Best Cryptos to Earn Passive Income In November 2024.\par \par \uc2 2. Bitcoin: The Pro-Crypto Candidate\u8217\'20\'19s Impact\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains the flagship of cryptocurrency and a primary asset for active and passive investors. According to Standard Chartered, the election outcome could significantly impact Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s trajectory, with pro-crypto Trump\u8217\'20\'19s potential victory expected to push prices to $125,000. Even with a Harris win, Bitcoin is predicted to reach $75,000, showing the robust market sentiment for this \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Beyond short-term gains, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term fundamentals are bolstered by the expected approval of spot Bitcoin ETFs, further enhancing its value proposition. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s network supports passive income generation through strategies such as Bitcoin lending, where holders can lend their assets for interest.\par \par \uc2 3. Ethereum: The King of Smart Contracts\par \par \uc2 Ethereum remains the go-to blockchain for decentralised applications, making it one of the best assets for earning passive income. Its robust ecosystem supports countless DeFi platforms that offer yield farming, staking, and liquidity provision, allowing investors to earn returns on their ETH holdings. The recent Ethereum upgrades have transitioned the network to a more energy-efficient proof-of-stake (PoS) mechanism, further strengthening its capabilities and sustainability. Investors interested in leveraging the potential of smart contracts and DeFi should consider Ethereum a staple in their portfolio.\par \par \uc2 4. Polkadot: Pioneering Blockchain Interoperability\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) is known for its unique multi-chain architecture, which enables different blockchains to communicate and operate seamlessly. This functionality is essential for creating a more connected and efficient decentralised ecosystem. Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s governance and staking mechanisms provide substantial opportunities for passive income, allowing token holders to earn rewards for participating in the network\u8217\'20\'19s security and decision-making processes. Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s parachain auctions have attracted diverse projects, enhancing its ecosystem and increasing the utility of the DOT token.\par \par \uc2 5. Cardano: The Sustainable Blockchain Platform\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is recognised for its systematic, research-driven approach to blockchain development. Cardano has carved out a significant place in the crypto world, focusing on sustainability, scalability, and security. The platform\u8217\'20\'19s proof-of-stake (PoS) consensus mechanism allows \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders to stake their coins, earning rewards while supporting network validation and security.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s continuous development and strong community support make it a reliable option for those looking to earn passive income through staking. With its commitment to evolving through peer-reviewed research and gradual updates, Cardano remains a key contender among the Best Cryptos to Earn Passive Income In November 2024.\par \par \uc2 What Crypto Has the Most Potential?\par \par \uc2 As the crypto market anticipates shifts influenced by the U.S. election and major developments like Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s potential price surge, savvy investors are looking for assets promising growth and passive income. While Bitcoin, Ethereum, Polkadot, and Cardano each offer distinct advantages and potential earnings, Qubetics stands out for its unique approach and the integration of dVPN technology that enhances its entire ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Currently in Presale Phase 7, investing in Qubetics could yield exceptional returns. A $300 investment could turn into over $155,000 if the $TICS token reaches $10 and an even higher amount if it climbs to $15. For those searching for the Best Cryptos to Earn Passive Income In November 2024, Qubetics is an unmissable opportunity. Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss out on this chance\u8212\'20\'14invest in Qubetics today and secure a place in the future of decentralised innovation.\par \par \uc2 For More Information:\par \par \uc2 Qubetics:{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://qubetics.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://qubetics.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/qubetics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/qubetics}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/qubetics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/qubetics}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241106ekb50000n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP price\par \b \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 803 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Will XRP price explode? Key technical setups suggest an \u8220\'20\'1Cexplosive rally\u8221\'20\'1D is coming.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNjJlNDdlMTgtYmFmMS00YzBiLWFkMDktZGRlZjY1NzYwN2Ew.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price has seen modest gains alongside the cryptocurrency market, up 1.5% in the past 24 hours to hit an intra-day high of $0.5184 on Nov. 5.\par \par \uc2 Accompanying XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price gains is high trading activity, which has also picked up over the last 24 hours. XRP\u8217\'20\'19s spot trading volumes topped $1.05 billion on Nov. 5, up 10% on the day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192fbf8-7edb-7534-a8fa-a71655c34184"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/oSBiW9rh/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Its market capitalization has also increased to $29.14 billion, cementing its position as the seventh-largest cryptocurrency in the world.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the factors driving the XRP price up today.\par \par \uc2 XRP price bolstered by \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Q3 report\par \par \uc2 XRPs \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance on Nov. 5 followed the release of \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s quarterly report highlighting significant developments for the remittance token, a growing institutional interest in XRP investment products, and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-cryptocurrency-surges-ripple-labs-sec-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 company\u8217\'20\'19s legal victory}}}\uc2  against the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-cryptocurrency-surges-ripple-labs-sec-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The SEC vs. Ripple lawsuit: Everything you need to know}}}\par \par \uc2 In a report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ripple.com/insights/q3-2024-xrp-markets-report/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 published}}}\uc2  on Nov. 1, the blockchain company said that despite regulatory challenges, the market has exhibited a positive trend in Q3/2024, fueled by factors such as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/markets-see-0-5-fed-rate-cut-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 0.5% Fed rate cut}}}\uc2  on Sept. 18, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-ethereum-etfs-surpass-1-billion-trading-volume-on-day-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch}}}\uc2  of US-based spot Ethereum ETFs, and increasing institutional adoption.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192fbf9-07c3-791a-8139-fb632e25f8f4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Ripple/status/1852429837241024925"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith the court\u8217\'20\'19s decision in the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s case against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  affirming that XRP is not, in and of itself, a security, XRP and BTC are still the only two tokens with regulatory clarity in the US,\u8221\'20\'1D the company emphasized, referring to its victory against the financial watchdog.\par \par \uc2 Since the ruling, US exchanges that had delisted XRP have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-crypto-exchanges-second-chance-xrp-listings-after-court-ruling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relisted}}}\uc2  it, contributing to growing investor confidence in the token. This is evidenced by applications by asset management firms such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/canary-capital-files-xrp-etf-bid-following-bitwise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitwise, Canary}}}\uc2 , and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-etf-21shares-sec-listing-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 21Shares}}}\uc2  to introduce XRP exchange-traded funds.\par \par \uc2 ETFs are a significant access point for institutional investors to gain exposure to digital assets, the report said, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey are an important maturation step in any market, including crypto, as they bring legitimacy and trust, which can attract more traditional financial players into the space, driving further adoption of cryptocurrencies. \u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Increasing onchain activity underpins XRP price\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance on Nov. 5 was preceded by higher network activity. \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s onchain activity rebounded from the dip in May and June, with the number of successful transactions doubling in the third quarter, data shared by \uc2 Ripple\uc2  shows.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) in automated market makers (AMMs) also grew significantly, doubling from $8.5 million to $16.2 million over the same time frame. New wallets interacting with the network saw a quarter-on-quarter increase of 11%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192fbf9-bca6-780c-99ff-7cd60ffc90ce"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets}}}\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  onchain metrics. Source: \uc2 Ripple\par \par \uc2 When network activity increases, it suggests greater demand for XRP tokens, which adds to the buying pressure on the market.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-4-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/4: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  chart pattern hints at \u8220\'20\'1Cmajor move\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Favorable price chart technicals are also helping XRP price as data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows it trading 76% higher than the $0.2870 low set during the 2022 bear cycle.\par \par \uc2 According to popular crypto analyst Steph Is Crypto, this price action has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  chart pattern on the weekly timeframe, forecasting a massive breakout for XRP in the near term.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CXRP has officially entered Phase D of the Wyckoff Accumulation!\u8221\'20\'1D Steph Is Crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Steph_iscrypto/status/1853519836002779626"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in a Nov. 4 post on X.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is where things get serious\u8212\'20\'14price action is gearing up for a major move.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192fbfa-8948-749b-ab35-3d8ff10e5446"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Steph_iscrypto/status/1853519836002779626"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Steph Is Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP holders have been eagerly waiting for the altcoin to start moving higher after failing to break above $1 following the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP is not a security}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D ruling in July 2023.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, fellow market analyst and YouTuber Levi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/LeviRietveld/status/1853730481516245436"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 observed}}}\uc2  that XRPs Bollinger Bands have narrowed, suggesting that an \u8220\'20\'1Cexplosive\u8221\'20\'1D price movement is on the horizon.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHistorically, such patterns have often resulted in explosive rallies. The next breakout for #XRP could be substantial!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192fbfb-0d06-7d9a-858e-1b01f7f91129"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Ripple, SEC, XRP, Markets}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/LeviRietveld/status/1853730481516245436"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Levi}}}\par \par \uc2 Steph Is Crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Steph_iscrypto/status/1853701489161654571"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  that XRP price has historically surged during past {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/live-countdown-us-elections-2024-crypto-industry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US Election}}}\uc2  cycles, rallying 40,337% in 2017 and 566% in 2020.\par \par \uc2 If history repeats itself, XRP could experience another explosive growth going into 2025.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNjJlNDdlMTgtYmFmMS00YzBiLWFkMDktZGRlZjY1NzYwN2Ew.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241105ekb50005q\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/4: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,879 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is expected to swing sharply this week as the bulls and the bears attempt to assert their supremacy following the US elections.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MmY3ZjgtMWNiOS03ZjQ4LTlhYTQtZTNkNmRmYWI2Mjk5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/4: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Data hints that there is a strong possibility that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) may create a new all-time high this week. The United States Presidential elections and the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s interest rate decision are two events that are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-move-10-depending-us-election-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expected to boost \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Pseudonymous trader Daan Crypto Trades said in a post on X that Bitcoin will see \u8220\'20\'1Cat least a 10% move in either direction depending on who wins the election.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Investors have maintained a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance going into the elections. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly Report shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/election-euphoria-2-2-billion-inflows-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors pumped $2.2 billion into digital investment products}}}\uc2  last week, with Bitcoin garnering the lion\u8217\'20\'19s share of the inflows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7f7-fea7-7a6b-af00-0422485f2b5b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, not everyone is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the short term. Trading firm QCP Capital cautioned its Telegram channel subscribers that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-election-fed-rate-cut-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could face a sell-off after the elections}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1Creplicating the Nashville Bitcoin conference.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin start a relief rally? Will altcoins follow? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) fell below the 20-day exponential moving average (5,778) on Oct. 31, indicating a weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7f8-c3ea-7abd-9783-c39aa46fc636"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 50-day simple moving average (5,703) on Oct. 31 but failed to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on Nov. 1. Sellers will try to sink the index below the 5,670 support. If they do that, the selling could pick up, and the index may dive to 5,400.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or 5,670 and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will signal buying on dips. The index could then climb to the all-time high of 5,879.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) rebounded off the 20-day EMA (103.56) on Nov. 1, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7f9-5e81-7c4f-9492-2a43d58a13cf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Solid selling by the bears has pulled the price to the 20-day EMA on Nov. 4. If the 20-day EMA cracks, the selling could pick up, and the index could drop to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of 102.92.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the index turns up from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are buying the dips. The bulls will then make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at 104.80.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the dip below the 20-day EMA ($68,259) on Nov. 3 but are struggling to build upon the bounce.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7fa-880c-7ce1-8127-aea791282cb5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could plunge to the crucial support at $65,000. This is an important support for the bulls to defend if they want to keep the positive sentiment intact.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the 20-day EMA and breaks above $70,000, it will tilt the advantage in favor of the buyers. The pair could rise to $72,000 and eventually to $73,777. Sellers are expected to vigorously defend the $72,000 to $73,777 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is trying to maintain above the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern, but the bears continue to exert pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7fb-668f-719b-9813-839ffff0bf44"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the support line will signal that the sellers have overpowered the buyers. That could start a downward move to $2,310 and then to $2,200. Buyers will try to defend the $2,200 to $2,111 zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated in the short term if the price rises from the support line and breaks above the moving averages. The ETH/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to the resistance line. A trend change will be signaled after buyers overcome the barrier at $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the large range between $460 and $635, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7fc-067b-78b2-b9bb-0118f80b4f6d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could fall to $527, which is a crucial near-term support to keep an eye on. If the price rebounds off $527 and rises above the moving averages, it will signal that the bulls are trying to keep the pair in the upper half of the range. The pair may consolidate between $527 and $612 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $527, it will suggest that the bears are in command. The pair may sink to the vital support at $460.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the breakout level of $164 on Nov. 3, indicating that the markets have rejected the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7fc-ba02-7011-9961-afea9065cbb9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive for the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to sink to the 50-day SMA ($154). Buyers will try to push the price back above $164. If they succeed, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to the $183 to $189 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($165), it will suggest that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand. The pair could descend to the 50-day SMA and then to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $0.50 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7fd-7f8e-7da3-9b6a-53ae2c5552da"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.52) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers. If the XRP/USDT pair turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a drop to $0.46 increases. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $0.46 to $0.41 zone.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength on the upside will be a break and close above the 50-day SMA ($0.55). That will clear the path for a potential rally to $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is trying to find support at the 20-day EMA ($0.15), indicating demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7fe-481f-7eb0-8648-cf0fb53a6b97"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to the overhead resistance at $0.18. This level is likely to act as a barrier, but if the bulls prevail, the DOGE/USDT pair could start the next leg of the up move toward $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair could plummet to the 50-day SMA ($0.13), which is likely to act as a solid support.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) is finding support in the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone, but a negative sign is that the bulls have failed to push the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7fe-e5ba-74c5-9afc-99e5f446f26c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Repeated retest of a support level tends to weaken it. If the support zone gives way, the TON/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, which could start a decline to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the bulls push and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA ($5.30). The pair could then rise to $6 and subsequently to $7.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($0.35) on Nov. 2, indicating that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f7ff-9df3-7743-acdb-24b0e3a8a196"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Interest Rate, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the support of the range at $0.31, where the buyers are expected to step in. If the price rebounds off $0.31 and rises above the moving averages, it will signal that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.31, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could decline to $0.27, which is an important support to watch out for. If this level gives way, the pair may drop to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MmY3ZjgtMWNiOS03ZjQ4LTlhYTQtZTNkNmRmYWI2Mjk5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241104ekb4000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 642 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token continues to fall as activity on the network and the altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s trading volume remain in a downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is showing weakness as it\u8217\'20\'19s heading for the third day of losses in a row on Nov. 4.\par \par \uc2 Why is Cardano price down?\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*13dnpkr*_ga*MTAxMzE3MDgyMS4xNzA2Nzk5MzMw*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxMjc3MjU3OC4yNjMuMS4xNzEyNzczNzk2LjAuMC4w"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  reveals that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price fell from a high of $0.363 on Nov. 2, dropping as much as 9.6% to a low of $0.328 on Nov. 3.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price is down 2.7% over the last 24 hours to trade at $0.332 at the time of publication.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f656-dcf8-75ad-9a6b-fe6ec0ed8693"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/tdrlkQ3k/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look closer at the factors driving \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price down today.\par \par \uc2 Weakening onchain Cardano metrics\par \par \uc2 Data from \uc2 Artemis\uc2  reveals that the drop in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price coincides with a drop in investors\u8217\'20\'19 interest and liquidity in Cardano.\par \par \uc2 Artemis Terminal data shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s daily DEK trading volume fell from $4.2 million on Oct. 31 to $1.83 million on Nov. 3, the lowest level since mid-October.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f657-c001-736e-84e0-43346259c636"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 DEX trading volume on Cardano. Source: \uc2 Artemis\par \par \uc2 Daily trading volume was reduced by 51% from approximately $545 million to $361 million over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Additional data from DefiLlama suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  network has decreased from $248.6 million on Sept. 28 to $208.5 million on Nov. 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f658-a170-702e-ac0c-af3ab79e79ea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano total value locked, USD. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 The decline in daily trading volume, DEX volume and TVL coincides with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 7% \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the last 30 days, suggesting overall less activity and trader interest in Cardano.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price technicals remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 From a technical point of view, the ongoing correction in the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is part of a corrective cycle that started in mid-March after the token hit a two-year high of $0.81.\par \par \uc2 Traders booked profits as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relative strength index}}}\uc2  (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) on the daily chart became overbought after crossing 70.\par \par \uc2 An \uc2 RSI\uc2  reading above 70 means the asset is becoming \u8220\'20\'1Coverbought\u8221\'20\'1D and may undergo trend reversal or corrective pullback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f662-b905-7bcb-b372-903c1eac6b09"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/5Iljxwzn/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On longer timeframes, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains in a downtrend inside a descending parallel channel on the weekly candle chart. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is positioned at 41, suggesting that the market conditions still favor the downside.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price faces uphill battle\par \par \uc2 The recent retracement in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price showed signs of further weakness after rejection from the descending channel\u8217\'20\'19s upper boundary at $0.34\u8212\'20\'14 confirming a stiff barrier around this level.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to flip this level to support, then \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s likelihood of continuing its prevailing downtrend will be much higher.\par \par \uc2 This negative outlook is corroborated by the Money Around Price (IOMAP) model, showing that the channel\u8217\'20\'19s upper boundary at $0.34 sat within the $0.49 to $0.358 price range, where approximately 2.78 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  were bought by roughly 153,3700 addresses.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192f65c-1b08-7777-a26c-9cd298d5dec9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano IOMAP chart. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 In other words, this resistance was robust enough to absorb the buying pressure attempting to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price higher. Therefore, it is crucial for the Cardano Bulls to flip this zone into support to avoid further losses.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241104ekb40005r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
