\par\par \b \uc2 Analyst Calls for Calm in the Cardano Camp: Solana Loses $180 Support, But Lunex Network Shines, Surpassing $1.6 Million\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 737 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Boring Phase Ends Here, Says Gambardello}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Faces Resistance, Price Drops}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lunex Network (LNEX) Rises By 60%, Closes in on 18% Price Pump}}}\par \par \uc2 A top analyst, Dan Gambardello, has advised the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) community to remain optimistic despite the cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s poor price movement in the past month. Gambardelloshared some technical indicators that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  community should watch for \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals in the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, one of the top altcoins that have raked in a lot of gains, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), has hit a roadblock. \uc2 SOL\uc2  has plunged to the $170 level after facing tough resistance on its way to $200. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://lunexnetwork.com/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=EN&utm_campaign=w27&utm_content=02nov&utm_term=adasol"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lunex Network (LNEX)}}}\uc2  has raised over $1.63 million in funding and could hit $2 million in November.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Boring Phase Ends Here, Says Gambardello\par \par \uc2 Dan Gambardello suggests that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) may be on the verge of a major breakout. He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/cryptorecruitr/status/1851454790225539344"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  the community to remain calm and that the Cardano \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is currently in a consolidation phase and matches historical patterns.\par \par \uc2 Gambardello said the community should look for higher highs in the \uc2 RSI\uc2  while also looking for a buy signal from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSD/technicals/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MACD}}}\uc2 . He also noted that although the Cardano coin has been negative for a long time, it ends here.\par \par \uc2 His analysis suggests that there might be a change of events in November. The Cardano crypto is still hovering around the $0.3 mark and is up by 5.0% on the weekly chart, as per {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2  data. The position of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the 14-day RSI has increased to 50, which can be considered as the beginning of the upward movement.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Faces Resistance, Price Drops\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has suffered a setback on the road to $200. The cryptocurrency rose from a low of about $162 to a peak of $182 on the weekly chart on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 . While many expected a price rally to $200, the \uc2 Solana\uc2  coin could not surpass the resistance at the $180 level.\par \par \uc2 For now, the \uc2 Solana\uc2  crypto is still consolidating around the $170 mark. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSD/technicals/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 14-day RSI}}}\uc2  of \uc2 SOL\uc2  hints that the uptrend could also extend into November. Therefore, the altcoin price may see another retest of the $180 level in the weeks to come.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the latest \uc2 Solana\b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after Canary Capital filed for a SOL ETF. Analysts believe the increasing demand for this crypto product could push the value of Solana (SOL) to $250 in the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 Lunex Network (LNEX) Rises By 60%, Closes in on 18% Price Pump\par \par \uc2 Lunex Network (LNEX) has stood out as a top \uc2 ICO\uc2  in the market in the last few months. For those who bought during the first stage, the value of their portfolio has surged by 60%. Smart investors are already in the presale at stage five and purchasing LNEX at $0.0019.\par \par \uc2 Market watchers say the price of the coin may increase by 1,800% by Q1 2025. However, buyers have nothing to fear. The team tokens will be locked for 24 months to stop dumping after launch. Furthermore, to prevent rug pulls, the project\u8217\'20\'19s liquidity pool will also be locked for the same period.\par \par \uc2 Lunex Network is a non-custodial digital currency trading platform quickly growing in popularity. One of its primary purposes is to let users exchange and trade cryptocurrencies with or without the cost and across multiple chains such as ETH, BNB, etc.\par \par \uc2 In addition to this, the platform has a portfolio tracker. Traders can use this tool to monitor their assets and their price performances. Furthermore, those who have the LNEX coin are entitled to benefits like discounts, rewards, passive income from staking, and lots more.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 While Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) supporters are waiting for a breakout, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) could drop to former levels if the downtrend continues. Meanwhile, analysts have tagged Lunex Network as a good crypto to buy based on its unique features and offerings.\par \par \uc2 You can find 