\par\par \b \uc2 Stay Stuck With Cardano at $0.35 or Switch to Memecoins Like SHIB? Expert Recommends This Viral Altcoin With 12,000% Upside\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 757 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 November 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Rocky Road: Investors Stuck at $0.35}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu's New NFT Bridge: A Game Changer?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AI, Dual-Chain, and 1,000x Leverage \u8211\'20\'13 How INTL Is Redefining Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 With Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) stuck in the $0.35 mark, some investors are exploring options with higher upside potential, especially with the rise of meme coins like Shiba Inu (SHIB) and the new viral contender, IntelMarkets (INTL). Investors are now asking: is it time to switch from traditional blockchain projects to high-reward altcoins?\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Rocky Road: Investors Stuck at $0.35\par \par \uc2 Cardano's (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) latest price movement follows a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, with the cryptocurrency rejecting its rising trendline resistance. Last week, this trendline\u8212\'20\'14which was derived from many lows since August\u8212\'20\'14was breached suggesting that the market may be about to change course.\par \par \uc2 Unfortunately, the price went back to the current level of $0.33 over the weekend after Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) tried retesting this trendline and failed. Currently, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades in between $0.346 and $0.367. The coin has seen a decline of 6.49 percent following a drop of 26.70% in six months. This steady decline indicates that there is selling pressure on the coin.\par \par \uc2 However, the technical indicators are conflicting. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is close to oversold territory at 39.98. Additionally, the stochastic is at 31.11, which may indicate overselling. With a negative MACD of -0.003217, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is evident.\par \par \uc2 At this point, investors are tired of being stuck at the long-lasting price mark of $0.35. It is most probable if the ongoing trend doesn\u8217\'20\'19t change, investors will move out to better options.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu's New NFT Bridge: A Game Changer?\par \par \uc2 Recently, the SHIB development team has released an NFT bridge on its Layer-2 blockchain called Shibarium aiming to improve the ability of the platform functioning of NFTs based on Ethereum. This launch has also sparked speculation of a SHIB price surge as Shibarium adoption increases.\par \par \uc2 This new feature enables individuals to link their Web3 wallets, such as MetaMask or TrustWallet, to deposit and withdraw Ethereum network NFTs. The NFT bridge on Shibarium also simplifies accessibility and may put Shiba Inu's ecosystem in a position to draw in more people.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu's market performance has shown encouraging momentum since the debut of the NFT bridge. Currently, the Shiba Inu is trading at $0.00001857 following an 8.18% rise over the past 3 days. This is aligned with the recent boom of the cryptocurrency industry with the recent break above $71,000 by Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 According to CNF, experts are feeling optimistic about SHIB's growing price trend. It is anticipated that the NFT bridge functionality would increase liquidity within the Shiba Inu ecosystem, hence increasing the token's appeal.\par \par \uc2 AI, Dual-Chain, and 1,000x Leverage \u821