ldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/rexasfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/rexasfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241102ekb100012\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,752 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 November 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $70,000 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MmU4YTAtOWM5Yi03ODQ5LTk3OWEtMjJjMzVkZGJiNjg4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) fell below $69,000 on Nov. 1, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. Solid buying by the bulls has pushed the price back above the $70,000 level, indicating a positive sentiment.\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin nears its all-time high of $73,777, sellers are likely to step in. According to Glassnode data, short-term holders, entities holding Bitcoin for up to 155 days, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-speculators-3-7-b-exchanges-btc-price-loses-70k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent 54,352 Bitcoin to the cryptocurrency exchanges}}}\uc2  on Oct. 31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e89b-ea68-7321-bff8-c2571a08e3fc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Even as traders speculate about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s near-term price action, long-term investors are finding ways to add more Bitcoin to their portfolios. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  revealed plans to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-42b-capital-bitcoin-purchase-michael-saylor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raise $21 billion in equity and $21 billion}}}\uc2  in fixed-income securities over the next three years to buy more Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin overcome the selling pressure and rise to a new all-time high? Will altcoins also follow Bitcoin higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin slipped below the $72,000 support on Oct. 31 and reached the 20-day exponential moving average ($68,132) on Nov. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e89c-a6c1-7b3e-bdde-584ad0116eba"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying near the 20-day EMA. Buyers tried to push the price back above $72,000, but the bears held their ground. The BTC/USDT pair has formed a Doji candlestick pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If buyers overcome the $72,000 obstacle, the pair may challenge the all-time high at $73,777. A break and close above this level could signal the start of the next leg of the up move. The pair may rally toward the pattern target of $93,554.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The pair may then tumble to the 50-day simple moving average ($64,674).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 30 and fell below the 50-day SMA ($2,523) on Nov. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e89d-5a99-70d8-b8af-366a25c8faa1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair is taking support near the uptrend line. If the price rises above the 20-day EMA ($2,558), the pair could rally to the resistance line. Buyers will have to overcome the barrier at $2,850 to indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, sellers will have to drag the price below the uptrend line to signal strength. The pair could then fall to the support line. The bulls are expected to fiercely defend the $2,111 to $2,200 zone.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 50-day SMA ($579) on Oct. 31, but the bears could not build upon their advantage on Nov. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e89d-f526-7341-be46-4d6ebddda3fe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA and are trying to clear the 20-day EMA ($587). If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $612 and eventually to the vital resistance of $635. A break and close above $635 will signal the start of a new up move to $722.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA. That will increase the possibility of a break below $566. The pair could slide to $550 and later to the solid support at $527.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) successfully held the retest of the breakout level of $164 on Nov. 1, indicating that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e89e-a0e0-7b77-8169-cf7f770dfc48"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price above the near-term resistance of $183. If they do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $189. Sellers will try to halt the up move at $189, but if the bulls prevail, the pair may reach $210.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $164, it will suggest that the bulls are rushing to the exit. The pair could descend to the 50-day SMA ($152) and subsequently to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade below the 20-day EMA ($0.53), but the bears have failed to tug the price to the $0.46 support. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e89f-4a9a-74a4-a609-b78eaab12de8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will again try to thrust the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, it will suggest the start of a relief rally toward the overhead resistance of $0.64. The bears are expected to vigorously defend the $0.64 level.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the XRP/USDT pair once again turns down sharply from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears remain in control. That will increase the likelihood of a drop to the $0.46 to $0.41 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) failure to cross above the $0.18 level attracted profit-booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e89f-e570-70ba-b060-ab6dff8f9dbe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to skid below the breakout level of $0.15. The strong rebound off $0.15 suggests that the bulls have flipped the level into support. Buyers will make another attempt to drive the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.18. If that happens, the pair may climb to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.14). The next support on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($0.12).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($5.08) on Oct. 29 and dropped to the $4.44 to $4.72 support zone on Oct. 31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e8a0-93a4-7b1e-a549-5f09276bdaf5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to defend the support zone with all their might because if they fail to do that, the TON/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair could then slump to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will again attempt to drive the pair above the moving averages. If they succeed, the pair could climb to $6.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-levels-us-jobs-shock-btc-price-past-71k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders eye key levels as US jobs shock sends BTC price past $71K}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers could not push and maintain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages, indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e8a1-48be-7734-82c3-fb7359a5fa2c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  just above the midpoint signal a possible range-bound action in the near term. If buyers push the price above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could attempt a rally to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price again turns down from the moving averages, sellers will try to sink the pair to $0.31. The next trending move is expected to begin on a break above $0.40 or close below $0.31.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) fell below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 31, indicating advantage to sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e8a2-7dba-7443-9432-2cbed9002db3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the $24 support. If they manage to do that, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could start a downward move to $22.79 and later to $20.50.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair could then reach the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $0.000020 overhead resistance on Oct. 30, indicating that bears remain active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-11/0192e8a3-1867-71ab-ab10-dd2d898d5df5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, MicroStrategy}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA ($0.000017) is the crucial support to watch out for in the near term. If the price skids below the 50-day SMA, the SHIB/USDT pair is expected to extend its stay inside the $0.000013 to $0.000020 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers build upon the rebound off the 50-day SMA, the pair will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. A close above $0.000020 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverted H&S pattern, opening the gates for a rise to $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTEvMDE5MmU4YTAtOWM5Yi03ODQ5LTk3OWEtMjJjMzVkZGJiNjg4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241101ekb1000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
