\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 10-30 BITCOIN: BTC, ETHEREUM: ETH, SOLANA: SOL, DOGECOIN: DOGE, RIPPLE: XRP, INTERNET COMPUTER: ICP, CELESTIA: TIA\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,678 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 October 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Soars As Markets Prepare For All-Time High}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Markets Turn \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 South Korean Crypto-Related Stocks Soar}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Celestia (TIA) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) soared past $73,000 earlier today as it rose to $73,544, reaching levels last seen when it posted its all-time high over eight months ago amid growing optimism in the markets, a potential Republican victory in the upcoming US elections, and positive technical indicators. Analysts believe BTC is poised to post a new all-time high as early as this week if current positive trends persist.\par \par \uc2 Several other altcoins have also increased substantially over the past 24 hours. These include Ethereum (ETH), Dogecoin (DOGE), Tron (TRX), Toncoin (TON), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Aptos (APT), Uniswap (UNI), and several others. The crypto market cap also registered a noticeable jump, rising by 1.34% to $2.43 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Speaking about market developments, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://changenow.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ChangeNOW}}}\uc2  CMO Pauline Shangett stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith Bitcoin breaking key resistance levels, the market appears primed for potential new highs, especially with a favorable technical and political backdrop. However, it\u8217\'20\'19s crucial to watch how the market responds to any sudden shifts in sentiment\u8212\'20\'14particularly as BTC approaches psychological levels that have triggered corrections in the past.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Soars As Markets Prepare For All-Time High\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/crypto-price-analysis-10-29-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-eth-solana-sol-dogwifhat-wif-chainlink-link-aptos-apt-fantom-ftm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  surged past $73,000 earlier today before declining and slipping below $72,500. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recent price action has prompted crypto analysts to predict that the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency could post a new all-time high as early as this week if current trends continue. James Butterfill, the head of research at \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 , stated current price trends are being influenced by US politics and the presidential elections.\par \par \uc2 Popular crypto analyst Michael van de Poppe has stated that BTC could set a new all-time high as early as this week. The last time BTC hit similar levels was in March 2024, when it peaked at $73,750.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C#Bitcoin is correcting in the first week of October. It's relatively standard, as it's unemployment week. We expect to reverse from next week, through which dips are for buying!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Others such as CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju, believe BTC is witnessing an uptick in institutional demand, pointing to spot Bitcoin ETFs, which have registered a net inflow of 278,000 BTC since their launch in January. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price has been boosted by growing speculation that Donald Trump will emerge victorious in the upcoming US elections, with several online prediction markets favoring a Trump victory. Trump has promised crypto-friendly \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , making him quite popular among crypto enthusiasts. However, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  has also pledged to support a clear regulatory framework for crypto, with many predicting crypto will benefit regardless of the outcome.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Markets Turn \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Almost all major cryptocurrencies are trading in positive territory over the past 24 hours as BTC pushed above $73,000 and the global crypto market cap surged to $2.45 trillion. While BTC is trading just below $72,500 at the time of writing, analysts believe Bitcoin bulls could drive the price to a new all-time high. \uc2 VanEck\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s head of digital assets, Matthew Sigel, stated that the current market is very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for BTC for several political and macroeconomic factors. If BTC does reach a new all-time high, some analysts predict a marginal decline in the short term as investors book profits. However, almost all analysts agree that markets will remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the coming months.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment has also propelled Ethereum (ETH) above $2,600 and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) past $180. Popular meme coins, including Dogecoin (DOGE) and Dogwifhat (WIF), have also reported substantial increases.\par \par \uc2 South Korean Crypto-Related Stocks Soar\par \par \uc2 South Korean crypto stocks surged as BTC pushed above $73,000, with investors confident of the cryptocurrency reaching a new all-time high. These stocks include Woori Technology and \uc2 Hanwha Investment & Securities\uc2 , both of which have shares in Dunamu, the operator of Upbit. Woori Technology reported an increase of over 14% in its share price, while Hanwha Investment and Securities ended the day up by 7.53%.\par \par \uc2 Woori Technology is an investment firm, with interests in several Fintech and blockchain-related startups. Meanwhile, Hanwha Investment and Securities is an affiliate of the \uc2 Hanwha Group\uc2 , one of South Korea\u8217\'20\'19s biggest conglomerates.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/BTC-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  surged past $73,000 and hit a peak of $73,512, hitting levels last seen when it set its all-time high in March 2024, buoyed by macroeconomic and political factors. Bitcoin whales have also gotten in on the action, and have scooped up large volumes of BTC on Binance. Market sentiment was further boosted by a golden cross between the 50-day SMA and the 200-day SMA. A golden cross forms when an asset\u8217\'20\'19s short-term moving average exceeds the long-term moving average, typically occurring before a significant price jump. BTC had been trading between $55,000 and $65,000 since March.\par \par \uc2 Stephen Wundke, the Director of Strategy & Revenue at quantitative \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment firm Algoz, predicted BTC could hit $75,000 by the US elections before witnessing a marginal decline and then rallying to $85,000-$90,000 by Christmas.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAlways remember, there are only 21 million and only 12% of the world has a digital wallet currently. There aren't enough BTC coins to go around.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Looking at the price chart, we see BTC made a strong recovery over the weekend despite registering a substantial decline towards the end of the previous week. BTC dropped to a low of $65,234 on Wednesday before recovering and moving to $68,167 on Thursday after an increase of 2.28%. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Friday as BTC dropped by almost 2%, plummeting to a low of $65,660 before climbing back above $66,000 and settling at $66,816.\par \par \uc2 Market sentiment began changing over the weekend and BTC registered a marginal increase on Saturday, rising by 0.51% and moving to $67,154. The price continued to push higher on Sunday, rising by 1.22% and settling at $67,972. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment picked up on Monday as BTC pushed above $69,000, rising by 2.63% and settling at $69,761, with \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment increasing thanks to a golden cross on the price chart.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/yj8JJOCr/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 With \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  building, BTC surged past $70,000 on Tuesday, rising to $73,512 and coming within touching distance of setting a new all-time high. However, the price declined marginally after pushing above $73,000, dropping to $72,627, increasing just over 4%. The current session sees BTC marginally down as the price sees a marginal correction due to the RSI being in the overbought zone and investors booking profits. However, bulls remain in control, and analysts are confident BTC could set a new all-time high following the US elections, potentially climbing above $75,000. The MACD is also \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , pointing to growing investor confidence.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/ETH-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  has hit a turning point after enduring a difficult month, as it made a strong recovery after dropping to a low of $2,386 towards the end of last week. Exchanges also reported $750 million in ETH withdrawals and a surge in trading volume, as it attracted renewed attention from investors. Data from CryptoQuant has revealed that ETH reserves have declined significantly, with over $4 billion removed, $750 million of which was in the past week. Analysts believe the biggest driver of the sudden investor interest is Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s renewed focus on scalability, with co-founder \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2  unveiling a planned upgrade to improve scalability, streamline data storage, and reduce protocol complexity. Ethereum is also planning to implement another upgrade that allows nodes to run on everyday devices.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at ETH\u8217\'20\'19s price chart. ETH registered a substantial drop on Wednesday to slip below the 20-day SMA. Buyers attempted a recovery on Thursday but were unsuccessful. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Friday as ETH dropped by almost 4%, going below the 50-day SMA and settling at $2,438, but not before hitting an intra-day low of $2,386. The price recovered over the weekend, rising by 1.71% on Saturday and moving to $2,480. ETH continued to push higher on Sunday, pushing above $2,500 and settling at $2,505 after an increase of 1.04%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/NxdyF7w0/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment picked up on Monday as ETH pushed above the 20 and 50-day SMAs after an increase of 2.43% and settled at $2,566. The price reclaimed $2,600 on Tuesday rising by almost 3% and settling at $2,637. Buyers also attempted to push above $2,700 on Tuesday but were unsuccessful, reaching a day high of $2,680 before losing momentum. The current session sees ETH up by 0.76% as buyers look to push above $2,700. However, sellers are attempting to take control and drive the price back below $2,600.\par \par \uc2 So, can ETH\u8217\'20\'19s latest rally last? Several technical indicators hint at an impending breakout from a multi-month downward trend. Despite registering a significant increase over the past few days, the \uc2 RSI\uc2  remains well below the overbought zone, indicating ETH has plenty of room to continue its upward trajectory before a correction. The MACD has also flipped to \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , indicating bulls are gaining the upper hand. Should ETH break above $2,700, it could push to the crucial $2,850 level by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) briefly pushed above $180 on Tuesday as markets surged. However, it could not stay above this level and fell back after hitting an intra-day high of $183. As we can see in the price chart, \uc2 SOL\uc2  was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week, climbing to an intra-day high of $170 on Thursday. However, it couldn't push higher and registered a substantial drop of almost 7% on Friday, dropping to a low of $159 before settling at $164. Sellers attempted to drag \uc2 SOL\uc2  lower on Saturday but could not do so as buyers countered the selling pressure. As a result, \uc2 SOL\uc2  registered an increase of 3.60% and settled at $170. Buyers continued to push \uc2 SOL\uc2  higher on Sunday, registering an increase of 3.42% and settling at $176 to end the weekend positively.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/1YLA0dg0/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  saw considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday as sellers attempted to drag the price below $170. However, with demand picking up at lower levels, \uc2 SOL\uc2  recovered and registered an increase of 0.96% to settle at $178. Buyers attempted to push above $180 on Tuesday as \uc2 SOL\uc2  rose to an intra-day high of $183. However, it lost momentum as selling pressure overwhelmed buyers and slipped below $180, eventually registering only a marginal increase and settling at $179. The current session sees \uc2 SOL\uc2  marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish control.\par \par \uc2 If buyers regain control, we could see \uc2 SOL\uc2  make another attempt to push above $180. On the other hand, if sellers retain control, \uc2 SOL\uc2  could drop to $170.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/DOGE-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  is back in the red during the ongoing session after a stunning rally that saw it break above $0.150, a level it previously struggled to overcome. DOGE faced considerable selling pressure last week as it dropped to a low of $0.127 on Friday, slipping below a key support level. However, it rebounded on Saturday, registering an increase of 3.64% and moving to $0.136. Buyers continued to control the market on Sunday, pushing DOGE up by over 5% to $0.144 to end the weekend on a positive note.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/kS2HKc3x/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Monday as the broader crypto markets turned positive. As a result, DOGE surged by almost 12%, going past the resistance at $0.150 and settling at $0.160. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Tuesday as DOGE raced to an intra-day high of $0.179 before settling at $0.175, posting an increase of 9.32%. However, the popular meme coin finds itself in the red during the ongoing session as sellers look to push it back below $0.170.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/finance/quote/XRP-USD?hl=en"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s recovery has stalled after it failed to push above the 20-day SMA, losing momentum and falling into the red during the ongoing session. XRP made a strong recovery over the weekend despite plummeting to a low of $0.48 on Friday before settling at $0.50 after a drop of almost 6%. However, the price recovered over the weekend, rising by 2.35% on Saturday and 0.58% on Sunday to end the weekend on a positive note at $0.51.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6XcGJDp0/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers attempted to drag XRP below $0.50 on Monday as it faced a substantial increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, buyers prevented a decline and XRP registered a rise of 0.46%. Buying activity picked up on Tuesday as XRP registered an increase of 1.72% and settled at $0.52. Despite a relatively strong recovery over the weekend, XRP finds itself back in the red, unable to push above the 20 and 200-day SMAs, with the price down almost 1%.\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) is looking to push above the 50-day SMA and $8.50 as it recovers after dropping almost 7% on Friday. Friday\u8217\'20\'19s drop came after ICP failed to move above the 50-day SMA on Thursday. As a result, sellers took over on Friday, driving the price below the 20-day SMA to $7.70. ICP also hit a day low of $7.43 but recovered thanks to strong lower-level demand. Despite considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Saturday, ICP registered a marginal increase and moved to $7.72. Buyers retained control on Sunday, pushing ICP up by almost 1% to $7.79.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/yg9Hdr66/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the positive weekend, ICP faced considerable selling pressure on Monday as sellers dragged the price to an intra-day low of $7.60. However, the price recovered thanks to strong lower-level demand and posted a marginal increase, and moved to $7.80. ICP surged past $8 on Tuesday after registering an increase of almost 4% to push above the 20-day SMA and settle at $8.11. However, it finds itself back in the red during the ongoing session after failing to go above the 50-day SMA. ICP is currently down by 0.50% as buyers struggle to keep it above the 20-day SMA and $8.\par \par \uc2 Celestia (TIA) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Celestia (TIA) registered a substantial drop of 13.42% on Friday as it fell below a key support level and the 20 and 50-day SMAs. Buyers attempted a recovery on Saturday as TIA rose by 1.58% and moved to $5.38. However, it could not push above the 50-day SMA and fell back in the red on Sunday, dropping almost 5% and settling at $5.12. Monday started on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note for TIA as sellers attempted to drag the price below $5. As a result, it fell to a day low of $4.76 before recovering and climbing back above $5. TIA eventually ended Monday at $5.08 after a marginal drop of 0.78%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/2fOujPNW/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 TIA recovered on Tuesday, registering an increase of 3.67% and settling at $5.27. However, despite the strong recovery, it could not go above the 50-day SMA. The current session sees TIA back in the red, currently down by 4.58% as buyers struggle to keep it above $5.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241031ekau0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,886 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Strong \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  inflows and sustained spot purchasing suggest that traders expect BTC to continue its uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmRlNTYtNGZlNC03MmY5LWI4MWEtNWM0MWM1MzIyYjRm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls failed to push the price to a new all-time high on Oct. 29, but a positive sign is that they have not ceded much ground to the bears on Oct. 30. This suggests that the bulls are holding on to their positions in anticipation of a move higher.\par \par \uc2 United States Bitcoin exchange-traded funds witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-trading-volume-fomo-confirmed-btc-price-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 massive inflows of $827 million on Oct. 29}}}\uc2 , according to CoinGlass data. This suggests that investors expect the sideways price action to resolve to the upside. Crypto research firm 10x Research projects {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-price-target-100000-by-jan-2025-10x-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to hit $100,000 by January 2025}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de54-95a0-7d9d-b6d6-faa0594e84be"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traders are positioning themselves for a breakout in anticipation of a Donald Trump victory in the United States presidential election on Nov. 5. However, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/donald-trump-election-bitcoin-crypto-market-price-prediction-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 caution is warranted}}}\uc2  because experienced traders often \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the rumor and sell the news.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin traders defend the $70,000 level during the pullback? Will altcoins continue their up move or enter a consolidation? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin accelerated after breaking out of the $69,520 resistance on Oct. 28. The price came close to hitting a new all-time high on Oct. 29, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de55-3de1-7fe1-8e04-1279223054d7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($67,617) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. A break and close above $73,777 will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The pattern target of the breakout from the large range is $93,554.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $70,000 and then the 20-day EMA. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip. The BTC/USDT pair may slump to the 50-day simple moving average ($64,164).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside an ascending channel pattern for the past few days. The bulls purchased the dip to the support line on Oct. 25 and cleared the 20-day EMA ($2,565) hurdle on Oct. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de55-ea18-75d2-90a0-573cee2a2ba6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line, which is likely to attract selling. If the price turns down from the resistance line, it will signal that the pair may continue to rise inside the channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to pierce the resistance line to indicate a pick-up in momentum. Such a move will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) toward the overhead resistance of $635 but are facing selling near $612.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de56-8c54-7788-bee5-960eb44ed2a3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint indicate a minor advantage to buyers. If the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA ($589), it increases the possibility of a rally to $635. Buyers may struggle to overcome this obstacle, but if they prevail, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $722.\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA is the vital support to watch out for on the downside. If this level gives way, the pair may plummet to $527.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $179 resistance on Oct. 28, but the higher levels attracted solid selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de57-2f21-7dda-b6f3-0b74924462fe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($165), which is a crucial near-term support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that the bulls continue to buy on dips. Buyers will then make one more attempt to propel the pair to $189.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break and close below the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a fall to the 50-day SMA ($151).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The attempt by the bulls to start a recovery in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is facing solid selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.53), indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de57-c729-7eaf-b19e-d3a4dec21feb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $0.50, it will suggest that the bears remain in control. The XRP/USDT pair could descend to the $0.46 to $0.41 support zone, where the bulls are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.55) to signal a comeback. The pair will then attempt a rally to $0.64, which is expected to act as a significant hurdle.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) gained momentum after breaking out of the $0.15 resistance on Oct. 28 and reached the $0.18 level on Oct. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de58-6e26-7875-a3e2-cc5d4f8389fa"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers are trying to halt the rally at $0.18, but the likelihood of a breakout increases if the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level. The DOGE/USDT pair could surge to $0.23, which is expected to behave as a formidable barrier.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $0.15, and then the 20-day EMA ($0.14). If the price rebounds off $0.15, it will indicate that the bulls have flipped the level into support. Buyers will then again attempt to resume the uptrend. Sellers will have to pull the price below the 20-day EMA to signal that the up move may be over.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $4.44 to $4.72 support zone on Oct. 25, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de59-1bf7-773b-b0de-1efa3675c75d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in the TON/USDT pair has reached the 20-day EMA ($5.12), where the bears are trying to pose a strong challenge. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink the pair below $4.44. If they succeed, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair could then sink to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price continues higher and breaks above the 50-day SMA ($5.37). The pair could rally to $6, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-metrics-suggest-bitcoin-price-will-break-new-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5 metrics suggest Bitcoin price will break new all-time highs}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the solid support at $0.31 on Oct. 25, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de59-d0ab-7be4-90c0-20d4a11ab713"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to build upon their strength by pushing and maintaining the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $0.40, which is a crucial level to watch out for. If buyers overcome this barrier, the pair could climb to $0.45 and then to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or $0.40, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) fell below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 25, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de5a-63c0-7042-a9b8-f22f6ece7869"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls started a recovery, which hit a wall at the moving averages. If the price continues lower and breaks below $24, it will signal that the bears have overpowered the bulls. That could start a downward move to $20.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers kick the AVAX/USDT pair above the moving averages, it will signal that the breakdown below the support line may have been a bear trap. That will improve the prospects of a break above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 50-day SMA ($0.000017) on Oct. 26 and reached the $0.000020 resistance on Oct. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192de5a-f783-74da-a04e-8bc2a15c702a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, Kamala Harris, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to defend the $0.000020 level, but the likelihood of a breakout increases if the bulls do not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($0.000018). If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverted H&S pattern. The pair may rise to $0.000026 and later to $0.000030.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the breakout, they will have to swiftly tug the price below the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the pair may remain stuck between $0.000013 and $0.000020 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmRlNTYtNGZlNC03MmY5LWI4MWEtNWM0MWM1MzIyYjRm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241030ekau000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
