ast, Low-Cost Cryptocurrency for Borderless Transactions\par \par \uc2 XRP is a cryptocurrency supported by the XRP Ledger. It is designed to be fast, low-cost, open, borderless, and resistant to censorship or counterfeiting. It operates on a decentralized system without a central authority, making transactions irreversible and secure. Settlements don't require a bank account. Created by \uc2 Jed McCaleb\uc2 , Arthur Britto, and \uc2 David Schwartz\uc2 , XRP was launched with an initial 100 billion supply, with 80 billion gifted to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  for further development. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  uses XRP to improve network liquidity and support the ecosystem, placing 55 billion XRP in escrow for controlled supply release. With its aim to facilitate seamless payment transfers across currencies, XRP holds potential in the current market cycle for efficient global transactions.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin: From Meme to Major Cryptocurrency Player\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) began in 2013 as a fun alternative to traditional cryptocurrencies, featuring a Shiba Inu dog meme as its logo. Unlike Bitcoin, it has no limit on supply, with 10,000 new coins mined every minute. Initially seen as a "memecoin," Dogecoin surged in value in 2021, becoming one of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap, exceeding $50 billion. This rise was fueled by social media buzz and endorsements from figures like \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 . The coin's potential lies in its widespread popularity and active community. Whether Dogecoin is attractive in the current market cycle depends on market trends and \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but its strong following continues to drive interest.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): A Sustainable Blockchain for Smart Contracts and Decentralized Apps\par \par \uc2 Cardano is a blockchain platform created for smart contracts and decentralized applications. Its native cryptocurrency, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , allows users to store value, make payments, and stake on the network. Cardano uses Ouroboros, a proof-of-stake mechanism that is more energy-efficient than traditional proof-of-work systems. The blockchain is split into two layers: one for transactions and one for smart contracts. This design aims to improve scalability, potentially handling up to a million transactions per second. In March 2021, Cardano introduced native tokens that enable secure and low-fee interactions with smart contracts. The platform's sustainable approach and technological advancements make it an attractive option in the current market cycle.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): Fast and Scalable Blockchain for Decentralized Applications\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  is a blockchain platform built for speed and scalability. It enables decentralized applications and competes with platforms like Ethereum and Cardano. \uc2 Solana\uc2  achieves high transaction speeds through its unique architecture without using sharding or second-layer solutions. The native cryptocurrency, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , is central to the ecosystem. It facilitates transactions, powers programs, and rewards participants in the network. \uc2 SOL\uc2  holds value by supporting the operation of the \uc2 Solana\uc2  ecosystem and providing access to various projects. With its high-capacity network, \uc2 Solana\uc2  aims to attract developers and investors interested in high-activity products and services. In the current market cycle, \uc2 SOL\uc2 's focus on speed and scalability makes it an attractive option in the cryptocurrency space.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 XRP, DOGE, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and \uc2 SOL\uc2  show less short-term potential. DOGEN, tailored for those pursuing luxury and success, is poised for 700% growth by presale's end, with prospects for thousand-fold returns this altcoin season. Mirroring the success of tokens like BONK, WIF, and Popcat, DOGEN offers real benefits and fosters a community of alpha leaders.\par \par \uc2 Site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dogen.meme/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://dogen.meme/}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/dogenmeme"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/dogenmeme}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/Dogen_Portal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/Dogen_Portal}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241029ekas0000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/28: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,723 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traders are attempting to break the range highs and hit $70,000. Which altcoins are following?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmQzY2ItN2Y1Yy03NGMwLWJhMWMtMGQ1NWI4ODc0Nzhk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/28: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has started the week on a positive note, with buyers pushing the price above the $69,000 overhead resistance. This signals that the up move remains intact.\par \par \uc2 One of the reasons for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strong performance has been solid buying in the United States Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. In a post on X, Bitcoin analyst Alessandro Ottaviani said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-primed-cross-1-million-btc-mark-ahead-bullish-november"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs had witnessed $3 billion in inflows}}}\uc2  in the last two weeks.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the ETF buying, the US elections and the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rate decision are likely to act as a significant trigger for the cryptocurrency markets in November.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c4-190e-7a5b-99bd-4dd6b6e8b662"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin whales seem to be using the sideways price action to accumulate more Bitcoin. A chart posted by research firm Santiment on X showed that the number of whale entities \u8212\'20\'14 wallets with 100 Bitcoin or more \u8212\'20\'14 had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/most-bullish-weekly-close-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased by 1.9% in the past two weeks}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin climb above $70,000, boosting purchases in select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) entered a corrective phase last week, but a positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to skid below the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c4-bbb2-7128-9657-873c3e4e806e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The trend remains positive as long as the price stays above the uptrend line. If the price continues higher and breaks above the 5,879 resistance, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The index could march toward 6,000 and then to 6,221.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the uptrend line. The index could drop to the breakout level of 5,670. This is a critical level to watch out for because a break below it could start a deeper correction to 5,400.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The rally in the US Dollar Index (DXY) is showing signs of tiring out near the overhead resistance of 104.80.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c5-5e16-7152-95bb-f6012232c2d8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support is at 103.93. If this level is taken out, the index could drop to the 20-day exponential moving average (103.25). Buyers are expected to defend the 20-day EMA with vigor. A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will improve the prospects of a rally above 104.80. The index may then rally to 106.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the index could drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of 102.36.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been gradually rising toward the overhead resistance of $70,000, signaling demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c6-0506-7643-91e6-66d1e263141a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the positive zone suggest that buyers have the upper hand. The $70,000 level may act as a barrier, but it is likely to be crossed. That could push the BTC/USDT pair to $72,000, where bears are likely to sell aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($66,452) is the vital support to watch out for on the downside. A break below this support will signal weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The bears will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they sink and sustain the pair below $65,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 50-day SMA ($2,504) on Oct. 25, but the bulls purchased the dip to the support line of the ascending channel pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c6-964c-74e6-af57-774e3950bdce"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($2,539), which is an important level to watch out for. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the ETH/USDT pair below the support line. If that happens, the pair could decline to the $2,150 to $2,111 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers thrust the price above the moving averages, the pair will attempt a rally to the resistance line of the channel. The bears are expected to fiercely defend the breakdown level of $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($574) on Oct. 26 and rose above the 20-day EMA ($586) on Oct. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c7-218d-7730-9107-f58a2731d5e3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the BNB/USDT pair to the overhead resistance of $635. Sellers will try to defend the $635 level with all their might, but if the bulls prevail, the rally could reach $722.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plunges below the 50-day SMA, it will indicate that bears are trying to make a comeback. The pair could then descend to the solid support at $527.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trying to rally toward the overhead resistance of the range at $210, but the bears are posing a strong challenge at $179.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c8-bb67-750c-be25-f19e1dd95a42"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not give up much ground from the current level, the possibility of a break above $179 increases. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could soar to $189, where the bears are again expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($149), indicating that the bulls are rushing to the exit.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.53) on Oct. 25 and plunged below the $0.50 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3c9-4dcf-7e76-824a-9ee3e7c77b13"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the edge. Sellers will try to sink the XRP/USDT pair to $0.46, where the buyers are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.55) to indicate that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair could then attempt a rally to the stiff overhead resistance of $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price stuck?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($0.13) on Oct. 26 and reached the overhead resistance of $0.15 on Oct. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3ca-872d-7dfe-a19c-d664489d81cf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to defend the $0.15 resistance, but the rising 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate advantage to the bulls. If buyers propel the price above $0.15, the DOGE/USDT pair could surge to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $0.15, it will signal that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then again drop to the 20-day EMA. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will open the doors for a fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.12).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the crucial support zone between $4.72 and $4.44 on Oct. 25, but the bulls are finding it difficult to push the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3cb-0cac-761d-9a57-502a03de5117"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below $4.44. If they manage to do that, the TON/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, starting a downtrend toward $3.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and rises above the moving averages. The pair could then climb to $6, which is likely to behave as a solid resistance.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.31 support on Oct. 26, but the relief rally is facing selling at the moving averages. This suggests that the bears are trying to take charge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192d3cb-b581-76ae-a457-c50dd22fcec2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Federal Reserve, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Interest Rate, Price Analysis, Market Analysis, Whale, Bitcoin ETF, ETF, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will make one more attempt to sink the price below the $0.31 support. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could resume the downtrend. The pair may slump to $0.27, which is again expected to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $0.31 with strength, it will indicate buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally above the moving averages. The pair may then travel to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmQzY2ItN2Y1Yy03NGMwLWJhMWMtMGQ1NWI4ODc0Nzhk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241028ekas000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
