ht22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) stems from its active community and ongoing improvements. Investors are optimistic about Cardano's ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) potential to rally 700%, fueled by its unique PoS consensus and unrelenting commitment to academic research. With an emphasis on security and scalability, the Cardano is well-positioned for future growth, making it an attractive option to acquire before the bull run. As more and more projects build on the Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) blockchain, demand for Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is expected to rise, solidifying its already strong market position\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu ($HINU)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/overnight-memecoin-rally-likely-to-spur-husky-inu-hinu-presale-growth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu ($HINU)}}}\uc2  recently joined the crypto scene, significantly impacting the industry. The project\u8217\'20\'19s recently launched {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/husky-inu-hinu-presale-generates-over-260000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 presale}}}\uc2  has gone very well, with the first stage selling out within days. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/husky-inus-hinu-second-presale-stage-sells-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second stage}}}\uc2  of its presale sold out, and the project is undertaking its third fundraising round with great enthusiasm. Since going live, the presale has generated over $460,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/shiba-inu-shib-and-new-best-friend-husky-inu-hinu-ready-to-rocket"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  ($HINU) entered the crypto space with a bang to compete with industry giants, including its new best friend, Shiba Inu. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 project}}}\uc2  has an Earn App in the works and a Decentralized Exchange.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu is ready to destroy every opponent\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241026ekap0000q\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,790 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Consistently strong buying in Bitcoin and altcoins suggests many cryptocurrencies will test range highs over the coming week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmM0NGUtNWE1YS03MDI2LWE5M2QtMjllZWI0ZmUxMWIw.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance near $69,000, but the bulls have kept up the pressure. As the price nears the top of the range, the bears are likely to pose a strong challenge. However, analysts expect the range-bound action to end following the result of the upcoming United States elections.\par \par \uc2 Standard Chartered Bank analyst Geoff Kendrick said in a research note that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-prediction-republican-election-impact"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could surge to $125,000}}}\uc2  by the end of the year if the Republicans sweep the \uc2 US Congress\uc2  after the Nov. 5 elections.\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projection came from Bitwise\u8217\'20\'19s head of alpha strategies, Jeff Park, who said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-head-of-alpha-strategies-bitcoin-hitting-92k-trump-election-win"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could reach $92,000}}}\uc2  if Donald Trump wins the US Presidential elections.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c449-f2fd-7cc5-9db3-729921fb8d9b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Along with Bitcoin, select analysts are turning positive on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-80k-altcoin-season-hashkey-capital-crypto-analyst-predictions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prospects of an altcoin rally}}}\uc2 . According to analysts at crypto investment firm Hashkey Capital, an \u8220\'20\'1Caltcoin season is more probable\u8221\'20\'1D when Bitcoin rallies above $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin pierce the overhead resistance at $70,000? Will altcoins follow Bitcoin higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned up from $65,000 on Oct. 23, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44a-8c6d-77ef-997f-d7bb643da94f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($66,086) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in control. That improves the prospects of a break above $70,000. The BTC/USDT pair may then rise to $72,000.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the $65,000 level is the critical support for the bulls to defend. A break and close below $65,000 could sink the pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($62,758). Such a move will suggest that the sideways price action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($2,492) on Oct. 25, indicating that the bulls are trying to form a higher low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44b-2feb-70eb-a6d6-a6472309d032"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above the resistance line, the ETH/USDT pair could reach $2,850. Sellers will try to stall the recovery at $2,850, but if the bulls do not cede ground to the bears, the possibility of a breakout increases. The pair may then start a rally to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA is the essential level to watch out for on the downside. A break and close below the 50-day SMA could start a down move to $2,330 and then to the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers have managed to maintain BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($587), indicating a positive sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44b-b53c-74c3-bddb-98b7b84f1c82"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the 20-day EMA support breaks, the BNB/USDT pair could dip to the 50-day SMA ($569). Buyers will try to defend the 50-day SMA, but the pair could drop to $527 if the bears prevail.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues higher and breaks above $612, the bulls will try to test the stiff overhead resistance of $635. The bears are expected to protect the $635 level with all their might because a break above it could drive the pair to $722.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the breakout level of $164 on Oct. 23, indicating that the bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44c-2a64-7ca5-b89b-d374be2f2ee1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up move is facing resistance near $180, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($159) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. That increases the likelihood of a rally to $189, where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then plunge to the 50-day SMA ($147).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.51 on Oct. 23, but the bulls are struggling to hold on to the higher levels, indicating selling on every minor recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44c-a1df-7cc3-ac64-ed31ab582181"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.54) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory, indicating that the bears have a slight edge. If the $0.50 support gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could descend to $0.46. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $0.46 to $0.41 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA ($0.55) is the critical overhead resistance to watch out for. A break and close above it will suggest that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the breakout level from the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44d-1928-7b90-92ce-68aa82ba6e4c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to quickly drive and maintain the price above the $0.15 overhead resistance to signal the resumption of the up move. The DOGE/USDT pair could travel to $0.17 and subsequently to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and re-enters the triangle, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the breakout. That could pull the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.11).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to strengthen their position by pulling Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) below the immediate support at $5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44d-8f63-72e9-9c6f-620d62dc34e3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the TON/USDT pair could slide to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. This is a crucial zone to watch out for because a break and close below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair could then start a downtrend to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the support zone, it will suggest demand at lower levels. A break and close above the moving averages will indicate that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-overtakes-microsoft-all-time-stock-gains-bitcoin-bet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy overtakes Microsoft in all-time stock gains as Bitcoin bet pays off}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped below the moving averages on Oct. 23, and the bears are trying to sink the price below $0.33 on Oct. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44e-18c9-7f66-b957-f88f02e6086d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the support gives way, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the bottom of the range at $0.31. Buyers are expected to defend this level aggressively. A solid rebound off $0.31 will indicate that the range-bound action remains intact. Buyers will gain strength on a break and close above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, a weak rebound off $0.31 increases the risk of a breakdown. If that happens, the pair may plummet to $0.27, signaling the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($27.37) on Oct. 24, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44e-a8fb-792d-86e2-194f7ddfb8fb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the support line, where the buyers are expected to step in. If the price rebounds off the support line and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may spend some more time inside the triangle.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the support line, it will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls. That may start a downward move to $20 and thereafter to $17.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day EMA ($0.000018).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c44f-2add-7f70-af77-df2bf7154ac8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Congress, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If buyers maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, the SHIB/USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance at $0.000020. A break and close above $0.000020 could signal the start of a new up move toward $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price maintains below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.000016).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmM0NGUtNWE1YS03MDI2LWE5M2QtMjllZWI0ZmUxMWIw.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241025ekap000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 757 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price reaches all-time lows against Bitcoin amid reducing network growth.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has displayed weakness this week after falling 7.4% over the last 72 hours to trade at $0.338 on Oct. 25.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  has seen \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  undo all the gains made on Sunday, Oct. 20, citing a shift in \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  toward the layer-1 token. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is down 2.3% over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c315-9fc2-770d-b1f4-059591671a8e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/92GbPy1q/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s drop mirrors the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cloud that continues to engulf many altcoins in the market.\par \par \uc2 For instance, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market capitalization, has dropped by approximately 2% over the last 24 hours, while Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/aqKcexq8/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has lost 2.7% of its value over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the catalysts driving {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-worst-week-may-2021-ada-price-rebound-40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price}}}\uc2  down today.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price hits all-time lows against Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Cardano has underperformed Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) throughout 2024, with BTC rallying approximately 52% year-to-date compared to \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 43% decline in their respective US dollar pairs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c317-1f42-7e4c-aada-099c4d69c98b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD vs. BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/RDLPEu1G/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has trended lower against Bitcoin in 2024, reducing investor confidence in the token.\par \par \uc2 High network activity and general positive market sentiment during the 2021 bull cycle saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC ratio rally 895% from 0.00000588 on Dec. 21, 2020, to reach an all-time high of 0.00005847 on Aug. 23, 2021.\par \par \uc2 Since then, the ratio has been on a freefall, dropping 91.6% to reach a near-all-time low of $0.00000503 on Oct. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c317-9341-7d15-8d2c-1ee41e834374"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC ratio. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ecpCnR5s/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s underperformance can be attributed to diminishing network activity, which leads to reduced demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens within the ecosystem. This negatively impacts the price.\par \par \uc2 Reducing network activity underpins \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \par \uc2 The C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ardano network}}}\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/danogo_2023/status/1767732876072927285"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 witnessed}}}\uc2  a remarkable drop in user engagement over the last six months. Data from IntoTheBlock shows that the number of active addresses on the Cardano blockchain has dropped from 71,270 on March 6 to the current value of 25,680. S\par \par \uc2 Similarly, new addresses have declined from 24,860 wallets to 5,920 over the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c318-2507-75db-ab98-b57323d3ea21"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Addresses on the Cardano network. Source: IntoTheBloc\par \par \uc2 Additional data from DefiLlama reveals that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) on Cardano has also been on a downtrend over the last six months.\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows that the TVL fell by over 55% from about $480.72 million in March to approximately $214.8 million at the time of publication.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c318-9872-7cbb-ab25-ccb7c14a4fee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 TVL on Cardano. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 This drop in network TVL is not solely confined to the Cardano blockchain. The total value locked in DeFil protocols built on Cardano has also contracted significantly, as shown in the figure below.\par \par \uc2 Among the leading projects in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem, Indigo\u8217\'20\'19s collateralized debt protocol stands out, with its TVL dropping by 15% over the last month. The decentralized exchange Minswap has seen its TVL drop by 11% over the last month to $50 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c319-04b3-71b7-9c0c-f06a5def9fe0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of top DeFi protocols on Cardano\par \par \uc2 The declining network activity and reducing TVL on Cardano indicate diminished user interaction, decreasing demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens and negatively impacting its price.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-integrates-bitcoin-os-to-enable-trustless-btc-in-de-fi-apps"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano unlocks $1.3T Bitcoin liquidity with BitcoinOS bridge integration}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s drop today precedes a period of growing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence between its price and the relative strength index (RSI).\par \par \uc2 Notably, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price rose between Sept. 17 and Oct. 20, forming higher lows. But, in the same period, its daily RSI descended, forming lower lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192c319-b8b3-7c6b-8082-486f9d1c1ec4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, SEC, Markets, Cardano, Tech Analysis, Market Analysis, Altcoin Watch}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gdQwu2oM/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As a rule of technical analysis, a divergence between rising prices and a falling \uc2 RSI\uc2  indicates weakness in the prevailing uptrend, prompting traders to sell more at local highs.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241025ekap0005n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
