\par\par \b \uc2 3 Altcoins Expected to Soar in the Bull Run\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 912 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 October 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ($BTC) Expected to Soar as Strong Demand Sets In}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin ($DOGE) Expected to Surge}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu ($HINU): Leveraging the Power of Solana}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano ($\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ): Backed by Solid Infrastructure}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has been keeping everyone on their toes recently, with Bitcoin ($BTC) leading the charge. A notable market run is expected, and significant gains will be made with it. While $BTC remains the undisputed leader, several altcoins are geared for immense growth.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ($BTC) Expected to Soar as Strong Demand Sets In\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) continues as the undisputed leader of the cryptocurrency world and maintains its position as the most trusted \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 . As the dominant store of value, BTC remains the go-to choice for institutional investors. Many are questioning whether {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  can continue to dominate the market in the long term and whether tension in the Middle East and the upcoming US elections would sway the price. \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2 , former BitMEX CEO, predicts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/experts-expect-bitcoin-btc-to-rise-amid-middle-east-tension-3-altcoins-expected-to-follow-similar-path"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  will \u8220\'20\'1Crise stupendously\u8221\'20\'1D as tension in the Middle East intensifies.\par \par \uc2 Pauline Shangett, CMO of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://changenow.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ChangeNOW}}}\uc2 , also commented on $BTC\u8217\'20\'19s future:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMore and more people recognize Bitcoin as a hedge against inflation and a store of value. As $BTC approaches its maximum supply limit, its price trajectory is set for significant upward momentum.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ($DOGE) Expected to Surge\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ($DOGE), the top {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/top-crypto-performers-of-2024-blockdag-toncoin-cardano-dogecoin-and-injective"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 memecoin}}}\uc2  by market cap according to CoinMarketCap, is no stranger to market rallies. The coin, which started as a joke, has become a household name in the crypto industry thanks to a strong community, and many experts believe the Dogecoin price is poised for yet another big move in this bull run. $DOGE displayed remarkable growth as it transitioned to a legitimate investment opportunity with great utility. Despite recent market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/dogecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $DOGE}}}\uc2  strengthened after recovering nearly 18% over the past week.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin remains a favourite among retail investors, mainly due to its accessibility, strong presence on social media, and robust community support. $DOGE is often influenced by major announcements from influencers or market sentiment, which can lead to sudden surges. As investors head into the next crypto bull run, expectations are high that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/dogecoin-price-prediction-doge-price-rally-to-lead-crypto-bull-run-alongside-pepe-and-wltq-for-90000-gain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $DOGE}}}\uc2  will experience a rally, with some experts predicting gains of over 90,000%.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu ($HINU): Leveraging the Power of Solana\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/3-altcoins-to-purchase-as-bitcoin-btc-soars-during-uptober"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  was created to add more value and utility to its holders by leveraging the power of the Solana blockchain. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/shiba-inus-best-friend-husky-inu-hinu-celebrates-presale-success"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  is working hard to build a platform that fits its purpose. The project\u8217\'20\'19s recently launched {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/husky-inu-hinu-presale-generates-over-260000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 presale}}}\uc2  has gone very well, with the first stage selling out within days. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/husky-inus-hinu-second-presale-stage-sells-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second stage}}}\uc2  of its presale sold out, and the project is undertaking its third fundraising round with great enthusiasm. Since going live, the presale has generated nearly $459,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/a-strategic-investment-in-these-3-altcoins-now-could-soon-pay-off-handsomely"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s}}}\uc2  presale success is no surprise, given what the platform has in store. The project plans to launch its Earn App and Decentralized Exchange. Husky Inu\u8217\'20\'19s Earn App will reward users with $HINU tokens for engaging with the project and completing simple tasks such as liking, reposting, and sharing content. The project\u8217\'20\'19s Decentralized Exchange will facilitate decentralized trading, thereby improving the utility and value for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/top-memecoins-to-invest-in-hinu-shib-floki-and-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $HINU}}}\uc2  holders. Beyond its grand future plans, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/how-to-buy-husky-inu-hinu-tokens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $HINU}}}\uc2  assures it prioritizes a reliable token ecosystem maintained through a well-set-out distribution model and capped token supply. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/how-to-buy-husky-inu-hinu-presale-tokens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $HINU}}}\uc2  has a capped token supply of 100 billion and boasts a deflationary quality. The deflationary aspect means that 50% of all platform fees collected from the upcoming Husky Inu Exchange and DEX will be used to buy and burn $HINU tokens to reduce the circulating supply of $HINU.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Backed by Solid Infrastructure\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardano.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  is a blockchain platform that provides a secure and scalable infrastructure to develop dApps and smart contracts. The Cardano blockchain was created through a rigorous research-driven approach and focuses on scalability, sustainability, and interoperability to address the limitations of existing blockchain technologies. It is a prominent third-generation blockchain that prioritizes technological concerns like sustainability, scalability, and security. It is one of the most sophisticated and effective blockchain systems owing to its Design For Telecom (DFT) architecture and unique proof of stake (PoS) consensus mechanism, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardano.org/ouroboros/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ouroboros}}}\uc2 . Ouroboros ensure network security and energy efficiency by allowing participants to earn rewards through staking the platform\u8217\'20\'19s native token, $\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . $\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  serves multiple purposes within Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem and can be used for transactions and participating in platform governance through voting proposals and upgrades.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano ($\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is a formidable player in the crypto space, recognized for its solid fundamentals and innovative blockchain approach. The recent surge in interest around Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) stems from its active community and ongoing improvements. Investors are optimistic about Cardano's ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) potential to rally 700%, fueled by its unique PoS consensus and commitment to academic research. With an emphasis on security and scalability, the altcoin is well-positioned for future growth, making it an attractive option for diversifying cryptocurrency portfolios. As more and more projects build on the Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) blockchain, demand for Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is expected to rise, solidifying its market position.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241024ekan0000i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s pullback is nearing the breakout level of $65,000, which is likely to witness solid buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmJhNDItODk4OS03N2RjLWI3YzctMGU5ODNiMmY3YTAy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery attempt on Oct. 22 met with solid selling pressure from the bears, pulling the price near $66,000 on Oct. 23. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s pullback led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-79m-outflow-ends-2-week-bull-run-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net outflows of $79.1 million}}}\uc2  from United States-based Bitcoin exchange-traded funds on Oct. 22. It was the first net negative inflow since Oct. 10, according to Farside Investors data.\par \par \uc2 Despite the near-term correction, analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-action-donald-trump-united-states-election-odds-crypto-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin rally after the US Presidential election}}}\uc2 . FalconX head of research David Lawant told \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  that Bitcoin was \u8220\'20\'1Clikely to perform well\u8221\'20\'1D irrespective of the election outcome.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba37-2b69-758e-b1d7-8772e3200eda"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Veteran investor Paul Tudor Jones told CNBC that he had \u8220\'20\'1Csome basket of gold, Bitcoin, commodities and Nasdaq [technology stocks]\u8221\'20\'1D as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paul-tudor-jones-all-roads-lead-inflation-long-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 after the US elections}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Call roads lead to inflation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s near-term support hold? Could altcoins start a recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has returned to the 20-day exponential moving average ($65,526), an essential near-term support to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba37-b6a6-713a-a4b1-9f491eb10b5d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will indicate aggressive buying on dips, signaling a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. Buyers will then make one more attempt to drive the BTC/USDT pair above $70,000. If they can pull it off, the rally could stretch to $72,000. Sellers are expected to pose a strong challenge in the $72,000 to $73,777 zone.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will weaken the positive momentum. The pair may then slump to the 50-day simple moving average ($62,295). That will indicate continued range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) re-entered the symmetrical triangle on Oct. 22, indicating that the markets had rejected the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba38-5607-7834-9782-7e913e645fdd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Selling accelerated on Oct. 23, and the price broke below the 20-day EMA ($2,568). There is minor support at the 50-day SMA ($2,487), but if the level fails to hold, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $2,400 and then $2,330.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The bulls will again try to drive the price to $2,850, which is likely to behave as a strong barrier.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($585), which is an important support to watch out for in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba38-fc66-7896-8195-756828ad6755"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price stays above the 20-day EMA on a closing basis, it will indicate that the bulls are defending the level. That will increase the likelihood of a rally to the overhead resistance of $635, which is likely to act as a formidable barrier.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price closes below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are booking profits. The BNB/USDT pair may then slide to the 50-day SMA ($565) and later to the solid support at $527. Such a move will suggest that the pair extends its stay inside the $460 to $635 range.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the breakout level of $164, but the bulls are struggling to start a rally. The failure to push the price above $172 may strengthen the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba39-8d8d-7015-9604-1ed2201007e9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will then try to pull the price back into the triangle and trap the aggressive bulls. If that happens, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($155). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to start the up move by pushing the pair above $172. If they succeed, the pair may rally to $189.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to drag the pair to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on Oct. 22, indicating that the bears are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba3a-1dc4-7839-a915-aa01398f34f7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could decline to the strong support at $0.50. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it will open the doors for a further slide to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.55) to signal strength. The pair could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) toward the breakout level from the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba3a-b7dc-7f9c-bba0-7cdeef826ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.12) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought territory indicate an advantage to buyers. If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the resistance line with strength, it will signal buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally above $0.15. The DOGE/USDT pair may climb to $0.17 and later to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and re-enters the triangle. The pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($0.11).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade below the moving averages, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba3b-4e84-7ae3-a220-d14256f9983d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $5 level is the immediate support to watch out for. If this level cracks, the TON/USDT pair could test the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the support zone because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to propel the price above the moving averages. The pair will then attempt a rally to $7. Sellers will try to halt the recovery at $6, but the level is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-macd-first-bullish-btc-price-signal-since-october-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin MACD prints first \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  BTC price signal since October 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the tight range between $0.33 and $0.37, signaling a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba3b-f39d-7817-a27a-f0a53dd94cdb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  near 50 suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may spend some more time inside the range. If the price breaks below the moving averages, the bears will try to build upon their advantage by sinking the pair below $0.33. If they manage to do that, the pair could descend to the vital support at $0.31.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the rises from the moving averages, the bulls will try to overcome the barrier at $0.37. If they succeed, the pair could reach $0.40, where the sellers are likely to mount a solid defense.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba3c-8cd3-7722-8030-d36887da45a5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($27.52) and the RSI just below the midpoint do not signal a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price skids below the 50-day SMA ($26.27), the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could test the support line.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to buy the dip to the support line. If the price turns up sharply from the support line, it will indicate that the pair may remain inside the triangle. Contrarily, a break below the support line will clear the path for a fall to $20 and later to $17.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to start a rebound off the 20-day EMA ($0.000018) in Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) increases the risk of a breakdown.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192ba3d-22cb-702a-bea9-b773a4122432"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price closes below the 20-day EMA, the SHIB/USDT pair could plunge to the 50-day SMA ($0.000016). That suggests the pair may remain inside the $0.000012 to $0.000020 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to maintain their advantage, they will have to swiftly start a bounce off the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to $0.000020, where the bears are expected to sell aggressively.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmJhNDItODk4OS03N2RjLWI3YzctMGU5ODNiMmY3YTAy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241023ekan000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
