\par\par \b \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2  Predicts Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Will Surpass BTC and ETH but This Hybrid Blockchain Emerges as One to Beat, Eyeing Dogecoin Spot\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 688 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 October 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DTX Exchange (DTX): New Hybrid Blockchain to Watch}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ): Flipping BTC and ETH; Impossible or Not?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE): 32% Weekly Gain}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto landscape is where impossible isn\u8217\'20\'19t in the lexicon\u8212\'20\'14it is filled with surprises and Hoskinson\u8217\'20\'19s latest remark sparks discussion. The founder of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , expressed his belief\u8212\'20\'14termed bias by many\u8212\'20\'14that the network will grow larger than Bitcoin and Ethereum. His reasons hinged on the Voltaire era, expected to give \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  a competitive edge.\par \par \uc2 While this was enough to stir discussions, investors have been doubling down on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dtxexchange.com/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=iykyk&utm_campaign=53"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DTX Exchange (DTX)}}}\uc2  instead, termed a wild card in this bull run. This hybrid blockchain and trading platform has been hailed as the next big thing or the token to beat. Its unique approach to trading makes it a strong contender against top altcoins, including Dogecoin (DOGE).\par \par \uc2 DTX Exchange (DTX): New Hybrid Blockchain to Watch\par \par \uc2 DTX Exchange (DTX) is a novel Layer-1 hybrid blockchain that aims to bridge the gap between decentralized and traditional finance. It will integrate conventional financial instruments like stocks, ETFs, forex, bonds and commodities with cutting-edge Web3 products.\par \par \uc2 Further, its one-stop trading platform will combine the best elements of centralized and decentralized exchanges. This will put it at the forefront of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fortunebusinessinsights.com/online-trading-platform-market-104934"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $10 billion global trading market}}}\uc2 , with some of its competitive advantages being wallet-based trading, non-custodial storage of assets and over 120,000 asset classes for trading.\par \par \uc2 As it races toward adoption, industry experts hail it as one of the new DeFi projects to watch. In addition to its imminent transformation of the wider trading scene, its upside potential is largely unrivaled, poised to overtake Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Dogecoin (DOGE). Moreover, at a token price of $0.08 in the fourth ICO round and having raised over $5.3 million in presale, analysts project a staggering 75x gain after listing.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Flipping BTC and ETH; Impossible or Not?\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is a proof-of-stake (PoS) blockchain platform. Its vision is to bring about positive global change through blockchain technology\u8212\'20\'14a society that is more secure, transparent and fair.\par \par \uc2 During the Argentina Summit, Cardano founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2  stated that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coingape.com/charles-hoskinson-says-cardano-will-flip-bitcoin-and-ethereum-heres-when/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  would surpass}}}\uc2  Ethereum (ETH) and Bitcoin (BTC) in ten and twenty years, respectively. He firmly believes in the network\u8217\'20\'19s superior technology, especially its decentralized governance\u8212\'20\'14the Voltaire Era.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Cardano price has been showing positive \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiments: a 7% jump in the weekly timeframe. It changes hands above $0.36, with a Cardano price prediction suggesting a weekly close above $0.4\u8212\'20\'14one of the altcoins to watch.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE): 32% Weekly Gain\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) is a top meme and one of the leading altcoins. It leads the memecoin market as the pioneering fun-themed cryptocurrency. The dog-inspired altcoin ranks among the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market size, behind Ethereum and Solana and ahead of Cardano and Toncoin.\par \par \uc2 The past few days have been explosive for Dogecoin (DOGE). The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/dogecoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin price}}}\uc2  gained over 32% on the weekly chart, retailing above $0.14. Despite new meme narratives springing up\u8212\'20\'14AI memes as the latest\u8212\'20\'14it hasn\u8217\'20\'19t left the spotlight.\par \par \uc2 According to forecasts, it is on track to lead the next meme craze. With another meme rally around the corner, DOGE isn\u8217\'20\'19t just an altcoin to watch; it is among the best cryptos to invest in.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , the founder of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), is unsurprisingly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the network, predicting it will overtake Bitcoin (BTC) and Ethereum (ETH) in the coming decades. Meanwhile, given DTX Exchange\u8217\'20\'19s hybrid blockchain, its novelty makes it a more compelling pick ahead of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Dogecoin (DOGE).\par \par \uc2 Learn more:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://presale.dtxexchange.com/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=iykyk&utm_campaign=53"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Buy Presale}}}\par \par \uc2 Visit DTX Website\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/DTXExchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join The DTX Community}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241023ekam0000a\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,861 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bulls are defending the $66,500 to $65,000 zone and this could trigger a continuation rally in altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmIwMDItMTQwZS03YTBlLWIzOTEtMWI2NGY4MDM3MDIx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has slipped below $67,000 after closing last week above $69,000, its strongest close since the start of June. However, the fall has not scared away the investors. According to Farside Investors data, United States-based Bitcoin exchange-traded funds witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrocks-ibit-leads-spot-bitcoin-etfs-with-329-million-inflow-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows of $294.3 million on Oct. 21}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Usually, after the price spends a long time in a range, it needs a strong trigger to break out from the sideways price action. The upcoming United States elections could act as a catalyst for a new trending move in Bitcoin. Many believe that a victory by the former US president and Republican nominee Donald Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-election-win-bitcoin-100k-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could propel Bitcoin higher}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3bd-efdf-78de-beaa-a1c453660d77"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term picture remains intact, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-3-us-sellers-sub-65k-btc-price-targets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 short-term is showing signs of weakness}}}\uc2 . Popular X account Emperor told its followers that a drop to $62,000 to $63,000 could be a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins bounce off the current levels, or will they fall further? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) is in an uptrend, but the rally is facing minor resistance at 5,878. The price could correct to the 20-day exponential moving average (5,774).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3be-9b36-7328-a263-8253183dbbcc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with force, it will signal that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the index to 6,000. Sellers will try to halt the rally at 6,000, but if the bulls prevail, the next stop could be 6,221.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break below the 20-day EMA will weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The index could then dive to the 50-day simple moving average (5,652).\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) rose vertically after breaking out of the 101 level on Oct. 1. Buyers continued the momentum and pushed the price above the 103.54 resistance on Oct. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3bf-448d-7d9c-8fb4-fc1333b80e42"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to tug the price back below the 103.54 level on Oct. 18, but the bulls held their ground. Buyers have kicked the price above the near-term resistance of 103.87, opening the doors for a rally to 105.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the short term if the price turns down sharply and breaks below 103.42. The index may then slump to the 20-day EMA (102.75). Sellers will have to sink the index below the 20-day EMA to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down sharply from the overhead resistance of $70,000, indicating that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3bf-e947-7e8b-ba75-fcb09ca63540"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $66,500 to $65,000 zone is likely to act as a support on the downside. If the price rebounds off the support zone with strength, it will signal a higher low formation. That will improve the prospects of a rally to $72,000. Buyers are expected to face significant resistance in the $72,000 to $73,777 zone.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum will weaken on a break and close below $65,000. The BTC/USDT pair could then sink to the 50-day SMA ($62,117).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on Oct. 20, but the bulls failed to push the price to $2,850.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3c0-885d-799a-9e50-d8db4fef5672"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to yank the price below the 20-day EMA ($2,573). If they can pull it off, it will signal that the markets have rejected the breakout. The ETH/USDT pair could then slide to the 50-day SMA ($2,485).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will indicate buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to propel the pair above the $2,850 resistance and start the rally to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $612 on Oct. 21, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the overhead resistance at $635.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3c1-2257-7360-98a5-cba80ff78722"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($585). If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will signal a positive sentiment. Buyers will then again attempt to overcome the barrier at $635. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could accelerate toward $722.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the 20-day EMA cracks, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($564) and later to $527. That will indicate the pair may remain stuck inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) closed above the $164 overhead resistance on Oct. 20, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3c1-cb86-7d89-84ba-60fc0be78851"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are putting up a tough fight and are trying to pull the price back below $164. If bulls successfully defend the $164 level, it increases the likelihood of a rally to $189.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price dips and maintains below $164, it suggests that the markets have rejected the breakout. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then descend to the 20-day EMA ($153). If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to start the up move by pushing the pair above $172.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the uptrend line on Oct. 20, but the bulls could not push the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.56).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3c2-6b3c-711d-ba26-88dbb789e4e3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to seize the advantage by pulling the price below the uptrend line. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.50. Buyers have protected the $0.50 level on two previous occasions. Hence, they will again try to do that.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the uptrend line and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bulls are back in the game. The pair will then try to reach the overhead resistance of $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysis-lower-risk-aversion-retail-demand-adds-13"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin analysis sees 'lower risk aversion' as retail demand adds 13%}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above the symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 18, but the rally is facing resistance near $0.15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3c3-0811-75c8-97af-ef4edd030eed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could retest the breakout level from the triangle. If the price rebounds off the resistance line, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the level into support. Buyers will then again try to thrust the price above $0.15. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.12). The pair may then plummet to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers have failed to push Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3c3-acab-72f1-82e0-e484c1f0a6e8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to drag the price below the $5 support. If they can pull it off, the pair may retest the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. This is an essential level to watch out for because a break and close below the zone will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, starting a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly drive the TON/USDT pair above the moving averages. The pair could then rise to $6 and subsequently to $7, which is likely to act as a solid hurdle.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the moving averages on Oct. 20, but the bears have not allowed the price to sustain above the $0.37 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192b3c4-3b8b-7285-95d9-a193184400e2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Donald Trump, Leverage, Bitcoin Futures, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.37, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price skids below the moving averages, the bears will try to sink the pair below $0.33. If they do that, the pair may decline to $0.31, where the buyers are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmIwMDItMTQwZS03YTBlLWIzOTEtMWI2NGY4MDM3MDIx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241022ekam000bc\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (ADA) AND ("market reaction" OR "price drop" OR "price rise" OR "volatility" OR "bullish" OR "bearish" OR "investor sentiment" OR "regulation" OR "ETF approval" OR "crypto ban" OR "crypto adoption" OR "digital\u160\'00\'A0asset")\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt